    "longDescription": "<h2>Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra – Unlocked</h2>\n<p>Step into the future with the Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra, Samsung’s most advanced flagship in the 2024 Galaxy S series lineup. Crafted with a premium build, titanium frame, and cutting-edge technology, this powerhouse is designed to deliver performance, durability, and elegance.</p>\n<p>At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we bring you the Samsung S24 Ultra Unlocked at the best price in the UK, fully tested, verified, and ready to power your everyday life with unmatched style and speed.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re looking for unbeatable Samsung S24 Ultra deals, exploring the latest Samsung S24 Ultra price UK, or simply upgrading to a phone that outperforms the competition, this device is the perfect choice.</p>\n<h2>Premium Build – Stronger, Sleeker, Smarter</h2>\n<p>Samsung has redefined durability with the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-s-series/\">Galaxy S24</a> Ultra. Encased in a Titanium frame and reinforced with Corning Gorilla Glass Armor, it offers 4x stronger protection compared to regular smartphone glass.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dimensions: 162.3 x 79 x 8.6 mm</li>\n<li>Weight: 233g – balanced yet robust</li>\n<li>Design: Semi-matte satin finish for a sleek, tactile feel</li>\n<li>The S24 Ultra doesn’t just look premium – it feels like the future.</li>\n<li>Immersive 6.8\" AMOLED 2X Display with S-Pen</li>\n<li>Enjoy visuals like never before on the Dynamic LTPO AMOLED 2X 6.8-inch display, offering:</li>\n<li>Resolution: 1440 x 3120 pixels (505ppi sharpness)</li>\n<li>Peak Brightness: 2600 nits (perfect under sunlight)</li>\n<li>Adaptive Refresh Rate: 1Hz – 120Hz for smooth scrolling</li>\n<li>HDR10+ Support: For cinematic viewing</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Plus, the iconic S-Pen makes note-taking, artwork, and productivity effortless. From remote photo capturing to hands-free navigation, it’s more than a stylus – it’s your creative tool.</p>\n<h2>Performance – Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 Power</h2>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra is built for those who demand speed and multitasking. Equipped with the Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 (4nm, 8-core) processor and 12GB RAM, it delivers lightning-fast performance.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Storage: 256GB, 512GB, 1TB UFS 4.0 (expandable with larger variants available)</li>\n<li>Multitasking: Run multiple apps smoothly without lag</li>\n<li>Gaming &amp; Work: Optimised for both entertainment and productivity</li>\n<li>This phone isn’t just powerful – it’s future-proof.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Camera System – Quad Lenses, Endless Possibilities</h2>\n<p>The S24 Ultra camera array is designed for creators, professionals, and everyday users who want the best shot in any condition:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>200MP Wide (f/1.7) – Ultra-clear, sharp detail</li>\n<li>50MP Periscope Telephoto (5x Optical Zoom) – Capture from afar</li>\n<li>10MP Telephoto (3x Optical Zoom) – Balanced mid-range shots</li>\n<li>12MP Ultra-Wide (120°) – For landscapes &amp; group shots</li>\n<li>12MP Selfie Camera with 4K Video – Share your best moments</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Video recording is equally impressive:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>8K at 24/30fps</li>\n<li>4K at up to 120fps</li>\n<li>Super Slow-Mo 1080p at 960fps</li>\n<li>Every shot is vivid, sharp, and natural – a true rival to professional cameras.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>AI Features – Galaxy AI in Action</h2>\n<p>Samsung has integrated next-gen Galaxy AI into the S24 Ultra, giving you tools that transform how you use your phone:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Generative Edit &amp; Fill: Edit photos, remove objects, or extend backgrounds with AI</li>\n<li>Live Translation: Translate calls and texts instantly across languages</li>\n<li>Circle to Search: Instantly search by circling any part of your screen</li>\n<li>Chat Assist: Smarter text suggestions for messaging and emails</li>\n<li>Transcript &amp; Summarise: Convert voice recordings into text summaries</li>\n<li>With on-device AI processing, you get smart tools without compromising speed or privacy.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Battery Life That Lasts</h2>\n<p>The 5000mAh battery with 45W fast charging and 15W wireless charging ensures you stay connected all day.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Charge to 65% in just 30 minutes</li>\n<li>Smart battery optimisation with Galaxy AI</li>\n<li>Wireless PowerShare for sharing battery with accessories</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra Price UK &amp; Deals</h2>\n<p>At launch, the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung</a> Galaxy S24 Ultra price UK started at £1,249 for the 256GB version. At iRepair Mobiles UK, you can now get the Samsung S24 Ultra Unlocked at the best market price, giving you top quality without overspending.</p>\n<p>We offer:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Samsung S24 Ultra deals UK-wide</li>\n<li>Unlocked models compatible with all major UK networks</li>\n<li>1-Year Warranty included for peace of mind</li>\n<li>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</li>\n<li>Trusted Shop: UK’s #1 Mobile Phone &amp; Accessories store</li>\n<li>Condition: Used (Different Options)</li>\n<li>Unlocked &amp; Ready: Works on EE, Vodafone, O2, Three &amp; more</li>\n<li>Secure Payments &amp; Fast Shipping: Delivered to your door</li>\n<li>Expert Support: Backed by a team of repair &amp; mobile experts</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>FAQs About Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra</h2>\n<p><strong>1. Is the Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, this model is factory unlocked, meaning it works with all UK and international networks.</p>\n<p><strong>2. What is included with the S24 Ultra?</strong></p>\n<p>You’ll receive the Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra (Unlocked), with charging accessories and a 1-Year Warranty.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Does the Samsung S24 Ultra support 5G?</strong></p>\n<p>Absolutely – the S24 Ultra is 5G ready, ensuring blazing-fast internet speeds.</p>\n<p><strong>4. How is the S24 Ultra different from the S23 Ultra?</strong></p>\n<p>It features a titanium frame, brighter AMOLED display, Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 processor, and improved AI features for editing, translation, and smart assistance.</p>\n<p><strong>5. What colours are available?</strong></p>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra comes in Titanium Black, Gray, Violet, Blue, Green, and Orange (availability may vary).</p>\n<p><strong>6. Does the phone come with a warranty?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, we include a 12-month warranty with every purchase from iRepair Mobiles UK.</p>\n<p><strong>7. Can I trade in my old phone?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes – iRepair Mobiles UK offers trade-in and upgrade deals. Contact us for details.</p>\n<h2>Final Word – Upgrade to Excellence</h2>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra is not just another phone – it’s the most powerful Samsung ever built. With its premium build, pro-grade camera system, Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 performance, Galaxy AI, and immersive display, it redefines what a smartphone can do.</p>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, you get the best Samsung S24 Ultra deals, trusted service, and fast delivery. Secure yours today and step into the future of mobile technology.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
