    "longDescription": "<h2>Product Description</h2>\n<p>Looking for the ultimate flagship <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">smartphone</a>? The Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra is more than just a device – it’s a statement of power, durability, and cutting-edge technology. Announced in February 2023 and built for modern-day life, this 6.8-inch 5G powerhouse delivers everything you need – from breathtaking visuals to professional-grade photography, next-level performance, and all-day battery life.</p>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we bring you the Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra (Unlocked) at the best value. Whether you’re upgrading from an older Galaxy or searching for unbeatable Samsung S23 Ultra deals, you’re guaranteed quality, warranty, and peace of mind when shopping with us.</p>\n<h2>Striking Design &amp; Ultra-Durable Build</h2>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra doesn’t just perform – it impresses. Built with Corning Gorilla Glass Victus 2 and an armoured aluminium frame, it’s a device designed to withstand everyday life while keeping a sleek, premium look. With IP68 dust and water resistance, you can enjoy peace of mind against accidental splashes, drops, and particles.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dimensions: 163.4 × 78.1 × 8.9 mm</li>\n<li>Weight: 233 g – solid yet comfortable in hand</li>\n<li>Colours Available: Lime, Phantom Black, Cream, Green &amp; more</li>\n<li>The design isn’t just stylish; it’s crafted for longevity, comfort, and everyday usability.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Immersive 6.8\" Dynamic AMOLED 2X Display</h2>\n<p>Experience visuals like never before with the 6.8-inch Full HD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X display. Featuring adaptive Vision Booster technology, your screen automatically adjusts for bright outdoor conditions or low-light environments, ensuring a seamless viewing experience anytime, anywhere.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>QHD+ Resolution: Sharp, vibrant, and cinematic quality</li>\n<li>120Hz Refresh Rate: Ultra-smooth scrolling, gaming, and streaming</li>\n<li>Adaptive Brightness: Comfortable on your eyes in all conditions</li>\n<li>Every scroll, tap, and swipe feels fluid, making the Samsung S23 Ultra the gold standard for display quality.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Professional Camera System – Shoot Like a Pro</h2>\n<p>For creators, travellers, and everyday users alike, the Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra camera is a game-changer. With its quad-lens system and AI-enhanced Nightography features, you can capture life in its best detail – day or night.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>200MP Wide Rear Camera with anti-glare lens + laser auto-focus for unmatched clarity</li>\n<li>12MP Ultra-Wide Sensor for landscapes and group shots</li>\n<li>10MP Telephoto Lens (3x Optical Zoom) + 10MP Telephoto Lens (10x Optical Zoom) for crisp close-ups</li>\n<li>12MP Dual Pixel Front Camera for stunning selfies and seamless video calls</li>\n</ul>\n<p>No matter the lighting, the Enhanced AI ensures sharp, vivid, and realistic results. From low-light night shots to ultra-smooth 4K cinematic videos, your content will always stand out.</p>\n<h2>Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 Processor &amp; 12GB RAM – Pure Power</h2>\n<p>Powered by the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 (4nm) processor with 12GB RAM, the Samsung S23 Ultra is a true performance beast. Whether you’re a gamer, streamer, or multitasker, you’ll enjoy higher frame rates, sharper graphics, and lightning-fast speeds.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CPU: 1× Cortex-X3 (3.36GHz), 2× Cortex-A715, 2× Cortex-A710, 3× Cortex-A510</li>\n<li>GPU: Adreno 740 – smooth gaming &amp; creative workloads</li>\n<li>Cooling System: Keeps performance steady under heavy use</li>\n<li>Storage: 256GB, 512GB, 1TB – plenty of space for photos, apps, videos &amp; files</li>\n<li>With Android 13, regular updates, and future-proofed hardware, this phone is built to last for years.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>All-Day 5000mAh Battery + 45W Super-Fast Charging</h2>\n<p>Never worry about running out of power again. The 5000mAh battery ensures all-day performance, and with 45W Super-Fast Charging (charger sold separately), you can go from 0% to 65% in under 30 minutes.</p>\n<p>Features include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Wireless Charging Support</li>\n<li>Reverse Wireless Charging (charge accessories like earbuds)</li>\n<li>Smart Power Management to optimise energy usage</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Exclusive S Pen Experience</h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung</a> S23 Ultra comes with an integrated S Pen, making it ideal for professionals, creatives, and students. From note-taking to precision sketching and document editing, the S Pen gives you more control and flexibility than ever before.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy From iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK – the #1 mobile phone &amp; accessories shop in the UK, we guarantee:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Condition – Different options</li>\n<li>Unlocked to All Networks – freedom to choose any UK/Worldwide carrier</li>\n<li>12-Month Warranty – guaranteed quality &amp; reliability</li>\n<li>Free Next-Day Delivery (Order by 3PM, Mon–Fri)</li>\n<li>Eco-Friendly Promise – positive impact by reducing e-waste</li>\n<li>Trade-In Options – upgrade, save money &amp; protect the planet</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When you buy your Samsung S23 Ultra from us, you don’t just get a phone – you get value, trust, and customer-first service.</p>\n<h2>FAQs</h2>\n<p><strong>1. Is the Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra brand new?</strong></p>\n<p>No – Its available in different condition options</p>\n<p><strong>2. Is the phone unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Absolutely. All our Samsung S23 Ultra devices are unlocked, so you can use any SIM card in the UK or abroad.</p>\n<p><strong>3. What warranty do I get?</strong></p>\n<p>Every device comes with a 12-month warranty, covering manufacturing or technical faults.</p>\n<p><strong>4. Do you provide the original charger?</strong></p>\n<p>To reduce e-waste, the official Samsung S23 Ultra does not include a wall charger. We recommend using Samsung-approved chargers &amp; cables for safe, fast charging.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Is next-day delivery available?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes – order by 3PM Monday to Friday, and enjoy free next-day UK delivery.</p>\n<p><strong>6. Can I trade in my old phone?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes – we offer a trade-in program where you can exchange your old device for discounts on your Samsung S23 Ultra.</p>\n<p><strong>7. Is the Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra waterproof?</strong></p>\n<p>It has an IP68 water and dust resistance rating, meaning it can withstand splashes, dust, and accidental drops in water (within limits).</p>\n<p><strong>8. Does it support 5G?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes – the Samsung S23 Ultra is a 5G device, ready for the fastest UK mobile networks.</p>\n<p><strong>9. What storage options are available?</strong></p>\n<p>This model comes with 256GB, 512GB and 1TB variants.</p>\n<p><strong>10. Why should I buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</strong></p>\n<p>Because we combine quality, unbeatable prices, warranty, free shipping, and trusted customer service – making us the best place to buy your Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
