    "longDescription": "<h2>Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus – Unlocked</h2>\n<p>Looking for a <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">premium smartphone</a> that combines power, elegance, and cutting-edge technology? The Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus is here to redefine your mobile experience. At iRepair Mobiles UK, we bring you the Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus – Unlocked at the best price in the UK, making it the perfect deal for those who want flagship performance without compromise.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus?</h2>\n<p>The Samsung S23 Plus is one of Samsung’s finest creations, launched in February 2023 and designed for users who demand performance, reliability, and premium design. Whether you’re a business professional, gamer, or content creator, this device ticks every box.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Unlocked Freedom – Works with all UK &amp; international networks.</li>\n<li>Ample Storage – Store thousands of photos, videos, and apps without worry.</li>\n<li>Powerful Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 Chipset – Lightning-fast performance for multitasking and gaming.</li>\n<li>Stunning 6.6” Dynamic AMOLED Display – Smooth 120Hz refresh rate with vibrant visuals.</li>\n<li>Pro-Grade Camera System – Capture stunning moments with the 50MP main, 12MP ultrawide, and 10MP telephoto lenses.</li>\n<li>Long-Lasting 4700mAh Battery – Stay powered all day with intelligent power efficiency.</li>\n<li>Premium Build Quality – Protected by Corning Gorilla Glass Victus 2 and sleek, lightweight design.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus Features &amp; Specifications</h2>\n<h3>Display &amp; Design</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>6.6-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X screen</li>\n<li>Adaptive 48Hz–120Hz refresh rate for smoother scrolling</li>\n<li>Ultra-bright panel perfect for outdoor use</li>\n<li>Sleek body dimensions: 157.8 x 76.2 x 7.6 mm</li>\n<li>Light and durable at 196g with Corning Gorilla Glass Victus 2</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Performance &amp; Speed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Powered by the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 chipset</li>\n<li>Octa-core CPU with up to 3.36GHz Cortex-X3</li>\n<li>8GB RAM for smooth multitasking</li>\n<li>Advanced Adreno GPU for gaming &amp; graphics performance</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Camera System</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Rear Triple Camera Setup:</li>\n<li>50MP Wide Lens (optical image stabilization)</li>\n<li>12MP Ultra-Wide Lens</li>\n<li>10MP Telephoto Lens with 3x optical zoom</li>\n<li>Front Camera: 12MP for sharp selfies and video calls</li>\n<li>Professional-grade photography and night mode improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Battery &amp; Charging</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>4700mAh battery with efficient power consumption</li>\n<li>45W super-fast charging support</li>\n<li>Wireless and reverse wireless charging options</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Storage &amp; OS</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>256GB, 512GB, 1TB internal storage (abundance for apps, games, media, and files)</li>\n<li>Android 13 with Samsung’s One UI 5.1 – clean, fast, customizable</li>\n<li>Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus Price &amp; Deals in the UK</li>\n</ul>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we provide the best Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus deals at unbeatable prices. Whether you’re upgrading from an older Galaxy or switching from another brand, our Samsung S23 Plus price UK ensures you get flagship power at the best value.</p>\n<h2>Competitive market price</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fully unlocked &amp; ready to use</li>\n<li>12-month warranty included</li>\n<li>Free &amp; secure UK delivery</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK – the #1 <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-s-series/\">Mobile Phone</a> &amp; Accessories Shop in the UK, we stand for trust, quality, and unbeatable deals.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Trusted supplier of phones, repairs, and accessories across the UK</li>\n<li>All devices are tested &amp; verified</li>\n<li>Exceptional after-sales support and maintenance services</li>\n<li>Transparent pricing – no hidden costs</li>\n<li>Thousands of happy customer reviews across the UK</li>\n<li>When you buy from us, you’re not just buying a phone – you’re investing in reliability and service you can trust.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Who is the Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus For?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Professionals who need seamless performance for multitasking</li>\n<li>Gamers who want smooth, lag-free graphics</li>\n<li>Photographers &amp; Content Creators who rely on high-quality camera performance</li>\n<li>Everyday users who want reliability, speed, and long-lasting battery life</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>FAQs – Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus</h2>\n<p><strong>1. Is the Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes! The device is factory unlocked, meaning you can use it with any UK or international carrier.</p>\n<p><strong>2. What is the storage capacity?</strong></p>\n<p>This model comes with different storage options, enough for apps, photos, videos, and large files.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Does the phone support fast charging?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus supports 45W super-fast charging and wireless charging.</p>\n<p><strong>4. Is the Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus New?</strong></p>\n<p>No, this is an (A Grade) device, meaning it’s in excellent condition with no signs of use.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Does it come with a warranty?</strong></p>\n<p>Absolutely. At iRepair Mobiles UK, we provide a 12-month warranty for your peace of mind.</p>\n<p><strong>6. What colours are available?</strong></p>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus comes in multiple elegant colours. Please contact us for current availability.</p>\n<p><strong>7. Can I trade in my old phone?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, we offer trade-in deals for old smartphones when purchasing your Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus.</p>\n<p><strong>8. Is the Samsung S23 Plus water-resistant?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, it comes with an IP68 rating, meaning it’s dust and water resistant.</p>\n<p><strong>9. Do you ship across the UK?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, we provide fast delivery across the UK with secure packaging.</p>\n<p><strong>10. Why should I buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</strong></p>\n<p>Because we are a trusted UK phone shop, offering quality, affordability, and excellent customer service.</p>\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung Galaxy S23</a> Plus – Unlocked is not just a smartphone; it’s a flagship powerhouse designed to empower your lifestyle. From its stunning AMOLED display to its professional camera system and powerful Snapdragon performance, every feature is built to impress.</p>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we’re proud to offer you the best Samsung S23 Plus deals in the UK – delivering unbeatable value, genuine quality, and trusted service.</p>\n<p>Don’t wait – upgrade today and experience the difference with the Samsung Galaxy S23 Plus.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
