    "longDescription": "<h2>Samsung Galaxy S22 Plus – Unlocked</h2>\n<p>Upgrade your <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">smartphone</a> experience with the Samsung Galaxy S22 Plus, a flagship device designed to deliver speed, style, and cutting-edge innovation. Whether you’re streaming, gaming, capturing stunning 8K videos, or managing work on the go, the Samsung S22 Plus gives you the power of 5G connectivity, an immersive display, and professional-grade cameras – all packed in a sleek and durable design.</p>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we bring you the Samsung Galaxy S22 Plus – Unlocked at competitive prices with a 12-month warranty, so you shop with confidence.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the Samsung Galaxy S22 Plus?</h2>\n<h3>Blazing 5G Speed</h3>\n<p>Stay ahead with <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-s-series/\">Samsung</a> Galaxy S22 Plus 5G technology. Enjoy seamless browsing, ultra-fast downloads, and lag-free streaming – making your smartphone future-ready.</p>\n<h3>Pro-Grade Triple Camera System</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>50MP Wide Lens with OIS and dual pixel PDAF for crystal-clear photos.</li>\n<li>10MP Telephoto Lens with 3x optical zoom to capture details from afar.</li>\n<li>12MP Ultra-Wide Lens with a 120° field of view for breathtaking landscapes.</li>\n<li>8K video recording, Super Steady mode &amp; HDR10+ for cinema-like quality.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Stunning Display</h3>\n<p>The 6.6-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display with 120Hz refresh rate delivers smooth scrolling, vibrant colours, and incredible brightness – even under direct sunlight.</p>\n<h3>Long-Lasting Battery with Super Fast Charging</h3>\n<p>The Samsung S22 Plus packs a powerful battery that supports fast charging and wireless charging, keeping you connected all day without worries.</p>\n<h3>Premium Build &amp; Stylish Colours</h3>\n<p>Crafted with Gorilla Glass Victus+ and an aluminium frame, this phone is designed for durability and elegance. Available in colours like Phantom Black, White, Green, and more.</p>\n<h3>Unlocked &amp; Ready to Use</h3>\n<p>This Samsung Galaxy S22 Plus unlocked model is compatible with all major UK and international networks (Vodafone, EE, O2, Three, etc.), giving you total freedom to choose or switch your carrier anytime.</p>\n<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Model Numbers: SM-S906B/DS, SM-S906U, SM-S906E, and more.</li>\n<li>Network: GSM / CDMA / HSPA / EVDO / LTE / 5G</li>\n<li>Bands Supported: 2G, 3G, 4G, and full 5G Sub6 + mmWave</li>\n<li>Processor: Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 1 (5G) / Exynos 2200 (depending on region)</li>\n<li>Display: 6.6” Dynamic AMOLED 2X, HDR10+, 120Hz refresh rate</li>\n<li>Storage: 128GB, 256GB, 512GB</li>\n<li>RAM: 8GB for lightning-fast multitasking</li>\n<li>Main Camera: Triple (50MP + 10MP + 12MP)</li>\n<li>Front Camera: 10MP with 4K video recording</li>\n<li>Battery: 4500mAh, 45W fast charging, 15W wireless charging</li>\n<li>Security: Ultrasonic fingerprint sensor, Face Unlock</li>\n<li>OS: Android 12 (upgradable) with One UI 5</li>\n<li>Connectivity: Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.2, NFC, USB-C</li>\n<li>Audio: Stereo speakers tuned by AKG, Dolby Atmos support</li>\n<li>Extras: IP68 water &amp; dust resistance, Samsung Knox for security</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>What’s in the Box?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung</a> Galaxy S22 Plus – Unlocked</li>\n<li>Secure branded box</li>\n<li>USB-C charging lead</li>\n<li>SIM removal tool</li>\n<li>Quick start guide</li>\n<li>(Charger plug may be sold separately depending on bundle.)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Trusted UK Store – Known as the #1 mobile phone and accessories shop in the UK.</li>\n<li>12-Month Warranty – Peace of mind with guaranteed quality.</li>\n<li>Affordable Samsung S22 Plus Price – Trade, save money, and enjoy low prices.</li>\n<li>Eco-Friendly Choice – Choose sustainable devices that are like new and better for the planet.</li>\n<li>Free Shipping &amp; Easy Returns – Secure packaging and reliable delivery across the UK.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\n<p><strong>1. Is the Samsung Galaxy S22 Plus brand new?</strong></p>\n<p>No. This is an A-Grade Samsung Galaxy S22 Plus, carefully inspected and supplied in secure packaging.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Is the phone unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the device is fully unlocked, meaning you can use it with any UK or international carrier.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Does it come with a warranty?</strong></p>\n<p>Absolutely. You’ll receive a 12-month warranty from iRepair Mobiles UK, covering hardware and technical issues.</p>\n<p><strong>4. Does the Samsung Galaxy S22 Plus support 5G?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the Samsung Galaxy S22 Plus 5G is compatible with all leading UK 5G networks like EE, Vodafone, and O2.</p>\n<p><strong>5. What is the difference between A Grade and Refurbished?</strong></p>\n<p>A Grade means the device is in like-new condition, with no visible scratches or dents. It’s not refurbished – it’s new stock inspected for quality.</p>\n<p><strong>6. Which colours are available?</strong></p>\n<p>Popular colour options include Phantom Black, White, Green, Gold, and Pink. Availability may vary.</p>\n<p><strong>7. Can I trade in my old phone?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, at iRepair Mobiles UK you can trade in your old device and save money on your Samsung S22 Plus.</p>\n<p><strong>8. Does it include a charging adapter?</strong></p>\n<p>The box includes a USB-C charging lead. You may need to purchase a charging adapter separately, depending on your preference.</p>\n<p><strong>9. Is this device eco-friendly?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes. Buying from iRepair Mobiles UK means you’re choosing a device that supports sustainable practices – great for your wallet and the planet.</p>\n<p><strong>10. How fast is delivery?</strong></p>\n<p>We offer fast UK delivery, usually within 1-3 working days, with secure packaging and tracking for peace of mind.</p>\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy S22 Plus is more than just a smartphone – it’s your ultimate partner for work, play, and everything in between. With its powerful 5G performance, pro-grade cameras, stunning AMOLED display, and durable design, it sets new standards for premium Android phones.</p>\n<p>Shop today at iRepair Mobiles UK to enjoy the best deals, warranty coverage, and a reliable shopping experience you can trust. Don’t miss the chance to own the Samsung Galaxy S22 Plus Unlocked at an unbeatable price.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
