    "longDescription": "<h2>Samsung Galaxy S22 – Unlocked</h2>\n<p>Looking for a Samsung Galaxy S22 that combines sleek design, next-level performance, and unbeatable value? At iRepair Mobiles UK – the #1 <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">Mobile Phone</a> &amp; Accessories Shop in the UK, we bring you the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-s-series/\">Samsung</a> Galaxy S22 – Unlocked at a price you’ll love. Whether you’re upgrading from an older device or buying your first 5G-ready flagship, this phone delivers everything you need — power, reliability, and style — without compromise.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the Samsung Galaxy S22?</h2>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy S22 is more than just a smartphone; it’s your gateway to a smarter lifestyle. Packed with the latest innovations, it gives you speed, clarity, and sustainability in one glorious device.</p>\n<h3>Stunning Display</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>6.1-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X screen</li>\n<li>Smooth 120Hz refresh rate for ultra-fluid scrolling</li>\n<li>Bright, vibrant colours perfect for videos, gaming, and browsing</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Pro-Grade Camera System</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Nightography Camera for crystal-clear low-light shots</li>\n<li>50MP wide + 12MP ultra-wide + 10MP telephoto lenses</li>\n<li>30x Space Zoom and pro-mode controls</li>\n<li>Shoot cinematic 8K video at 24fps</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Lightning-Fast Performance</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Qualcomm Snapdragon processor</li>\n<li>5G-ready for future-proof connectivity</li>\n<li>Android 12 operating system, upgradeable</li>\n<li>128GB, 256GB, 512GB</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Built to Last</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>IP68 water and dust resistance</li>\n<li>Gorilla Glass Victus+ protection</li>\n<li>Long-lasting battery with 80%+ battery health or better guaranteed</li>\n<li>25W fast charging + wireless charging support</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why Choose iRepair?</h2>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, every <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung</a> Galaxy S22 goes through a 30-point phone health check by our expert technicians. We guarantee:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Unlocked to all networks – pop in any SIM card and you’re ready to go.</li>\n<li>Minimum 80% battery health – so you don’t have to worry about daily charging.</li>\n<li>12-month warranty – peace of mind against defects.</li>\n<li>Professionally data-wiped – ensuring your phone is secure and ready to use.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>We’re committed to sustainability and reducing e-waste. Your device comes in a slimline box with essentials only — a USB charging cable, SIM tray pin, and the phone itself. This reduces waste while still giving you everything you need.</p>\n<h2>What’s in the Box?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Samsung Galaxy S22 – Unlocked</li>\n<li>USB charging cable</li>\n<li>SIM tray ejector tool</li>\n<li>Slimline packaging for eco-friendly delivery</li>\n<li>(Please note: phones may not include original manufacturer accessories. Some repairs may include genuine Samsung parts.)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>UK’s trusted shop for phones, repairs, and accessories.</li>\n<li>No-quibble 21-day returns policy.</li>\n<li>Transparent pricing – no hidden costs.</li>\n<li>5-star rated by thousands of happy customers.</li>\n<li>Deals you won’t regret – add to your basket and upgrade today!</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Key Specifications at a Glance</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Brand: Samsung</li>\n<li>Model: Galaxy S22</li>\n<li>Storage: 128GB, 256GB, 512GB</li>\n<li>Condition: Different Options</li>\n<li>Screen Size: 6.1 inches</li>\n<li>Operating System: Android 12</li>\n<li>Camera: 50MP + 12MP + 10MP (rear) | 10MP (front)</li>\n<li>Video: 8K at 24fps</li>\n<li>Network: Unlocked, 5G-ready</li>\n<li>Warranty: 12 Months</li>\n<li>Battery Health: 80%+ minimum</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>FAQs – Build Your Trust</h2>\n<p><strong>1. Is the Samsung Galaxy S22 unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes! Every Samsung Galaxy S22 we sell is fully unlocked to all UK and international networks. Just insert your SIM card and start using it.</p>\n<p><strong>2. What does “A Grade” mean?</strong></p>\n<p>“A Grade” means the phone is in excellent condition, close to new. It passes our 30-point health check and shows little to no signs of use.</p>\n<p><strong>3. How long is the warranty?</strong></p>\n<p>We provide a 12-month warranty for your peace of mind. This covers hardware and manufacturer defects.</p>\n<p><strong>4. What is the battery health?</strong></p>\n<p>Every Samsung S22 we sell comes with 80% or better battery health, ensuring strong daily performance.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Do I get original accessories?</strong></p>\n<p>To reduce waste, our phones come in slimline eco-friendly boxes with a USB charging cable and SIM tray tool. Accessories may not be original.</p>\n<p><strong>6. What if I change my mind after purchase?</strong></p>\n<p>No worries! We offer a 21-day no-quibble returns policy. Just send it back in original condition.</p>\n<p><strong>7. Do you offer payment plans?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, we work with Klarna and other partners to provide interest-free payment plans. Spread the cost over time with options as low as £10 per month.</p>\n<h2>Make the Switch Today</h2>\n<p>Don’t wait another day to experience the power of the Samsung Galaxy S22. With its glorious display, pro-grade camera, and future-ready 5G performance, this is the phone you’ll love using every single day.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Choose your plan, add to basket, and get it delivered free tomorrow.</li>\n<li>Upgrade smart. Upgrade with iRepair Mobiles UK.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\">Follow For More!</a></p>\n"
