    "longDescription": "<h2>Samsung Galaxy S20 Ultra – Unlocked</h2>\n<p>Step into the future of mobile technology with the Samsung Galaxy S20 Ultra. Known for its revolutionary camera system, powerful performance, and sleek design, this flagship <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">Android smartphone</a> delivers everything you need in the palm of your hand. Whether you’re capturing breathtaking moments, streaming in 5G, or running multiple apps seamlessly, the Galaxy S20 Ultra ensures every experience feels premium.</p>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we bring you the Samsung Galaxy S20 Ultra – Unlocked, carefully tested for quality and reliability. With a stunning 6.9-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display, a 108MP professional-grade camera, and a massive 5000mAh battery, this phone isn’t just smart—it’s built for those who demand more.</p>\n<h2>Key Features of the Samsung Galaxy S20 Ultra</h2>\n<h3>1. Stunning 6.9-inch Display</h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-s-series/\">Samsung</a> S20 Ultra boasts a 6.9-inch (17.53 cm) Quad HD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X display. With a 120Hz refresh rate, you’ll enjoy buttery-smooth scrolling, crisp visuals, and ultra-responsive touch. Whether it’s gaming, watching 8K videos, or working on-the-go, the Galaxy S20 Ultra’s display adapts to deliver unmatched clarity.</p>\n<h3>2. Professional-Grade Camera System</h3>\n<p>The camera setup redefines smartphone photography:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>108MP Wide Lens – Capture every detail with professional sharpness.</li>\n<li>48MP Telephoto Lens – Push zoom to the next level with up to 100x Space Zoom.</li>\n<li>12MP Ultra-Wide Lens – Perfect for landscapes and group shots.</li>\n<li>40MP Front Camera – Flawless selfies and high-quality video calls.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>With 8K video recording (7680 x 4320 resolution) and Super Steady mode, every memory comes to life with cinematic detail. The Super Slow-Mo (960fps) ensures even the fastest action looks dramatic and clear.</p>\n<h3>3. Power Meets Performance</h3>\n<p>Powered by the Exynos 990 / Snapdragon 865 processor and backed by 12GB RAM with 128GB, 256GB, 512GB storage options, the Samsung Galaxy S20 Ultra delivers high-speed multitasking. Download, stream, and switch between apps effortlessly. For those who need more, the expandable memory ensures you’ll never run out of space.</p>\n<h3>4. 5G Ready for the Future</h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung</a> Galaxy S20 Ultra 5G ensures you’re future-proof. Experience ultra-fast downloads, lag-free streaming, and real-time gaming. Stay ahead with cutting-edge network technology.</p>\n<h3>5. Battery That Lasts All Day</h3>\n<p>A 5000mAh intelligent battery adapts to your usage. With Super Fast Charging and Wireless Charging 2.0, you’ll spend more time doing what you love and less time charging.</p>\n<h3>6. Premium Design &amp; Durability</h3>\n<p>Crafted with Corning Gorilla Glass 6 on both front and back, the Galaxy S20 Ultra is built to last. It’s sleek, modern, and water-resistant (IP68 rating).</p>\n<h2>Why Buy the Samsung Galaxy S20 Ultra from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Unlocked &amp; Ready to Use – Works with all major UK networks.</li>\n<li>Best Samsung S20 Ultra Deals in the UK – Competitive pricing.</li>\n<li>UK Warranty &amp; Customer Support – Peace of mind with every purchase.</li>\n<li>Trusted Mobile Experts – iRepair Mobiles UK is the #1 destination for phones, repairs, and accessories.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When you choose us, you’re not just buying a phone—you’re buying trust, support, and a seamless shopping experience.</p>\n<h2>Samsung Galaxy S20 Ultra Specifications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Brand: Samsung</li>\n<li>Model: Galaxy S20 Ultra (SM-G988)</li>\n<li>Network: 5G / 4G LTE / GSM Unlocked</li>\n<li>Display: 6.9-inch QHD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X, 120Hz</li>\n<li>Processor: Exynos 990 (Global) / Snapdragon 865 (USA)</li>\n<li>Storage: 128GB, 256GB, 512GB</li>\n<li>RAM: 12GB</li>\n<li>Main Camera: Quad Setup – 108MP + 48MP + 12MP + DepthVision</li>\n<li>Front Camera: 40MP</li>\n<li>Battery: 5000mAh, Super Fast Charging, Wireless Charging</li>\n<li>Operating System: Android 13 (latest updates)</li>\n<li>Build: Corning Gorilla Glass 6, IP68 Water &amp; Dust Resistant</li>\n<li>Audio: Stereo speakers tuned by AKG</li>\n<li>Colours Available: Cosmic Black, Cosmic Grey</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\n<p><strong>Q1. What is the price of S20 Ultra in UK?</strong></p>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy S20 Ultra price in the UK varies based on storage and condition. At iRepair Mobiles UK, you’ll find competitive deals on Samsung S20 Ultra – Unlocked, ensuring excellent value.</p>\n<p><strong>Q2. How old is the Samsung S20 Ultra?</strong></p>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy S20 Ultra was officially announced in February 2020 and released in March 2020. Despite its age, it remains one of the most powerful smartphones with flagship-level performance.</p>\n<p><strong>Q3. What is the price of Samsung S20 Ultra?</strong></p>\n<p>Prices differ depending on the market and condition. At iRepair Mobiles UK, we provide Samsung S20 Ultra deals that are tailored for affordability and quality assurance.</p>\n<p><strong>Q4. Is the Samsung Galaxy S20 Ultra a good phone?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the Samsung Galaxy S20 Ultra is an outstanding phone even today. With a 108MP camera, 5G support, massive 5000mAh battery, and 6.9-inch 120Hz display, it continues to compete with newer models. It’s an excellent choice for anyone seeking a powerful, premium smartphone at a great price.</p>\n<h2>Why the Samsung Galaxy S20 Ultra is Still a Smart Buy in 2025</h2>\n<p>Even though newer Samsung models are available, the Galaxy S20 Ultra holds strong value because of its camera system, 5G connectivity, and performance power. For users who want flagship features without flagship pricing, it’s one of the best Samsung S20 Ultra deals in the UK.</p>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we make it easy for you to own this premium smartphone, offering you affordability, trust, and the best after-sales support.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
