    "longDescription": "<h2>iPhone 16 Plus – Unlocked</h2>\n<p>At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we proudly present the iPhone 16 Plus – a <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">device</a> that redefines performance, design, and innovation. If you’re searching for the best iPhone 16 Plus price UK or the most reliable iPhone 16 Plus deals, this is your chance to own Apple’s latest powerhouse, unlocked, and ready to use with any UK or international carrier.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re upgrading from an older model or switching to Apple for the first time, the Apple iPhone 16 Plus is built to give you everything you expect from a <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">premium smartphone</a>: cutting-edge design, next-gen processing power, advanced camera technology, and unbeatable battery life – all in one device.</p>\n<h2>Stunning Super Retina XDR Display</h2>\n<p>The 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display is where the magic begins. With a 2796-by-1290-pixel resolution at 460 ppi, this all-screen design provides exceptional clarity and lifelike detail. Its rounded corners and curved design make the phone feel premium and modern.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dynamic Island for quick access to alerts and activities.</li>\n<li>True Tone &amp; Wide Color (P3) support for cinema-like visuals.</li>\n<li>HDR with 2,000,000:1 contrast ratio for breathtaking blacks and dazzling whites.</li>\n<li>Up to 2,000 nits peak brightness outdoors – perfect for sunny UK days.</li>\n<li>Fingerprint-resistant oleophobic coating to keep your screen clean.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether you’re watching Netflix, editing photos, or gaming, the iPhone 16 Plus delivers an unmatched visual experience.</p>\n<h2>Sleek Build &amp; Premium Design</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">Apple</a> continues its excellence in design with the iPhone 16 Plus. Available in striking Black, White, Pink, Teal, and Ultramarine, it’s crafted with color-infused glass on the back and Ceramic Shield on the front, making it tougher than any previous iPhone.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aluminum frame for lightweight durability.</li>\n<li>IP68 water and dust resistance – up to 6 meters deep for 30 minutes.</li>\n<li>Weighs just 199 grams, perfectly balanced for comfort.</li>\n<li>This phone is not only powerful but also stylish enough to make a statement.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Storage That Fits Your Needs</h2>\n<p>This model comes with different storage options – perfect for everyday users who want to store thousands of photos, videos, and apps. For heavy users, the iPhone 16 Plus is also available in 256GB and 512GB variants.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A18 Chip &amp; Performance</li>\n<li>At the heart of the Apple <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/used-iphones/\">iPhone</a> 16 Plus is the A18 chip, built with Apple’s latest architecture.</li>\n<li>6-core CPU (2 performance + 4 efficiency cores).</li>\n<li>5-core GPU for console-quality gaming.</li>\n<li>16-core Neural Engine designed for Apple Intelligence and AI tasks.</li>\n<li>From editing 4K videos to running demanding apps, this device ensures effortless multitasking and industry-leading performance while safeguarding your privacy.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Professional Dual-Camera System</h2>\n<p>Capture every moment like a pro with the advanced 48MP + 12MP dual-camera system.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>48MP Fusion main camera with ƒ/1.6 aperture and sensor-shift OIS.</li>\n<li>12MP Ultra-Wide with 120° field of view.</li>\n<li>2x Telephoto zoom and 10x digital zoom.</li>\n<li>Features like Smart HDR 5, Deep Fusion, Photonic Engine, Night Mode, Portrait Lighting, and more.</li>\n<li>Panoramas up to 63MP and Macro photography for ultra-detailed shots.</li>\n<li>On the front, the 12MP TrueDepth camera delivers flawless selfies with autofocus, Smart HDR, and portrait effects.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Cinematic Video Recording</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Shoot like a filmmaker with 4K Dolby Vision recording at up to 60fps.</li>\n<li>Action Mode for shake-free videos.</li>\n<li>Cinematic Mode with depth control.</li>\n<li>Slo-Mo in 1080p at 240fps.</li>\n<li>Take 8MP stills while recording video.</li>\n<li>Perfect for vloggers, creators, and everyday users who want professional-grade videos.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Security &amp; Face ID</h2>\n<p>Your data stays safe with Face ID, Apple’s most secure facial recognition system. Use it to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Unlock your iPhone instantly.</li>\n<li>Make secure payments with Apple Pay.</li>\n<li>Authenticate apps and purchases.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Connectivity</h2>\n<p>The iPhone 16 Plus supports:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>5G &amp; LTE bands for blazing-fast speeds.</li>\n<li>GPS, GLONASS, Galileo, QZSS, BeiDou.</li>\n<li>Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and USB-C connector.</li>\n<li>Stay connected wherever you go in the UK or abroad.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Battery Life &amp; Charging</h2>\n<p>The iPhone 16 Plus battery is built to last:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Up to 27 hours video playback.</li>\n<li>Up to 100 hours audio playback.</li>\n<li>MagSafe wireless charging (15W).</li>\n<li>Fast charging – 50% in just 30 minutes with a 20W+ adapter.</li>\n<li>Compatible with USB-C charging cables.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Accessibility &amp; iOS 18</h2>\n<p>Packed with iOS 18, the world’s most secure mobile OS, the iPhone 16 Plus includes accessibility features for vision, hearing, mobility, and cognitive support. Tools like VoiceOver, AssistiveTouch, Eye Tracking, and Live Captions make it usable for everyone.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Best mobile phone shop in the UK with thousands of satisfied customers.</li>\n<li>Unlocked iPhone 16 Plus works with all major UK and international carriers.</li>\n<li>1-Year warranty &amp; after-sales support.</li>\n<li>Competitive iPhone 16 Plus price UK with exclusive iPhone 16 Plus deals.</li>\n<li>Free UK delivery &amp; in-store pickup available.</li>\n<li>When you shop with us, you get peace of mind, genuine products, and professional support.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>FAQs</h2>\n<p><strong>Q1: Is the iPhone 16 Plus unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, this device is fully unlocked and works with any UK or international SIM card.</p>\n<p><strong>Q2: What condition is this phone in?</strong></p>\n<p>This is an iPhone 16 Plus in different options.</p>\n<p><strong>Q3: Does it come with a warranty?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, every iPhone 16 Plus purchased from iRepair Mobiles UK includes a 1-year warranty.</p>\n<p><strong>Q4: How is the iPhone 16 Plus different from iPhone 15 Plus?</strong></p>\n<p>The iPhone 16 Plus comes with the powerful A18 chip, improved camera system, and upgraded iOS 18 features, offering better performance, photography, and AI capabilities.</p>\n<p><strong>Q5: Do you offer financing or deals?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, we regularly run <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/iphone-16-series/\">iPhone 16</a> Plus deals in the UK. Contact us to learn about installment plans and trade-in offers.</p>\n<p><strong>Q6: What’s included in the box?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>iPhone 16 Plus</li>\n<li>USB-C charging cable</li>\n<li>Documentation</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Q7: Can I trade in my old iPhone?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes! At iRepair Mobiles UK, we offer trade-in options for old devices, making it even more affordable to upgrade.</p>\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\n<p>The iPhone 16 Plus Unlocked is more than just a smartphone – it’s a smart investment. With unbeatable performance, a premium design, advanced camera systems, and reliable UK warranty, it’s the perfect time to upgrade.</p>\n<p>Get the best iPhone 16 Plus price UK only at iRepair Mobiles UK – your trusted mobile phone and accessories shop.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
