    "longDescription": "<h2>Product Overview</h2>\n<p>Looking for a powerful, stylish, and future-ready Apple iPhone 12 at the best value in the UK? At iRepair Mobiles UK – the #1 <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">Mobile</a> Phone &amp; <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/\">Accessories</a> Shop, we bring you the iPhone 12 - Unlocked.</p>\n<p>This device combines the classic Apple design with cutting-edge features, ensuring a smooth experience whether you’re browsing, streaming, gaming, or capturing memories. With its 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display, lightning-fast A14 Bionic processor, and 5G connectivity, the iPhone 12 stands out as one of the best <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">smartphones</a> in the market.</p>\n<p>This handset is giving you premium quality at a competitive Apple12 price without compromise. Plus, being unlocked, it works with all UK networks, offering you complete freedom.</p>\n<h2>Key Features of the iPhone 12</h2>\n<h3>Stunning Display</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>6.1-inch Super Retina XDR OLED screen</li>\n<li>Edge-to-edge design with vivid colours, deep blacks &amp; HDR support</li>\n<li>1200 nits brightness for incredible clarity even outdoors</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Blazing Performance</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Powered by Apple’s A14 Bionic chip – the first 5-nanometer SoC</li>\n<li>Up to 50% faster than most Android processors</li>\n<li>Smooth multitasking &amp; lag-free gaming</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>5G Connectivity</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Next-gen speeds for streaming, downloads &amp; online gaming</li>\n<li>Wi-Fi 6 support for ultra-stable connectivity</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Dual Camera System</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>12MP wide + 12MP ultra-wide lenses</li>\n<li>Night Mode &amp; Deep Fusion for low-light photography</li>\n<li>Record in 4K Dolby Vision HDR – cinema-quality video</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Premium Build</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Sleek aluminium frame with retro flat-edge design</li>\n<li>Ceramic Shield front cover: 4x more drop-resistant than previous models</li>\n<li>IP68 water &amp; dust resistance</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>MagSafe &amp; Charging</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>MagSafe technology for fast wireless charging up to 15W</li>\n<li>Compatible with magnetic wallets &amp; accessories</li>\n<li>USB-C to Lightning cable included (charger sold separately)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why Choose iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we’re more than just a phone shop – we’re a trusted partner in technology.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Best prices on Apple iPhones in the UK</li>\n<li>12-month warranty for peace of mind</li>\n<li>Unlocked handsets – use any network</li>\n<li>Free UK shipping &amp; in-store collection</li>\n<li>Dedicated after-sales support team</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Our commitment is to deliver authentic Apple devices and premium accessories while ensuring transparency, quality, and customer trust. When you buy the Apple iPhone 12 from us, you’re not just buying a phone—you’re investing in performance, reliability, and value.</p>\n<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Model: Apple iPhone 12</li>\n<li>Storage: Different options</li>\n<li>Condition: Different options</li>\n<li>Network: Unlocked (works with EE, Vodafone, O2, Three &amp; more)</li>\n<li>Display: 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR OLED</li>\n<li>Processor: A14 Bionic, 6-core design, 11.8 billion transistors</li>\n<li>Rear Camera: Dual 12MP Wide + Ultra-Wide</li>\n<li>Front Camera: 12MP TrueDepth with Night Mode</li>\n<li>Video: 4K recording up to 60fps, Dolby Vision HDR</li>\n<li>Connectivity: 5G + Wi-Fi 6</li>\n<li>Charging: MagSafe, Wireless charging up to 15W, Fast wired charging</li>\n<li>Build: Aluminium frame, Ceramic Shield glass</li>\n<li>Weight: 162g</li>\n<li>Water Resistance: IP68 certified</li>\n<li>Colours Available: Black, Blue, Red, Green, White, Purple</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Pros &amp; Cons (Honest Breakdown)</h2>\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>5G ready for faster connectivity</li>\n<li>Gorgeous OLED Super Retina XDR display</li>\n<li>Super-fast A14 Bionic processor</li>\n<li>Great dual-camera performance with Night Mode</li>\n<li>MagSafe wireless charging &amp; accessories</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Charger &amp; <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/earbuds-and-headphones/heaphones/\">headphones</a> not included</li>\n<li>Battery life is decent but not class-leading</li>\n<li>Notch design is still noticeable</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Compare iPhone 12 with Other Models</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Want a compact phone? Try the Apple 12 Mini (5.4-inch).</li>\n<li>Need advanced photography? Go for the iPhone 12 Pro / Pro Max with LiDAR and telephoto lens.</li>\n<li>Shopping on a budget? The iPhone SE 2020 is still a solid choice.</li>\n<li>But if you want the perfect balance of price, size, performance, and features, the iPhone 12 – Unlocked is the best choice in the UK market today.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>FAQs About iPhone 12</h2>\n<p><strong>Q1. Is the iPhone 12 still worth buying in 2025?</strong></p>\n<p>Absolutely! The iPhone 12 offers 5G, a powerful A14 Bionic chip, and a premium OLED display, making it a future-ready smartphone at a much lower price than the latest models.</p>\n<p><strong>Q2. Is this iPhone 12 A grade?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, we also have A Grade iPhone 12 – carefully inspected, fully functional, and free from any major cosmetic imperfections.</p>\n<p><strong>Q3. Does the iPhone 12 come unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes! All our Apple <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">iPhone</a> 12 models are factory unlocked, so you can use them with any UK or international SIM.</p>\n<p><strong>Q4. What’s included in the box?</strong></p>\n<p>The box includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>iPhone 12</li>\n<li>USB-C to Lightning Cable</li>\n<li>(Please note: Charger and headphones are sold separately as per Apple’s eco-friendly packaging policy.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Q5. Does the iPhone 12 support wireless charging?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, it supports Qi wireless charging and MagSafe fast charging up to 15W.</p>\n<p><strong>Q6. What warranty do I get with this phone?</strong></p>\n<p>Every iPhone 12 purchase at iRepair Mobiles UK comes with a 12-month warranty covering manufacturing defects.</p>\n<p><strong>Q7. How is the iPhone 12 different from the iPhone 12 Pro?</strong></p>\n<p>The Pro model has an extra telephoto lens, LiDAR sensor, and higher storage options. The standard iPhone 12 gives you the same A14 Bionic power at a more affordable price.</p>\n<p><strong>Q8. Can I trade in my old phone when buying the iPhone 12?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes! At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/used-iphones/\">iRepair Mobiles</a> UK, we offer trade-in deals so you can save even more on your Apple iPhone 12.</p>\n<h2>Final Thoughts – Why Buy the iPhone 12 from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p>The Apple <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/iphone-12-series/\">iPhone 12</a> Unlocked is a smartphone that truly delivers on performance, style, and value.</p>\n<p>Whether you want fast 5G speeds, a stunning OLED display, or powerful photography, the iPhone 12 is a device that’s built to last. Buying from iRepair Mobiles UK ensures you get the best price, reliable after-sales support, and complete peace of mind.</p>\n<p>Order today and experience the power of Apple iPhone 12 – the smart choice for UK customers.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
