    "type": "simple",
    "shortDescription": "10mm Dynamic Drivers – Rich, powerful sound with deep bass\n5 EQ Modes – Customize audio for music, calls & gaming\n36-Hour Battery Life – 7.5hrs playback, 36hrs with case\nFast Charging – 10 mins = 3hrs of playtime\nBluetooth 5.4 – Ultra-stable connection & low latency (180ms)\nAI Noise Reduction – Crystal-clear calls in noisy places\nTouch Controls – Play/pause, skip tracks & voice assistant\nIPX4 Water-Resistant – Sweat & splash-proof for workouts\nUltra-Lightweight (3.6g) – Comfortable for all-day wear\nGoogle Fast Pair – Instant connection with Android",
    "longDescription": "<h2>Xiaomi Redmi Buds 6 Play – Premium Wireless Earbuds in Every Color</h2>\n<p>Experience immersive sound, all-day comfort, and seamless connectivity with the Xiaomi Redmi Buds 6 Play! These stylish, lightweight <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/earbuds-and-headphones/earbuds/\">wireless earbuds</a> deliver powerful bass, crystal-clear calls, and ultra-long battery life, making them the perfect companion for music lovers, gamers, and professionals on the go.</p>\n<p>Available in multiple vibrant colors, the Redmi Buds 6 Play combines sleek design with cutting-edge audio technology, ensuring a premium listening experience at an unbeatable price.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>10mm Dynamic Drivers – Rich, detailed sound</li>\n<li>5 EQ Modes – Customize your audio profile</li>\n<li>AI Noise Reduction – Clear calls in any environment</li>\n<li>36-Hour Playtime – Fast charging support</li>\n<li>Bluetooth 5.4 – Ultra-low latency &amp; stable connection</li>\n<li>IPX4 Water-Resistant – Perfect for workouts</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Upgrade your audio game with the Xiaomi Redmi Buds 6 Play—now available at <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, your trusted destination for<a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/\"> premium mobile accessories in the UK!</a></p>\n<h2>Why Choose Xiaomi Redmi Buds 6 Play?</h2>\n<h3>Stylish &amp; Comfortable Design</h3>\n<p>Weighing just 3.6g per earbud, the Redmi Buds 6 Play are ultra-lightweight and designed for all-day comfort. The ergonomic four-sided curved design ensures a perfect fit, while the sleek charging case makes them easy to carry. Whether you're commuting, working out, or relaxing, these <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/earbuds-and-headphones/earbuds/\">earbuds </a>stay snug and comfortable.</p>\n<h3>Superior Sound Quality</h3>\n<p>Powered by 10mm dynamic drivers, the Xiaomi Redmi Buds 6 Play deliver powerful bass, crisp treble, and balanced mids for an immersive listening experience. Thanks to Xiaomi Acoustic Lab’s fine-tuning, you get studio-quality sound in a compact package.</p>\n<p>Choose from 5 EQ modes (Standard, Bass Boost, Treble Enhance, Voice Optimize, and Balanced) to match your music style.</p>\n<h3>36-Hour Battery Life with Fast Charging</h3>\n<p>Never run out of juice! The Redmi Buds 6 Play offer:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>7.5 hours of playback on a single charge</li>\n<li>36 hours total with the charging case</li>\n<li>Fast Charging – Just 10 minutes gives 3 hours of playtime</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Perfect for long trips, workouts, or daily commutes!</p>\n<h3>Bluetooth 5.4 – Seamless Connectivity</h3>\n<p>With upgraded Bluetooth 5.4, these <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/earbuds-and-headphones/earbuds/\">earbuds </a>provide:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Faster pairing</li>\n<li>Stable connection (up to 10m range)</li>\n<li>Ultra-low latency (180ms) – Great for gaming &amp; videos</li>\n<li>Google Fast Pair – Instantly connect to Android devices</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>AI Noise Reduction for Clear Calls</h3>\n<p>The advanced AI algorithm filters out background noise, ensuring crystal-clear voice calls even in busy environments. Whether you're in a café or on a busy street, your voice comes through loud and clear.</p>\n<h3>Intuitive Touch Controls</h3>\n<p>Control your music, calls, and voice assistant with simple touch gestures:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tap once – Play/Pause, Answer/End Call</li>\n<li>Tap twice – Next Track</li>\n<li>Tap three times – Previous Track</li>\n<li>Press &amp; hold – Activate Voice Assistant</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>IPX4 Splash &amp; Sweat Resistance</h3>\n<p>Designed for active lifestyles, the IPX4-rated <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/earbuds-and-headphones/earbuds/\">earbuds </a>resist sweat, rain, and splashes, making them ideal for workouts and outdoor use.</p>\n<h3>Exclusive Spotify Premium Offer</h3>\n<p>Get 2 months of Spotify Premium FREE with your Xiaomi Redmi Buds 6 Play! Enjoy ad-free music, offline listening, and unlimited skips. (Terms apply)</p>\n<h2>FAQs – Xiaomi Redmi Buds 6 Play</h2>\n<p>Q.1 - How long does the battery last?<br />\nAns. 7.5 hours on a single charge, 36 hours with the charging case.</p>\n<p>Q.2 - Are these <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/earbuds-and-headphones/earbuds/\">earbuds </a>good for calls?<br />\nAns. Yes! The AI noise reduction ensures clear voice calls even in noisy places.</p>\n<p>Q.3 - Do they support wireless charging?<br />\nAns. No, but they support fast wired charging (10 mins = 3 hours).</p>\n<p>Q.4 Are they compatible with iPhones?<br />\nAns. Yes! They work with iOS &amp; Android, but some app features may differ.</p>\n<p>Q.5 Is there a warranty?<br />\nAns. Yes! <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a> provides a 1-year warranty on all Xiaomi products.</p>\n<p>Q.6 Can I use one earbud at a time?<br />\nAns. Yes! The Redmi Buds 6 Play support single-earbud mode.</p>\n<p>Q.7 Do they have ANC (Active Noise Cancellation)?<br />\nAns. No, but the passive noise isolation and AI noise reduction provide great call clarity.</p>\n<h2>Get Your Xiaomi Redmi Buds 6 Play Today!</h2>\n<p>Upgrade to premium <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/earbuds-and-headphones/earbuds/\">wireless earbuds</a> without breaking the bank! The Xiaomi Redmi Buds 6 Play offer exceptional sound, long battery life, and a comfortable fit—all in a stylish, affordable package.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Available in multiple colors – Pick your favorite!</li>\n<li>Fast UK Delivery – Order now at <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>!</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Don’t miss out—experience wireless freedom today!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/irepairmobiles.uk\">Follow for more!</a></p>\n"
