    "longDescription": "<h2>Budi USB to Type-C Charging Cable: Power Up Your Devices with Speed and Reliability</h2>\n<p>Tired of flimsy charging cables that fray, snap, or leave you waiting hours for a full battery? Meet the Budi USB to Type C Charging <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/chargers-and-cables/mobile-cables/\">Cable</a> – your ultimate solution for fast, reliable, and durable charging. Designed for the demands of modern life, this cable keeps your devices powered up no matter where you are. At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\"><strong>iRepair Mobiles</strong></a>, the UK’s leading mobile phone and accessories shop, we’re proud to offer this premium cable in three versatile lengths (1m, 2m, and 3m) to suit every need.</p>\n<h3>Why Settle for Less?</h3>\n<p>In a world where staying connected is non-negotiable, a subpar charging cable can be a major setback. Slow charging speeds, broken connectors, and tangled wires are more than just annoyances – they disrupt your day. The Budi USB-C Cable eliminates these frustrations with cutting-edge engineering, robust materials, and universal compatibility. Whether you’re a busy professional, a gaming enthusiast, or a parent on the go, this cable ensures your devices are always ready when you are.</p>\n<h3>Unmatched Durability for Long-Lasting Performance</h3>\n<p>The Budi USB-C Charging <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/\">Cable</a> is built to outlast ordinary cables. Here’s how:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Military-Grade Braided Nylon:</strong> Say goodbye to frayed wires! The double-braided nylon exterior resists tangles and withstands daily wear and tear.</li>\n<li><strong>Reinforced Connectors:</strong> Precision-molded stress points protect the cable’s joints, preventing breaks even with constant bending.</li>\n<li><strong>Heat-Resistant Core:</strong> Advanced insulation materials prevent overheating, ensuring safer, longer-lasting use.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Unlike cheap alternatives that fail within months, the Budi cable is rigorously tested to survive over 15,000 bends and extreme temperatures. It’s a long-term investment in hassle-free charging.</p>\n<h3>Blazing-Fast Charging Speeds</h3>\n<p>Don’t let a slow cable hold you back. The Budi USB-C Cable supports up to 3A of current, delivering rapid charging for compatible devices. Recharge your smartphone to 50% in just 30 minutes* and spend less time tethered to an outlet. Perfect for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Quick Top-Ups:</strong> Power up during your morning coffee or between meetings.</li>\n<li><strong>Data Transfer:</strong> Sync files at speeds up to 480 Mbps – ideal for transferring photos or backups.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>*Works with Quick Charge 3.0/4.0 and USB-PD (Power Delivery) adapters.</p>\n<h3>Choose Your Ideal Length</h3>\n<p>One size doesn’t fit all! Budi offers three lengths to match your lifestyle:</p>\n<ol start=\"1\">\n<li><strong>1 Meter:</strong> Compact and portable, ideal for travel or charging on the go.</li>\n<li><strong>2 Meters:</strong> Extra reach for bedside charging or using your phone while plugged in.</li>\n<li><strong>3 Meters:</strong> Maximum flexibility for office setups, backseat car charging, or gaming marathons.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>No more awkwardly huddling near outlets or struggling with short cables. Stretch out and stay comfortable!</p>\n<h3>Universal Compatibility</h3>\n<p>The Budi USB-C Cable works seamlessly with a wide range of devices, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Smartphones: Samsung Galaxy S23/S22, Google Pixel 7/8, OnePlus 10/11, and more.</li>\n<li>Tablets: iPad Pro, Samsung Galaxy Tab, Microsoft Surface.</li>\n<li>Accessories: Wireless earbuds, Bluetooth speakers, gaming controllers.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Safety First: Built-In Protection</h3>\n<p>Your safety is our priority. The Budi cable features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Over-Current Protection:</strong> Prevents damage from power surges.</li>\n<li><strong>Short-Circuit Prevention:</strong> Automatically stops charging if irregularities are detected.</li>\n<li><strong>Fire-Resistant Materials:</strong> Meets UK safety standards for peace of mind.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles?</h3>\n<p>As the UK’s top-rated mobile accessories shop, we guarantee:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Authentic Products:</strong> No knockoffs – every Budi cable is sourced directly from certified suppliers.</li>\n<li><strong>3-Months Warranty:</strong> Free replacements for manufacturing defects.</li>\n<li><strong>Fast UK Shipping:</strong> Receive your order in 2-3 working days.</li>\n<li><strong>Expert Support:</strong> Need advice? Our team is here to help via phone, chat, or in-store.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Real-Life Scenarios: Where Budi Shines</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Commuter Essential:</strong> Keep your phone charged during long train rides or road trips.</li>\n<li><strong>Work-from-Home Hero:</strong> Use the 3m cable to work comfortably from your couch or desk.</li>\n<li><strong>Gaming Guru:</strong> Avoid low-battery interruptions during intense sessions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Upgrade Your Charging Experience Today</h3>\n<p>Don’t let a bad cable slow you down. The Budi USB to Type-C Charging Cable combines speed, durability, and versatility – all at an unbeatable price.</p>\n<p>Ready to Order?</p>\n<p>Choose your length (1m, 2m, or 3m) and enjoy fast UK shipping. For a limited time, buy two Budi cables and get 10% off your next purchase!</p>\n<p><strong>Stay Connected. Stay Powered. Choose Budi.</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<p>*Terms: *Charging speed depends on device compatibility. Warranty applies to defects, not physical damage. Offer valid while stocks last.</p>\n"
