    "longDescription": "<h2>Budi Type C to Type C Charging Cable – Power Your Devices Faster</h2>\n<p>Tired of tangled wires, sluggish charging, or cables that fray within weeks? Meet the <strong>Budi Type C to Type C <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/chargers-and-cables/mobile-cables/\">Charging Cable</a></strong> – your ultimate solution for reliable, high-speed charging, designed to keep up with your busy lifestyle. Available in <strong>1-meter, 2-meter, and 3-meter lengths</strong>, this premium cable combines cutting-edge technology with rugged durability, making it the perfect companion for smartphones, tablets, laptops, and more. At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\"><strong>iRepair Mobiles</strong></a>, the UK’s leading mobile phone and accessories shop, we’re thrilled to bring you a cable that redefines convenience and performance.</p>\n<h2>Why Settle for Less? The Budi Type C to Type C Cable Delivers More</h2>\n<p>Whether you’re <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/\">charging</a> your Samsung Galaxy, Google Pixel, MacBook, or Nintendo Switch, the Budi USB-C cable ensures seamless compatibility and blazing-fast power delivery. Here’s why it’s a must-have:</p>\n<h3>1. Lightning-Fast Charging Speeds</h3>\n<p>Say goodbye to endless waiting! Engineered with advanced Power Delivery (PD) technology, the Budi cable supports rapid charging for compatible devices, replenishing your battery up to 50% faster than standard cables. Perfect for those rushed mornings or quick top-ups between meetings.</p>\n<h3>2. Built to Last: Military-Grade Durability</h3>\n<p>Durability matters. Unlike flimsy cables that snap or fray, the Budi USB-C cable features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Double-Braided Nylon Shield</strong>: Resists tangles, bends, and daily wear.</li>\n<li><strong>Reinforced Connectors</strong>: Aluminum alloy casing protects against port damage.</li>\n<li><strong>3A High-Current Support</strong>: Safely handles fast charging without overheating.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>3. Versatile Lengths for Every Scenario</h3>\n<p>Choose the perfect fit for your needs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1 Meter</strong>: Compact and portable, ideal for on-the-go charging in bags or cars.</li>\n<li><strong>2 Meter</strong>: Extra reach for bedside charging or office setups.</li>\n<li><strong>3 Meter</strong>: Ultimate flexibility for gaming marathons, couch charging, or awkwardly placed sockets.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>4. Universal Compatibility</h3>\n<p>Works flawlessly with Type-C devices like iPhone 15 series, Samsung S23/S24, Google Pixel, iPads, Huawei, and more. Sync data or transfer files at USB 2.0 speeds while charging!</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Why Choose the Budi Charging Cable?</h2>\n<p>In a world of cheap knockoffs, Budi stands out. Here’s what makes it a customer favorite:</p>\n<p><strong>Smart Chip Technology</strong>: Automatically adjusts voltage to protect your device from overcharging, short circuits, and surges.<br />\n<strong>Tangle-Free Design</strong>: Spend less time wrestling with knots and more time staying powered.<br />\n<strong>12-Month Warranty</strong>: Backed by iRepair Mobiles’ hassle-free replacement guarantee.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Perfect for Your Lifestyle</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Travelers</strong>: The 1-meter cable slips easily into backpacks or pockets.</li>\n<li><strong>Home Users</strong>: The 3-meter variant lets you binge-watch while charging from across the room.</li>\n<li><strong>Gamers/Streamers</strong>: No more awkward hunches toward the socket mid-game!</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>Why Shop at iRepair Mobiles?</h2>\n<p>As the <strong>UK’s #1 mobile phone and accessories retailer</strong>, we’re committed to quality and customer satisfaction:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fast UK Shipping</strong>: Get your cable in 1-3 business days.</li>\n<li><strong>Secure Checkout</strong>: Shop with confidence via encrypted payments.</li>\n<li><strong>Expert Support</strong>: Have questions? Our tech specialists are here to help!</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>Upgrade Your Charging Experience Today!</h2>\n<p>Don’t let a dead battery slow you down. The Budi Type C to Type C Charging Cable is more than just a wire – it’s a lifeline for your devices. With three lengths to choose from and unbeatable durability, it’s the last cable you’ll ever need.</p>\n<p><strong>Ready to Ditch Mediocre Cables?</strong><br />\n<strong>Click “Add to Cart” Now</strong><br />\nStock is limited – join thousands of satisfied UK customers who trust Budi and iRepair Mobiles for premium tech essentials!</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Budi Type C to Type C Charging Cable – Where Speed Meets Reliability.</strong><br />\nAvailable now at iRepair Mobiles. Charge smarter, live better.</p>\n"
