    "longDescription": "<div class=\"dad65929\">\n<div class=\"f9bf7997 d7dc56a8 c05b5566\">\n<div class=\"ds-markdown ds-markdown--block\">\n<h2>Budi Type C to iPhone Charging Cable (1m, 2m, 3m) – Power Your iPhone with Speed, Durability, and Flexibility</h2>\n<p>Tired of flimsy charging cables that fray within weeks? Frustrated by short cords that limit your mobility? Say goodbye to slow charging and hello to uninterrupted power with the <strong>Budi Type C to iPhone Charging Cable</strong>. Designed for iPhone users who demand reliability, speed, and convenience, this MFi-certified cable is your ultimate charging companion. Available in 1m, 2m, and 3m lengths, Budi’s premium cable ensures your iPhone stays charged wherever life takes you.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the Budi Type C to iPhone Charging Cable?</h2>\n<h3>MFi-Certified Reliability</h3>\n<p>Every Budi <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/chargers-and-cables/mobile-cables/\">cable</a> is Apple MFi-certified, guaranteeing 100% compatibility with iPhones (8 to 14 series), iPads, AirPods, and other Lightning devices. No more “This accessory is not supported” errors—Budi works seamlessly with iOS updates, ensuring safe, efficient charging every time.</p>\n<h3>Built to Last</h3>\n<p>Ditch disposable cables! Budi’s reinforced design features:</p>\n<p><strong>Military-grade braided nylon</strong>: Resists tangles, fraying, and everyday wear.</p>\n<p><strong>Aluminum alloy connectors</strong>: Reinforced joints prevent bending and breakage.</p>\n<p><strong>3A high-speed charging</strong>: Delivers up to 18W power for iPhone fast charging (compatible with USB-C Power Delivery adapters).</p>\n<h3>Three Lengths for Every Lifestyle</h3>\n<p>Whether you’re at home, in the car, or on the go, Budi has you covered:</p>\n<p><strong>1 Meter</strong>: Compact and portable, ideal for travel or bedside charging.</p>\n<p><strong>2 Meters</strong>: Extra reach for office desks or backseat charging.</p>\n<p><strong>3 Meters</strong>: Ultimate flexibility for binge-watching in bed or across large rooms.</p>\n<h3>Fast Charging &amp; High-Speed Data Sync</h3>\n<p>Charge your iPhone from 0% to 50% in 30 minutes* (*with a 20W+ USB-C PD adapter). Budi’s advanced wiring also supports 480Mbps data transfer—perfect for backing up photos, videos, or large files.</p>\n<h3>Universal Compatibility</h3>\n<p>Pair your iPhone with modern USB-C <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/\">chargers, MacBook adapters, car chargers, or power banks</a>. Budi bridges the gap between cutting-edge USB-C tech and your trusted Apple devices.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles?</h2>\n<p>As the <strong>UK’s Best Mobile Phone &amp; Accessories Shop</strong>, iRepair Mobiles guarantees:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Genuine Products</strong>: Every Budi cable is 100% authentic, backed by a 12-month warranty.</li>\n<li><strong>Fast UK Shipping</strong>: Order by 3 PM for same-day dispatch.</li>\n<li><strong>Expert Support</strong>: Need help? Our Apple-certified team is just a call or click away.</li>\n<li><strong>Price Match Promise</strong>: Found it cheaper? We’ll match it!</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Upgrade Your Charging Experience Today</h2>\n<p>Don’t let a dead iPhone disrupt your day. With Budi’s durable construction, MFi certification, and versatile lengths, you’ll enjoy:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No more cable replacements every few months.</li>\n<li>Faster charging for busy lifestyles.</li>\n<li>Freedom to use your phone while charging across rooms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Choose Your Budi Cable Now</h2>\n<p>👉 <strong>Limited Stock Alert</strong>: Budi cables are a customer favorite! Grab yours before they sell out.</p>\n<h2>Order Now from iRepair Mobiles</h2>\n<p>Click “Add to Cart” to secure your Budi Type C to iPhone Charging Cable. Enjoy lightning-fast checkout, secure payment options, and peace of mind with our 30-day returns policy.</p>\n<h2>Need More Accessories?</h2>\n<p>Explore our bestselling iPhone cases, screen protectors, and wireless chargers—all curated for quality and value.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Power Up with Budi – Because Your iPhone Deserves the Best.</h2>\n<p>Trusted by thousands of UK customers. <a href=\"https://www.trustpilot.com/review/irepair-mobiles.co.uk\">Rated 4.9/5</a> stars for durability and performance.</p>\n<p>Shop Now at <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles</a> – Your One-Stop Destination for Premium iPhone Accessories.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
