    "longDescription": "<p data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:66\">Unleash big sound from a tiny package with the Sony SRS-XB13 portable wireless speaker, perfect for adventures anywhere in the UK. Don't be fooled by its compact size – <strong>EXTRA BASS™</strong> delivers powerful, room-filling sound that will liven up any gathering.</p>\n<p><strong>Here's why the SRS-XB13 is your essential UK travel companion:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"13:1-20:0\">\n<li data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:142\"><strong>Pocket-Sized Portability:</strong> Small enough to fit in your backpack, handbag, or even a cupholder, the SRS-XB13 goes wherever the party goes.</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:116\"><strong>Big Sound, Anywhere:</strong> Experience rich, immersive audio thanks to EXTRA BASS™ and the Sound Diffusion Processor.</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:143\"><strong>Built to Last:</strong> <strong>Waterproof, dustproof (IP67 rated)</strong>, the SRS-XB13 is ready for any adventure, no matter the unpredictable UK weather.</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:109\"><strong>Non-Stop Music:</strong> Keep the good times rolling with up to <strong>16 hours of battery life</strong> on a single charge.</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:111\"><strong>Easy Hands-Free Calling:</strong> Built-in microphone lets you take calls without needing to reach for your phone.</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"18:1-18:99\"><strong>Fast and Easy Charging:</strong> USB-C charging port makes it simple to power up your speaker quickly.</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"19:1-20:0\"><strong>Find Your Style:</strong> Choose from a variety of colours including Black, Taupe, Coral Pink, or Light Blue to match your personality.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Follow <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles</a> On <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\">Instagram</a> For Latest Offers And Updates.</p>\n"
