      "description": "Stay active with Belkin SportFit Plus Armband! Secure, sweatproof design for iPhone 6-8 Plus. Perfect for workouts. Shop now at iRepair Mobiles!",
      "canonical": "https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product/belkin-sportfit-plus-armband-black/",
