    "description": "10W Fast Wireless Charging: Delivers rapid, safe wireless power.\nUniversal Compatibility: Works with almost any Qi-enabled device or accessory.\nEliminates Cable Clutter: Charge all main devices without dealing with multiple cables.\nIntuitive Design: Easy-align valleys and coils for foolproof charging.\nCase Tested: Charges through cases up to 3mm thick.\nCharge 5 Devices: Extra USB-A port for an additional device.\nApple Watch Compatible: Adapter allows seamless integration with original Apple Watch cable.\nZAGG Quality: Tested at three production stages for unmatched output, efficiency, and enduring performance.",
