    "longDescription": "<h3>Qi Certified Wireless-Car-Charging Convenience</h3>\n<p>Experience the pinnacle of convenience with the ZENS Wireless-Car-Charger (5W), a Qi-certified innovation designed for your car's windscreen or dashboard. This sleek charger seamlessly integrates into your vehicle, providing a hassle-free and elegant solution to keep your smartphone powered throughout your journey.</p>\n<h3>Unobtrusive Design for Seamless Integration</h3>\n<p>Embrace the elegance of simplicity with the Car-Charger. Its refined and straightforward design effortlessly blends into your car's interior, adding a touch of sophistication while remaining unobtrusive. Say goodbye to cluttered charging cables and welcome a seamless charging experience that complements your car's aesthetics.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_14720\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-14720\" style=\"width: 300px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-14720\" src=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/QC-1-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"ZENS Wireless car charger (5W) (Qi certified I Soft-Touch Finish)\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-14720\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">ZENS Wireless car charger (5W) (Qi certified I Soft-Touch Finish)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_14719\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-14719\" style=\"width: 300px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-14719\" src=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/QC-4-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"ZENS Wireless car charger (5W) (Qi certified I Soft-Touch Finish)\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-14719\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">ZENS Wireless car charger (5W) (Qi certified I Soft-Touch Finish)</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>Effortless Charging, Universal Compatibility<a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">.</a></h3>\n<p>With its Qi-ready technology, charging your smartphone is as simple as placing it in the cradle. The ZENS Wireless-Car-Charger accommodates various smartphone sizes, including Apple iPhone X, 8, 8 Plus, Samsung Galaxy S9, S9+, and other common models. Enjoy the ease of recharging your device without the hassle of plugging in cables each time you enter your car<a href=\"http://facebook.com/irepairmobiles.uk\">.</a></p>\n<h3>Comprehensive Package for Added Convenience with ZENS Wireless car charger</h3>\n<p>The ZENS Wireless-Car-Charger comes with everything you need for a convenient setup. Included in the package are the wireless car charger itself, a USB cable for versatile connectivity options, and an adapter plate designed specifically for dashboard mounting. Experience a hassle-free installation process and start enjoying the benefits of wireless charging instantly.</p>\n"
