    "type": "simple",
    "shortDescription": "Crystal-Clear Sound – Enjoy deep bass & crisp audio for music and calls.\nBuilt-in Mic – Hands-free calling with noise-free clarity.\nComfortable Fit – Ergonomic design for all-day wear.\nLong Battery Life – 6-8 hours of playtime on a single charge.\nBluetooth 5.0+ – Stable, lag-free wireless connectivity.\nSweat-Resistant – Perfect for workouts & outdoor activities.\nUniversal Compatibility – Works with Android, iOS & Bluetooth devices.\nLightweight & Stylish – Sleek design for everyday use.",
    "longDescription": "<h2>BWOO Earphone with Mic – Premium Sound &amp; Hands-Free Convenience</h2>\n<p>Looking for high-quality, affordable <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/earbuds-and-headphones/\">Bluetooth earbuds</a> that deliver crisp sound and seamless connectivity? The BWOO Earphone is designed for music lovers, professionals, and everyday users who demand clarity, comfort, and convenience.</p>\n<p>Whether you're commuting, working out, or taking calls, these hands-free earphones provide an immersive audio experience with deep bass and noise-free calls. With a built-in mic and ergonomic design, the BWOO Earphone ensures long-lasting comfort and superior performance.</p>\n<p>At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we bring you the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/\">best mobile accessories in the UK</a>, and the BWOO Earbuds is no exception. Keep reading to discover why this is the perfect choice for your audio needs!</p>\n<h2>Why Choose BWOO Earphone?</h2>\n<h3>1. Crystal-Clear Sound Quality</h3>\n<p>Experience rich, balanced audio with deep bass and crisp highs. The BWOO Earphone delivers studio-quality sound, making every beat, note, and call crystal clear.</p>\n<h3>2. Built-in Mic for Hands-Free Calls</h3>\n<p>Stay connected effortlessly with the integrated microphone. Whether you're in a meeting, driving, or multitasking, enjoy noise-free calls with superior voice pickup.</p>\n<h3>3. Comfortable &amp; Secure Fit</h3>\n<p>Designed for all-day wear, the ergonomic BWOO Earphone fits snugly in your ears without discomfort. The lightweight build ensures stability, even during workouts.</p>\n<h3>4. Long-Lasting Battery Life</h3>\n<p>Enjoy extended playtime with a powerful battery that keeps up with your day. No more frequent charging—just uninterrupted music and calls.</p>\n<h3>5. Seamless Bluetooth Connectivity</h3>\n<p>Pair effortlessly with your smartphone, tablet, or laptop. The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/earbuds-and-headphones/earbuds/\">Bluetooth earbuds</a> offer a stable connection with no lag, perfect for gaming and streaming.</p>\n<h3>6. Stylish &amp; Durable Design</h3>\n<p>Sleek and modern, the BWOO Earbuds is built to last. The sweat-resistant design makes it ideal for workouts and outdoor activities.</p>\n<h2>Perfect for Everyday Use</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Music Lovers: Immerse yourself in high-fidelity sound.</li>\n<li>Professionals: Take calls clearly without background noise.</li>\n<li>Fitness Enthusiasts: Secure fit for running, gym, and sports.</li>\n<li>Gamers &amp; Streamers: Low-latency audio for an immersive experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Driver Size: 10mm dynamic driver</li>\n<li>Battery Life: Up to 6-8 hours (varies by usage)</li>\n<li>Charging Time: 1-2 hours</li>\n<li>Bluetooth Version: 5.0+</li>\n<li>Range: Up to 10 meters</li>\n<li>Weight: Ultra-lightweight (comfortable for long wear)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\n<p><strong>1. How do I pair my BWOO Earbuds with my phone?</strong><br />\nSimply turn on Bluetooth on your device, open the earbud case, and select \"BWOO Earbuds\" from the available devices.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Is the BWOO Earbuds sweatproof?</strong><br />\nYes, it has a sweat-resistant design, making it ideal for workouts and outdoor activities.</p>\n<p><strong>3. How long does the battery last?</strong><br />\nThe BWOO Earbuds offers 6-8 hours of playtime on a single charge, with additional backup from the charging case.</p>\n<p><strong>4. Can I use one earbud at a time?</strong><br />\nYes, the BWOO Earbuds supports single-earbud use, perfect for calls or extended listening.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Does it work with Android and iOS?</strong><br />\nAbsolutely! These <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/earbuds-and-headphones/earbuds/\">Bluetooth earbuds</a> are compatible with all Bluetooth-enabled devices, including iPhones, Android phones, and tablets.</p>\n<p><strong>6. What’s the warranty period?</strong><br />\nAt <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we offer a 12-month warranty on the BWOO Earbuds for your peace of mind.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy From iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Trusted UK Seller – Genuine products with warranty</li>\n<li>Fast Delivery – Quick shipping across the UK</li>\n<li>Excellent Customer Support – Hassle-free returns &amp; assistance</li>\n<li>Best Prices – Affordable deals on <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/\">premium accessories</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\n<p>The BWOO Earphone is a perfect blend of style, comfort, and performance. Whether you need hands-free calling, immersive music, or a reliable workout companion, these Bluetooth earbuds deliver exceptional value.</p>\n<p>Upgrade your audio experience today! Visit <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a> and grab your BWOO Earphone now.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk\">Follow us on Instagram!</a></p>\n"
