    "type": "simple",
    "shortDescription": "Worldwide Compatibility – Works in 150+ countries (USA, UK, EU, AU, Asia & more).\nFast Charging – Dual USB + Type-C ports (3.4A total output).\nCompact & Lightweight – Fits easily in your bag or pocket.\n4-in-1 Adjustable Plug – Supports US, UK, EU & AU sockets.\nSmart Safety Protection – Prevents overheating & short circuits.\nMulti-Device Charging – Power up 3 gadgets at once.\nTravel-Friendly – Perfect for phones, laptops, cameras & more.",
    "longDescription": "<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Travelling abroad? Don’t let different power outlets slow you down! The Universal Travel Adaptor is your ultimate charging companion, designed to keep all your devices powered up in 150+ countries, ichancluding the USA, UK, Europe, Australia, and Asia. Whether you need a UK to America travel adaptor, a Euro travel adaptor, or an Europe to UK travel adaptor, this compact and reliable gadget has got you covered.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose This Universal Travel Adaptor?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Works Worldwide</strong> – Compatible with Type A, C, G, and I sockets (USA, UK, EU, AU, Asia &amp; more).</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Fast Charging</strong> – Built-in USB &amp; Type-C ports for simultaneous charging.</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Compact &amp; Lightweight</strong> – Fits easily in your bag or pocket.</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Safety Certified</strong> – Overload protection &amp; fire-resistant materials.</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Universal Compatibility</strong> – Works with phones, laptops, cameras, and more.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Stay Connected Wherever You Go</h2>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Tired of carrying multiple adapters for different countries? This Universal Travel Adaptor eliminates the hassle by supporting almost every plug type worldwide. Whether you're a frequent flyer or a holidaymaker, this adaptor ensures your phone, tablet, laptop, or camera never runs out of battery.</p>\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>4-in-1 Plug System</strong> – Adjustable pins for UK, US, EU, and AU sockets.</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Dual USB + Type-C Ports</strong> – Charge 3 devices at once (up to 3.4A total output).</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Smart IC Technology</strong> – Auto-detects devices for optimal charging speed.</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Compact &amp; Travel-Friendly</strong> – Fits in your pocket, perfect for on-the-go use.</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Built-in Safety Protections</strong> – Prevents overheating, short circuits, and power surges.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Perfect for Business Trips, Holidays &amp; Backpacking</h2>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Whether you're heading to New York, Paris, Tokyo, or Sydney, this <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/chargers-and-cables/mobile-charger/\">charger </a>plug converter ensures you stay powered up. No more searching for adapters at airports or struggling with incompatible sockets. Just plug in and charge effortlessly!</p>\n<h3>Compatible With:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Smartphones</strong> (iPhone, Samsung, Huawei)</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Laptops &amp; Tablets</strong> (MacBook, iPad, Surface)</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Cameras &amp; Drones</strong> (GoPro, DSLR)</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Accessories</strong> (Power Banks, Wireless Earbuds)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>FAQs – Your Questions Answered</h2>\n<p><strong>1. Does this Universal Travel Adaptor work in the USA?</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Yes! It supports Type A &amp; B sockets (USA, Canada, Mexico). Just slide out the US pins and plug in.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Can I use it in Europe?</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Absolutely! It works with Type C, E, &amp; F sockets (France, Germany, Italy, Spain).</p>\n<p><strong>3. Is this adaptor suitable for UK sockets?</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Yes, it includes Type G pins (UK, Ireland, Singapore, UAE).</p>\n<h3><strong>4. Does it convert voltage?</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">No, this is a plug adaptor only. Check your device’s voltage range (most modern electronics support 100V-240V).</p>\n<p><strong>5. Can I charge multiple devices at once?</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Yes! With 2 USB ports + 1 Type-C, you can charge your phone, tablet, and power bank simultaneously.</p>\n<p><strong>6. Is it safe for high-power devices like hair dryers?</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">No, it’s designed for low-power electronics (phones, laptops). Avoid using with high-wattage appliances.</p>\n<p><strong>7. How durable is this travel adaptor?</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Made with flame-retardant PC material, it’s built to last through countless trips.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy From iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we provide top-quality <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/\">mobile accessories</a> with fast UK shipping and excellent customer support. Our Universal Travel Adaptor is rigorously tested for safety and performance, ensuring you get the best travel companion.</p>\n<h3>Order Yours Today &amp; Travel Hassle-Free!</h3>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Don’t let dead batteries ruin your trip. Grab this Universal Travel Adaptor now and stay charged in any country!</p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Fast UK Delivery</strong></li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>24-Month Warranty</strong></li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Trusted by Thousands of Travellers</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Click \"Add to Cart\" Now &amp; Never Worry About Charging Again!</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/irepairmobiles.uk\">Find us on Facebook!</a></p>\n"
