      "focusKeyword": "samsung a24,samsung galaxy a24,samsung a24 price,best budget smartphone,a24 samsung,samsung a24 5g,samsung galaxy a24 5g,samsung a24 uk,samsung galaxy a24 price,samsung a24 5g price",
