    "longDescription": "<h2>Product Overview</h2>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy S7 is one of Samsung’s most iconic smartphones, combining premium design, outstanding performance, and user-friendly features that still make it a popular choice today. At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we offer the Galaxy S7 Samsung phone in different storage options, fully unlocked, so you can enjoy the freedom to use it with any network provider in the UK or abroad.</p>\n<p>When you choose this phone, you get top quality at the best Samsung Galaxy S7 price, backed by our trusted 1-year warranty and professional UK-based support team.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy the Samsung Galaxy S7 (Unlocked)?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Unlocked Freedom</strong> – Use your <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung mobile</a> Galaxy S7 with any SIM card and switch networks whenever you like. Perfect for frequent travellers and budget-savvy users.</li>\n<li><strong>Different Condition</strong> <strong>Options</strong>– Our devices go through a strict quality check. This Galaxy S7 is in excellent working order, with minimal signs of use, looking almost like new.</li>\n<li><strong>Best Price Guarantee</strong> – Get unbeatable Samsung Galaxy S7 price deals at <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>. Affordable, reliable, and worth every penny.</li>\n<li><strong>Premium Performance</strong> – Powered by Samsung’s advanced processor and smooth interface, the Galaxy S7 still runs apps, games, and browsing effortlessly.</li>\n<li><strong>Iconic Design</strong> – The sleek glass-and-metal body, compact 5.1-inch Super AMOLED display, and slim design make the Galaxy S7 phone stylish and practical.</li>\n<li><strong>1-Year Warranty</strong> – Shop with confidence. Every device we sell comes with a 1-year warranty and 30-day return policy.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Key Specifications – Samsung Galaxy S7</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Model</strong>: Samsung Galaxy S7 (Unlocked)</li>\n<li><strong>Storage</strong>: different storage options (expandable with microSD)</li>\n<li><strong>Display</strong>: 5.1-inch Quad HD Super AMOLED</li>\n<li><strong>Camera</strong>: 12MP rear camera with Dual Pixel technology, 5MP front camera</li>\n<li><strong>Processor</strong>: Exynos 8890 Octa-Core / Snapdragon (variant dependent)</li>\n<li><strong>RAM</strong>: 4GB for smooth multitasking</li>\n<li><strong>Battery</strong>: 3000mAh (with fast charging support)</li>\n<li><strong>Operating System</strong>: Android, upgradable to later versions</li>\n<li><strong>Warranty</strong>: 12 months included with purchase</li>\n<li><strong>Network</strong>: Fully unlocked, works with all UK &amp; international SIMs</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Samsung Galaxy S7 – Performance &amp; Features</h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung mobile</a> Galaxy <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-s-series/\">S7</a> was a flagship device, designed with features that remain relevant even today.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Stunning Display</strong> – The 5.1-inch Quad HD Super AMOLED screen offers vibrant colours, deep blacks, and crisp clarity, ideal for streaming, gaming, or browsing.</li>\n<li><strong>Water &amp; Dust Resistance</strong> – With an IP68 rating, the Galaxy S7 Samsung phone is protected against spills and splashes.</li>\n<li><strong>Powerful Camera</strong> – The 12MP rear camera uses Dual Pixel technology, ensuring quick focus and great results even in low light.</li>\n<li><strong>Expandable Storage</strong> – Unlike many modern phones, the S7 gives you the option to expand memory with a microSD card.</li>\n<li><strong>All-Day Battery</strong> – With fast charging, you can get hours of power in just minutes.</li>\n<li><strong>Premium Build Quality</strong> – Slim, stylish, and comfortable to hold, the S7 looks and feels premium.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Who Is the Samsung Galaxy S7 For?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Everyday Users who want a reliable smartphone at an affordable price.</li>\n<li>Students &amp; Professionals who need an unlocked device for flexibility and productivity.</li>\n<li>Travelers who prefer switching between local SIM cards abroad.</li>\n<li>Budget-Conscious Buyers looking for a premium phone experience without the high cost of new models.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, you don’t just buy a phone – you buy peace of mind with quality assurance, warranty, and local UK support.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>UK’s #1 <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">Mobile Phone</a> &amp; Accessories Shop</li>\n<li>100% Unlocked Samsung Galaxy S7 devices – no contracts, no limits</li>\n<li>Affordable Samsung Galaxy S7 price compared to high-street retailers</li>\n<li>Trusted EEAT-friendly service: expertise, authority, and customer trust built through years of experience</li>\n<li>UK-based customer support team to assist you anytime</li>\n<li>Free &amp; fast UK shipping</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\n<p><strong>Q1: Is the Samsung Galaxy S7 still a good phone in 2025?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes! The Galaxy S7 Samsung phone is still a solid device. It handles calls, messaging, browsing, social media, and light apps perfectly. With its premium build and affordable price, it’s a great value choice.</p>\n<p><strong>Q2: What does A Grade mean?</strong></p>\n<p>“A Grade” means the phone is in excellent condition – fully tested, fully functional, and with very minimal cosmetic signs of use. It works like new but at a lower price.</p>\n<p><strong>Q3: Is this Samsung Galaxy S7 unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Absolutely. The phone is factory unlocked and works with all UK and international SIM cards. You can use O2, EE, Vodafone, Three, or any other provider.</p>\n<p><strong>Q4: What warranty comes with this phone?</strong></p>\n<p>Every Samsung Galaxy S7 purchased from <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a> comes with a 12-month warranty for hardware faults, plus a 30-day money-back guarantee.</p>\n<p><strong>Q5: How much is the Samsung Galaxy S7 price at iRepair Mobiles UK?</strong></p>\n<p>Our prices are competitively set to give you the best value for money. Check our website for today’s Samsung Galaxy S7 price deals.</p>\n<p><strong>Q6: Does the Galaxy S7 support fast charging?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the Galaxy S7 supports fast charging technology, so you can quickly power up your device when needed.</p>\n<p><strong>Q7: Can I expand the storage of the Samsung Galaxy S7?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/used-samsung-phones/\">Used </a>Galaxy S7 supports microSD cards, allowing you to expand the storage beyond 32GB.</p>\n<p><strong>Q8: Will the phone receive software updates?</strong></p>\n<p>While the phone may not receive the latest Android versions, it remains secure and functional for everyday use.</p>\n<h2>Final Words</h2>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy S7 – Unlocked is an ideal choice if you want a reliable, stylish, and affordable smartphone without compromising on quality. With <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, you get more than just a phone – you get a trusted partner in <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">mobile devices</a>.</p>\n<p>Order today and enjoy free UK delivery, a 12-month warranty, and unbeatable prices on Samsung Galaxy S7 phones.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\">Follow for More!</a></p>\n"
