    "type": "simple",
    "shortDescription": "6.6&#8243; FHD+ Super AMOLED Display – 120Hz refresh rate for ultra-smooth visuals\n48MP Triple Camera – Stunning photos in any light\nMediaTek Dimensity 1080 – Lag-free 5G performance\n5000mAh Battery – All-day power with 25W fast charging\nIP67 Rating – Resistant to water & dust",
    "longDescription": "<h2>Samsung Galaxy A34 5G – A Premium Mid-Range Smartphone with 5G Speed</h2>\n<p>Looking for a budget-friendly yet powerful smartphone that doesn’t compromise on performance? The Samsung Galaxy A34 5G is here to impress! With a 6.6-inch FHD+ OLED display, 48MP triple camera, and a long-lasting 5000mAh battery, this phone delivers exceptional value for its price.</p>\n<p>Whether you're a student, professional, or casual user, the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-a-series/\">Samsung Galaxy A34 5G</a> offers smooth performance, vivid visuals, and reliable battery life—all wrapped in a sleek, modern design.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the Samsung Galaxy A34 5G?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>6.6-inch FHD+ Super AMOLED Display – Enjoy sharp, vibrant visuals with a 120Hz refresh rate for smooth scrolling and gaming.</li>\n<li>48MP Triple Camera System – Capture stunning photos with the main, ultra-wide, and macro lenses, perfect for any scenario.</li>\n<li>Long-Lasting 5000mAh Battery – Stay powered all day with fast 25W charging support.</li>\n<li>5G Connectivity &amp; Powerful Performance – Powered by the MediaTek Dimensity 1080 chipset and 6GB RAM for lag-free multitasking.</li>\n<li>Unlocked &amp; Future-Ready – Works with any UK network, with 4 years of OS updates and 5 years of security patches.</li>\n<li>IP67 Water &amp; Dust Resistance – Built to withstand splashes and dust, making it durable for daily use.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Samsung Galaxy A34 5G Review – A Closer Look at the Features</h2>\n<h3>1. Stunning 6.6-inch OLED Display</h3>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A34 5G features a large 6.6-inch FHD+ OLED display with a 120Hz refresh rate, ensuring smooth animations and vivid colours. Whether you're streaming movies, gaming, or browsing, the Vision Booster technology enhances outdoor visibility up to 1000 nits, making it easy to use under sunlight.</p>\n<p>Compared to its predecessor, the Galaxy A33, this model offers a brighter, more responsive screen—perfect for media lovers.</p>\n<h3>2. Powerful Triple Camera Setup</h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-a-series/\">Samsung Galaxy A34</a> 5G comes with a versatile triple-camera system:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>48MP Main Camera – Takes sharp, detailed photos with OIS (Optical Image Stabilization) for steady shots.</li>\n<li>8MP Ultra-Wide Lens – Perfect for landscapes and group shots with a 123° field of view.</li>\n<li>5MP Macro Camera – Get up-close shots with fine details.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>While it may not match flagship cameras, the Galaxy A34 5G delivers great image quality for its price range, with realistic colours and good low-light performance.</p>\n<h3>3. Long-Lasting Battery &amp; Fast Charging</h3>\n<p>With a massive 5000mAh battery, the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung Galaxy</a> A34 5G easily lasts a full day (or more) on a single charge. The 25W fast charging ensures you spend less time plugged in and more time using your phone.</p>\n<h3>4. Smooth Performance with MediaTek Dimensity 1080</h3>\n<p>The MediaTek Dimensity 1080 chipset, paired with 6GB RAM, ensures fast app launches, smooth gaming, and seamless multitasking. Whether you're playing Genshin Impact or switching between apps, this phone handles it all without lag.</p>\n<h3>5. Premium Design &amp; Durability</h3>\n<p>Unlike cheaper plastic phones, the Galaxy A34 5G has a premium matte finish with Gorilla Glass 5 protection on the front. It’s also IP67-rated, meaning it’s resistant to water splashes and dust—great for outdoor use.</p>\n<h2>Samsung Galaxy A34 5G vs. Other Models</h2>\n<div class=\"markdown-table-wrapper\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Feature</th>\n<th><strong>Galaxy A34 5G</strong></th>\n<th><strong>Galaxy A33</strong></th>\n<th><strong>Galaxy A54</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Display</strong></td>\n<td>6.6\" OLED, 120Hz</td>\n<td>6.4\" OLED, 90Hz</td>\n<td>6.4\" OLED, 120Hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Processor</strong></td>\n<td>Dimensity 1080</td>\n<td>Exynos 1280</td>\n<td>Exynos 1380</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Battery</strong></td>\n<td>5000mAh</td>\n<td>5000mAh</td>\n<td>5000mAh</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Cameras</strong></td>\n<td>48MP+8MP+5MP</td>\n<td>48MP+8MP+5MP+2MP</td>\n<td>50MP+12MP+5MP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Price</strong></td>\n<td>More Affordable</td>\n<td>Older Model</td>\n<td>Higher Price</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung </a>Galaxy A34 5G is the best budget 5G phone in 2024, offering better performance than the A33 while being more affordable than the A54.</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">FAQs – Samsung Galaxy A34 5G</span></h2>\n<p><strong>1. Is the Samsung Galaxy A34 5G waterproof?</strong><br />\nYes! It has an IP67 rating, meaning it can handle water splashes and dust. However, it’s not fully waterproof for swimming.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Does the Samsung Galaxy A34 5G support expandable storage?</strong><br />\nAbsolutely! It has a microSD slot that supports up to 1TB, perfect for extra photos, videos, and apps.</p>\n<p><strong>3. How good is the battery life?</strong><br />\nThe 5000mAh battery lasts all day with moderate use. With 25W fast charging, you can quickly top up when needed.</p>\n<p><strong>4. Does it have a headphone jack?</strong><br />\nYes! Unlike many modern phones, the Galaxy A34 5G keeps the 3.5mm headphone jack, so you can use wired headphones.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Is the Samsung Galaxy A34 5G good for gaming?</strong><br />\nThanks to the Dimensity 1080 chipset, it handles casual and mid-range games smoothly. For high-end gaming, you may need to lower graphics settings.</p>\n<p><strong>6. How many years of updates will it get?</strong><br />\nSamsung promises 4 major Android updates and 5 years of security patches, making it a future-proof choice.</p>\n<h2>Final Verdict – Should You Buy the Samsung Galaxy A34 5G?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Best for: Budget-conscious users who want a premium OLED display, solid cameras, and long battery life.</li>\n<li>Not ideal for: Users who need flagship-level performance or professional-grade cameras.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Where to Buy?</strong></p>\n<p>At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we offer the best deals on the Samsung Galaxy A34 5G – Unlocked. Get yours today with fast UK delivery and expert support. Upgrade to the Samsung Galaxy A34 5G now and experience premium performance at an unbeatable price!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow us on Instagram!</strong></a></p>\n"
