    "shortDescription": "Model: iPhone 14 Pro Max\nCondition: Unlocked, works with all UK & worldwide networks\nStorage: 128GB, 256GB, 512GB, 1TB\nDisplay: 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED, 120Hz refresh rate, 2000 nits peak brightness\nCamera: Triple-lens 48MP main, 12MP ultra-wide, 12MP telephoto (3x optical zoom, ProRAW support)\nPerformance: Apple A16 Bionic chip with 6GB RAM – 20% faster & 10% more efficient than A15\nBattery: All-day use, fast charging, MagSafe wireless charging\nBuild: Ceramic Shield glass, stainless steel frame, IP68 water resistance",
    "longDescription": "<h2>iPhone 14 Pro Max – Unlocked</h2>\n<p>Looking for the Apple iPhone 14 Pro Max at the best value in the UK? At iRepair Mobiles UK, we bring you the iPhone 14 Pro Max – Unlocked at a competitive iPhone 14 Pro Max price. Whether you are upgrading from an older iPhone or switching from Android, this flagship smartphone offers unmatched power, a stunning display, and premium design.</p>\n<p>With the A16 Bionic chip, 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display, Dynamic Island, and 48MP Pro camera system, the iPhone Pro Max 14 delivers breathtaking performance and luxury all in one. When you buy iPhone 14 Pro Max from us, you’re guaranteed authentic quality, excellent customer service, and free UK delivery.</p>\n<h2>Key Highlights of iPhone 14 Pro Max</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Model: <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">iPhone</a> 14 Pro Max</li>\n<li>Condition: Unlocked, works with all UK &amp; worldwide networks</li>\n<li>Storage: 128GB, 256GB, 512GB, 1TB</li>\n<li>Display: 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED, 120Hz refresh rate, 2000 nits peak brightness</li>\n<li>Camera: Triple-lens 48MP main, 12MP ultra-wide, 12MP telephoto (3x optical zoom, ProRAW support)</li>\n<li>Performance: Apple A16 Bionic chip with 6GB RAM – 20% faster &amp; 10% more efficient than A15</li>\n<li>Battery: All-day use, fast charging, MagSafe wireless charging</li>\n<li>Build: Ceramic Shield glass, stainless steel frame, IP68 water resistance</li>\n<li>Features: Always-On Display, Face ID, Dynamic Island, Emergency Satellite Calls</li>\n<li>Colours: Space Black, Deep Purple, Silver, Gold</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why Choose iPhone 14 Pro Max?</h2>\n<h3>1. Dynamic Island – Smart Innovation</h3>\n<p>The Dynamic Island is <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">Apple’s</a> reimagined notch, blending notifications, alerts, and multitasking features seamlessly. From incoming calls to music controls, everything feels fluid and interactive.</p>\n<h3>2. Pro Display – Bigger &amp; Brighter</h3>\n<p>The 6.7-inch OLED display comes with 120Hz refresh rate, HDR10, Dolby Vision, and an incredible 2000 nits brightness, making it one of the brightest smartphones ever. Perfect for gaming, streaming, or editing photos.</p>\n<h3>3. Professional-Grade Camera System</h3>\n<p>Equipped with a 48MP quad-pixel main sensor, the iPhone 14 Pro Max captures exceptional detail. The 12MP ultra-wide (120°) lens enhances landscape shots, while the 12MP telephoto (77mm) lens with 3x zoom allows professional portrait photography. ProRAW and 4K ProRes video support make it a content creator’s dream.</p>\n<h3>4. A16 Bionic Powerhouse</h3>\n<p>Apple’s A16 Bionic chip ensures faster processing, smooth multitasking, and better power efficiency. Apps launch instantly, gaming is lag-free, and photo/video editing is seamless.</p>\n<h3>5. All-Day Battery &amp; Fast Charging</h3>\n<p>With smarter battery management, the iPhone 14 Pro Max lasts all day. Enjoy 20 hours+ video playback, and charge up to 50% in under 30 minutes with fast charging.</p>\n<h3>6. Premium Design – Built to Last</h3>\n<p>Crafted from stainless steel casing and Ceramic Shield glass, the iPhone 14 Pro Max is both elegant and durable. Rated IP68 waterproof, it withstands spills, splashes, and dust.</p>\n<h3>7. Next-Level Safety Features</h3>\n<p>With Emergency SOS via Satellite, Crash Detection, and advanced Face ID security, Apple prioritises your safety wherever you are.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Best UK shop for iPhone sales &amp; repairs</li>\n<li>100% genuine Apple devices – unlocked &amp; SIM-free</li>\n<li>Affordable iPhone 14 Pro Max price with warranty</li>\n<li>Next-day delivery across the UK</li>\n<li>Trusted by thousands of happy customers</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When you buy iPhone 14 Pro Max from iRepair Mobiles, you’re not just buying a phone—you’re investing in reliability, style, and long-term performance.</p>\n<h2>FAQs – iPhone 14 Pro Max</h2>\n<p><strong>1. Is the iPhone 14 Pro Max unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, our iPhone 14 Pro Max comes factory unlocked and works with all UK &amp; international carriers.</p>\n<p><strong>2. What does A Grade mean?</strong></p>\n<p>“A Grade” means the phone is in new condition, tested for performance, and free from scratches or defects. You’ll receive a product as good as brand new, but at a better price.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Does this iPhone come with a warranty?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, all our iPhones include a standard 12-month warranty covering manufacturing faults. Extended warranty options are available.</p>\n<p><strong>4. What storage options are available?</strong></p>\n<p>We stock the iPhone 14 Pro Max in 128GB, 256GB, 512GB, and 1TB storage capacities.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Is this the latest iPhone?</strong></p>\n<p>The iPhone 14 Pro Max is Apple’s 2022 flagship model. It remains one of the most powerful smartphones in 2024, offering premium features at a better value compared to the newer models.</p>\n<p><strong>6. Does it support 5G?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the iPhone 14 Pro Max supports full 5G connectivity for ultra-fast browsing, streaming, and downloads.</p>\n<p><strong>7. Does it come with accessories?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, you’ll get the original charging cable, with optional add-ons like fast chargers, cases, and screen protectors available at iRepair Mobiles UK.</p>\n<p><strong>8. What colours are available?</strong></p>\n<p>Choose from Space Black, Deep Purple, Silver, and Gold. Availability may vary, so check stock before purchasing.</p>\n<p><strong>9. Can I trade in my old phone?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, we offer trade-in services where you can exchange your old device for credit towards a new iPhone.</p>\n<p><strong>10. Why buy from iRepair Mobiles UK instead of Apple?</strong></p>\n<p>We offer better pricing, flexible deals, and UK-wide warranty support, making us the best place to buy iPhone 14 Pro Max in the UK.</p>\n<h2>Final Verdict</h2>\n<p>The iPhone 14 Pro Max is more than just a smartphone—it’s Apple’s ultimate statement of innovation, luxury, and performance. With its Dynamic Island, pro-level camera system, blazing A16 chip, and all-day battery, it’s designed for professionals, content creators, and everyday users who want nothing but the best.</p>\n<p>If you’re searching for the best iPhone 14 Pro Max price in the UK, look no further than <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/used-iphones/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>. Get yours today—fast delivery, warranty included, and excellent customer support guaranteed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
