    "shortDescription": "Storage: 128GB, 256GB, 512GB\nDisplay: 6.1-inch OLED, 1179 x 2556 resolution, 120Hz refresh rate, 2000 nits peak brightness, Always-On Display\nProcessor: A16 Bionic chip (20% more power-efficient, 10% faster than A15)\n48MP main lens with Quad Pixel sensor\n12MP telephoto lens (3x optical zoom, 77mm)\n12MP ultra-wide (120° field of view)\n12MP TrueDepth front camera with Face ID\nDesign: Stainless steel casing, Ceramic Shield protection, premium angular design\nConnectivity: 5G, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.3, eSIM & nano SIM support",
    "longDescription": "<h2>iPhone 14 Pro – Unlocked</h2>\n<p>Looking for a smartphone that combines power, elegance, and innovation? The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">iPhone 14</a> Pro – Unlocked is the ultimate choice for tech enthusiasts and everyday users alike. At iRepair Mobiles UK, we bring you this <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">Apple</a> iPhone 14 Pro at a competitive price, ensuring you get a high-quality, unlocked device that works seamlessly with any UK or international carrier.</p>\n<p>With its 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display, Dynamic Island, and A16 Bionic processor, the iPhone 14 Pro delivers unmatched speed, smoothness, and visual brilliance. Whether you’re a professional photographer, a gamer, or just someone who loves premium smartphones, this device is built to outperform.</p>\n<h2>Key Features of iPhone 14 Pro</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Storage</strong>: 128GB, 256GB, 512</li>\n<li><strong>Display</strong>: 6.1-inch OLED, 1179 x 2556 resolution, 120Hz refresh rate, 2000 nits peak brightness, Always-On Display</li>\n<li><strong>Processor</strong>: A16 Bionic chip (20% more power-efficient, 10% faster than A15)</li>\n<li>48MP main lens with Quad Pixel sensor</li>\n<li>12MP telephoto lens (3x optical zoom, 77mm)</li>\n<li>12MP ultra-wide (120° field of view)</li>\n<li>12MP TrueDepth front camera with Face ID</li>\n<li><strong>Design</strong>: Stainless steel casing, Ceramic Shield protection, premium angular design</li>\n<li><strong>Connectivity</strong>: 5G, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.3, eSIM &amp; nano SIM support</li>\n<li><strong>Safety Features</strong>: Crash detection, Emergency SOS via satellite (ideal for outdoor adventures)</li>\n<li><strong>Operating System</strong>: iOS (latest version with guaranteed long-term updates)</li>\n<li><strong>Battery</strong> Life: All-day performance with fast charging and MagSafe wireless charging support</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why Choose the iPhone 14 Pro?</h2>\n<h3>1. Stunning Display</h3>\n<p>The Dynamic Island redefines how you interact with your iPhone. With adaptive brightness of up to 2000 nits, the OLED display is twice as bright outdoors compared to older iPhone models, making it perfect for videos, gaming, or browsing under the sun.</p>\n<h3>2. Pro-Level Photography</h3>\n<p>Capture every moment in stunning detail. The new 48MP Quad Pixel sensor uses pixel-binning technology to deliver exceptional low-light photos, while ProRAW mode is ideal for professional editing.</p>\n<h3>3. Power &amp; Efficiency</h3>\n<p>Powered by the A16 Bionic chip, the iPhone 14 Pro runs demanding apps and games with ease. It’s faster and more efficient than Android alternatives, with up to 20% power savings.</p>\n<h3>4. Safety at Your Fingertips</h3>\n<p>With Crash Detection and Emergency SOS via satellite, the iPhone 14 Pro keeps you connected even when mobile networks aren’t available—an essential feature for travellers and adventurers.</p>\n<h3>5. Premium Build</h3>\n<p>Crafted with stainless steel edges and Apple’s Ceramic Shield glass, this iPhone is designed for durability without compromising on style.</p>\n<h2>iPhone 14 Pro Price UK</h2>\n<p>At launch, the Apple iPhone 14 Pro started at £1,099. At iRepair Mobiles UK, we offer the best iPhone 14 Pro price in the UK with different condition devices, ensuring great value for money.</p>\n<p>We also stock other storage options (256GB, 512GB, 1TB) at competitive prices. Browse in-store or online to explore the best deals on iPhone 14 Pro UK.</p>\n<h2>What You Get with iRepair Mobiles UK</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>100% Unlocked iPhone 14 Pro – works with any UK or international network</li>\n<li>12-Month Warranty included for peace of mind</li>\n<li>UK-based after-sales support from our expert team</li>\n<li>Optional screen protectors, Apple accessories, and repair plans available in-store</li>\n<li>Fast, reliable shipping across the UK</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Insights</h2>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we’re more than just a retailer—we’re certified mobile repair specialists and trusted resellers. With years of experience in the UK mobile market, our team ensures every product is carefully tested, quality-checked, and backed by our guarantee. Our expertise in <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">Apple</a> smartphones means you get not only a great product but also professional support whenever you need it.</p>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\n<p><strong>Q1: Is the iPhone 14 Pro unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, this iPhone 14 Pro is fully unlocked. It works with all UK networks (O2, EE, Vodafone, Three, etc.) and international SIM cards.</p>\n<p><strong>Q2: What does “A Grade” mean?</strong></p>\n<p>It means the device is used, and in perfect condition, with all original features intact. “A Grade” ensures premium quality.</p>\n<p><strong>Q3: Does this iPhone 14 Pro come with a warranty?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, we provide a 12-month warranty at iRepair Mobiles UK. This covers manufacturing faults and gives you peace of mind.</p>\n<p><strong>Q4: What colours are available?</strong></p>\n<p>The iPhone 14 Pro comes in Space Black, Silver, Gold, and Deep Purple. Availability may vary, so check with us for stock updates.</p>\n<p><strong>Q5: Does the iPhone 14 Pro have better cameras than the iPhone 13 Pro?</strong></p>\n<p>Absolutely. The iPhone 14 Pro introduces a 48MP main camera with pixel-binning technology, improved low-light photography, and ProRAW support—making it a major upgrade from the iPhone 13 Pro.</p>\n<p><strong>Q6: Does the iPhone 14 Pro support Always-On Display?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes. For the first time, Apple has introduced the Always-On Display feature, available only in the Pro models.</p>\n<p><strong>Q7: How is the battery life of iPhone 14 Pro?</strong></p>\n<p>The iPhone 14 Pro comfortably lasts a full day of normal use, with fast charging and MagSafe wireless charging support for added convenience.</p>\n<p><strong>Q8: Does this iPhone come with a charger?</strong></p>\n<p>Apple does not include a charger or headphones in the box. However, we stock <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/used-iphones/\">Apple</a> MagSafe chargers and official accessories at iRepair Mobiles UK.</p>\n<p><strong>Q9: Why buy from iRepair Mobiles UK instead of other online shops?</strong></p>\n<p>Because we’re a trusted UK-based store with expertise in mobile phones, repairs, and accessories. You don’t just get a phone—you get professional after-sales service, genuine parts, and a team that cares.</p>\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\n<p>The iPhone 14 Pro – Unlocked is not just a smartphone; it’s a powerful device that combines style, speed, and cutting-edge features. Whether you’re upgrading from an older iPhone or switching from Android, this is a future-ready investment in premium technology.</p>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we guarantee competitive pricing, expert advice, and peace of mind with every purchase. Shop online today or visit us in-store to experience the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/iphone-14-series/\">Apple iPhone 14</a> Pro first-hand.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
