    "shortDescription": "Display: 12.4&#8243; Super AMOLED, 2800 x 1752 (120Hz, HDR10+)\nProcessor: Qualcomm Snapdragon 865+ Octa-core, Adreno 650 GPU\nRAM: 6GB LPDDR5\nStorage: 128GB, 256GB, 512GB UFS 3.0 (Expandable up to 1TB via microSD)\nRear Cameras: 13MP (wide) + 5MP (ultrawide), 4K video\nFront Camera: 8MP (wide), 1080p video",
    "longDescription": "<p>Looking for a premium <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/\">tablet</a> that blends power, performance, and style? The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/samsung-galaxy-tabs/\">Samsung Galaxy Tab</a> S7 Plus is more than just a <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/\">tablet</a>—it’s a complete productivity and entertainment powerhouse. With its 12.4-inch Super AMOLED display, blazing-fast Qualcomm Snapdragon 865+ processor, and 5G connectivity, this device redefines what a <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/samsung-galaxy-tabs/\">Samsung tablet</a> can do.</p>\n<p>At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we offer the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/samsung-galaxy-tabs/\">Samsung Tab</a> S7 Plus at the best value in the market. Whether you want it for business, study, or entertainment, this <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/\">tablet</a> ensures you stay productive, connected, and entertained all day long.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the Samsung Galaxy Tab S7 Plus?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Immersive Display</strong> – A 12.4-inch Super AMOLED screen with a 120Hz refresh rate for liquid-smooth scrolling and gaming.</li>\n<li><strong>PC-like Productivity</strong> – Pair with the Samsung S Pen and Samsung DeX mode to turn your <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/\">tablet</a> into a mini workstation.</li>\n<li><strong>Powerful Performance</strong> – Qualcomm Snapdragon 865+ chipset with 6GB RAM for lightning-fast multitasking.</li>\n<li><strong>5G Connectivity</strong> – Enjoy seamless video calls, online gaming, and streaming with ultra-fast internet speeds.</li>\n<li><strong>Quad AKG Speakers with Dolby Atmos</strong> – Surround sound experience that makes movies and music come alive.</li>\n<li><strong>Long-lasting Battery</strong> – 10,090 mAh battery with 14+ hours video playback and fast charging.</li>\n<li><strong>Quality</strong> – Available in different conditions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Key Features of the Samsung S7 Plus Tablet</h2>\n<h3>1. Stunning Display Experience</h3>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy Tab S7 Plus features a 12.4-inch Super AMOLED display with a resolution of 2800 x 1752 pixels. With HDR10+ support and 120Hz refresh rate, every swipe, scroll, and tap feels incredibly smooth. Whether you’re watching Netflix, attending online classes, or editing content, the Galaxy Samsung S7 Plus offers an unmatched viewing experience.</p>\n<h3>2. Built for Performance</h3>\n<p>Powered by the Qualcomm Snapdragon 865+ processor and Adreno 650 GPU, this Samsung tablet S7 Plus handles heavy apps, games, and multitasking with ease. The 6GB RAM ensures seamless switching between apps, while the storage (expandable up to 1TB) gives you plenty of space for photos, documents, and videos.</p>\n<h3>3. Entertainment Redefined</h3>\n<p>With AKG-tuned quad speakers and Dolby Atmos surround sound, the Tab S7 Plus delivers immersive 3D audio. Perfect for movie lovers, gamers, or music enthusiasts.</p>\n<h3>4. Capture Every Moment</h3>\n<p>The Galaxy Samsung S7 Plus comes with a 13MP + 5MP dual rear camera and an 8MP front camera for clear video calls, professional photography, and 4K video recording.</p>\n<h3>5. Next-Level Productivity</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>S Pen: Create, sketch, or take notes with ultra-low 9ms latency.</li>\n<li>Samsung DeX Mode: Connect to a monitor or keyboard to turn your <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/\">tablet</a> into a PC-like device.</li>\n<li>Split Screen &amp; Multi-Tasking: Work on multiple apps side-by-side effortlessly.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>6. All-Day Battery Life</h3>\n<p>The 10,090 mAh battery gives you up to 14 hours of video playback. Plus, 45W fast charging keeps you powered up quickly so you never miss a beat.</p>\n<h2>Samsung Galaxy Tab S7 Plus (SM-T970 / SM-T976B) Specifications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Model</strong>: <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/samsung-galaxy-tabs/\">Samsung Galaxy Tab</a> S7 Plus 5G</li>\n<li><strong>Display</strong>: 12.4-inch Super AMOLED, 120Hz, HDR10+</li>\n<li><strong>Resolution</strong>: 2800 x 1752 pixels (Quad HD+)</li>\n<li><strong>Processor</strong>: Qualcomm Snapdragon 865+ Octa-core (3.1GHz)</li>\n<li><strong>GPU</strong>: Adreno 650</li>\n<li><strong>RAM</strong>: 6GB LPDDR5</li>\n<li><strong>Storage</strong>: 128GB, 256GB, 512GB</li>\n<li><strong>Cameras</strong>:</li>\n<li><strong>Rear</strong>: 13MP (wide) + 5MP (ultrawide)</li>\n<li><strong>Front</strong>: 8MP (wide)</li>\n<li><strong>Battery</strong>: 10,090 mAh with 45W fast charging</li>\n<li><strong>Audio</strong>: Quad Speakers tuned by AKG, Dolby Atmos</li>\n<li><strong>Connectivity</strong>: WiFi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac/ax, Bluetooth 5.0, USB Type-C 3.2, 5G/4G LTE</li>\n<li><strong>Operating System</strong>: Android 10 (upgradable)</li>\n<li><strong>Build</strong>: Glass front, aluminium back, slim 5.7mm design</li>\n<li><strong>Weight</strong>: 575g</li>\n<li><strong>Extras</strong>: Fingerprint sensor (under-display), S Pen included, Samsung DeX support</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Trusted as the #1 Mobile Phone &amp; Accessories Shop in the UK</li>\n<li>Every device is professionally tested and certified</li>\n<li>Comes with warranty for peace of mind</li>\n<li>Competitive prices compared to market retail</li>\n<li>Fast and Free delivery across the UK</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When you buy the Samsung Tab S7 Plus from <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, you’re not just purchasing a tablet—you’re investing in performance, quality, and long-term reliability.</p>\n<h2>FAQs about the Samsung Galaxy Tab S7 Plus</h2>\n<p><strong>Q1: Is the Samsung Galaxy Tab S7 Plus worth buying in 2025?</strong></p>\n<p>Absolutely! With its Snapdragon 865+ chip, 5G support, and AMOLED display, it’s still one of the best-performing tablets for work and entertainment.</p>\n<p><strong>Q2: What does A Grade mean?</strong></p>\n<p>A Grade means the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/\">tablet</a> is in excellent condition—fully functional, minimal cosmetic wear, and tested to meet high standards.</p>\n<p><strong>Q3: Can I expand the storage?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes! The Tab S7 Plus supports microSD expansion up to 1TB.</p>\n<p><strong>Q4: Does it come with the S Pen?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the S Pen is included, making it ideal for creatives and professionals.</p>\n<p><strong>Q5: How long does the battery last?</strong></p>\n<p>The 10,090 mAh battery lasts up to 14 hours on video playback and supports 45W fast charging.</p>\n<p><strong>Q6: Is the Samsung tablet S7 Plus good for gaming?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes. With Adreno 650 GPU, Snapdragon 865+, and 120Hz refresh rate, it offers smooth, lag-free gaming.</p>\n<p><strong>Q7: Does it support Samsung DeX?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, you can enjoy a PC-like experience by connecting the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/\">tablet</a> to a monitor, keyboard, or mouse.</p>\n<p><strong>Q8: What warranty do I get?</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a> provides a 3-month warranty for this model.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\">Follow for More!</a></p>\n"
