    "shortDescription": "Display: 11-inch Liquid Retina (2388 x 1668, 264 PPI)\nChip: M2 with 8-core CPU, 10-core GPU, 16-core Neural Engine\nStorage: 256GB\nCameras: 12MP Wide + 10MP Ultra Wide + LiDAR Scanner\nBattery: Up to 10 hours\nConnectivity: 5G, Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, Thunderbolt/USB-C\nSecurity: Face ID\nOS: iPadOS (latest updates supported)",
    "longDescription": "<h2>iPad Pro (11-inch) - 1st Gen - A Grade – Premium Performance &amp; Stunning Display</h2>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Experience the ultimate blend of power, portability, and premium design with the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/\">iPad </a>Pro 11 inch (1st Generation). This A Grade refurbished model comes with 256GB storage, ensuring you have ample space for apps, photos, videos, and more. Whether you're a creative professional, a student, or a tech enthusiast, the Apple iPad Pro 11 inch delivers desktop-class performance in a sleek, lightweight package.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the iPad Pro 11-inch?</h2>\n<h3>1. Stunning Liquid Retina Display</h3>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">The iPad Pro 11inch features a breathtaking Liquid Retina display with ProMotion technology, offering a smooth 120Hz refresh rate for seamless scrolling and ultra-responsive touch. With True Tone and P3 wide color, visuals are vibrant and true-to-life, while the anti-reflective coating reduces glare—perfect for working outdoors or binge-watching your favorite shows.</p>\n<h3>2. Blazing-Fast Performance with M2 Chip</h3>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Powered by Apple’s M2 chip, the iPad Pro 11 inch delivers desktop-level power with an 8-core CPU, 10-core GPU, and 16-core Neural Engine. Whether you're editing 4K videos, designing 3D models, or multitasking between demanding apps, this tablet handles everything effortlessly.</p>\n<h3>3. Pro-Grade Cameras &amp; LiDAR Scanner</h3>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Capture stunning photos and videos with the 12MP Wide camera and 10MP Ultra Wide camera. The LiDAR Scanner enhances AR experiences, making it ideal for gaming, interior design apps, and professional photography. 4K video recording and Center Stage keep you perfectly framed during video calls.</p>\n<h3>4. All-Day Battery Life &amp; 5G Connectivity</h3>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">With up to 10 hours of battery life, the iPad 11 inch keeps up with your busy schedule. Stay connected with 5G and Wi-Fi 6E for ultra-fast downloads and streaming.</p>\n<h3>5. Versatile Accessories – Apple Pencil &amp; Magic Keyboard</h3>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Transform your <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/\">iPad </a>Pro 11-inch into a laptop replacement with the Magic Keyboard or Smart Keyboard Folio. The Apple Pencil (2nd Gen) offers pixel-perfect precision for artists, designers, and note-takers.</p>\n<h2>Key Specifications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Display:</strong> 11-inch Liquid Retina (2388 x 1668, 264 PPI)</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Chip:</strong> M2 with 8-core CPU, 10-core GPU, 16-core Neural Engine</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Storage:</strong> 256GB</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Cameras:</strong> 12MP Wide + 10MP Ultra Wide + LiDAR Scanner</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Battery:</strong> Up to 10 hours</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Connectivity:</strong> 5G, Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, Thunderbolt/USB-C</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Security:</strong> Face ID</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>OS:</strong> iPadOS (latest updates supported)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Who Is This For?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Professionals</strong> – Graphic designers, video editors, architects</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Students</strong> – Note-taking, research, digital textbooks</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Gamers</strong> – High-performance mobile gaming with AR support</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Content Creators</strong> – Photo/video editing on the go</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Business Users</strong> – Presentations, emails, multitasking</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>FAQs</h2>\n<p><strong>1. Is this iPad Pro 11 inch refurbished?</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Yes, this is a Grade A refurbished model, meaning it’s in excellent condition with minimal signs of use. It’s fully tested and comes with a warranty.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Does it support the Apple Pencil?</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Absolutely! The iPad Pro 11-inch supports the 2nd Gen Apple Pencil, which magnetically attaches and charges wirelessly.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Can I use it as a laptop replacement?</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Yes! With the Magic Keyboard and iPadOS, you can multitask like a pro—run multiple apps, edit documents, and even connect external displays via Thunderbolt/USB-C.</p>\n<p><strong>4. Is Face ID available?</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">Yes, the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/\">iPad </a>Pro 11 inch features Face ID for secure unlocking and payments.</p>\n<p><strong>5. What’s included in the box?</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">You’ll receive the iPad Pro 11-inch, a charger, and a USB-C cable. Accessories like the Apple Pencil or Magic Keyboard are sold separately.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy From iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\"><strong>Trusted UK Seller</strong></a> – Best prices on premium refurbished tech</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>12-Month Warranty</strong> – Peace of mind with every purchase</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Fast Delivery</strong> – Get your iPad Pro 11 inch quickly &amp; securely</li>\n<li class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Expert Support</strong> – Friendly customer service for all your queries</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\">The iPad Pro 11-inch (1st Gen) 256GB is a powerhouse that blends performance, portability, and versatility. Whether you're working, creating, or relaxing, this tablet delivers an unmatched experience.</p>\n<p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade today and enjoy pro-level performance at an unbeatable price!</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/irepairmobiles.uk\">Find us on Facebook!</a></p>\n"
