    "longDescription": "<h2>Experience Power, Style, and Performance in One Device</h2>\n<p>The Samsung Note 10 Plus is more than just a smartphone – it’s a productivity powerhouse, a creative tool, and a reliable everyday companion. At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we bring you the Samsung Galaxy Note 10 Plus 5G – Unlocked, offering the best combination of performance, design, and affordability. Whether you’re upgrading your old device or looking for a premium flagship at a fraction of the cost, this model delivers exceptional value for money.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the Samsung Note 10 Plus 5G?</h2>\n<h3>Stunning Display and Sleek Design</h3>\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy Note 10 Plus 5G comes with a 6.8-inch Dynamic AMOLED display with vibrant colours, HDR10+ support, and edge-to-edge viewing. The immersive screen makes movies, games, and work documents come alive in crisp resolution. The slim, light design with rounded edges feels premium yet comfortable in hand, even for long use.</p>\n<p>Available in stylish finishes like Aura Black, this device has a classy glow effect on the back, giving it a timeless and elegant appeal.</p>\n<h3>Performance That Matches Your Pace</h3>\n<p>Powered by a robust Snapdragon/Exynos processor and 12GB RAM, the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung</a> Note 10 Plus ensures lightning-fast multitasking, gaming, and streaming. With 256GB internal memory, you’ll have plenty of storage space for apps, photos, videos, and documents.</p>\n<p>Switching between apps is seamless, and with the integrated 5G connectivity, browsing, downloading, and streaming are faster and smoother than ever before.</p>\n<h3>The Iconic S-Pen for Productivity</h3>\n<p>The S-Pen stylus is what makes the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung</a> Note 10 Plus unique. Take notes, sketch ideas, sign documents, or control your phone remotely with Air Actions. The S-Pen transforms your phone into a mini workstation, making it ideal for professionals and students alike.</p>\n<h3>Professional-Grade Camera</h3>\n<p>Capture every moment in stunning detail with the quad-camera setup featuring wide, ultra-wide, telephoto, and depth sensors. Whether it’s landscapes, portraits, or night shots, the Samsung Note 10 Plus camera delivers crystal-clear pictures. The 10MP front camera ensures selfies and video calls look sharp and professional.</p>\n<p>Video recording supports 4K resolution, giving you cinema-quality results right from your pocket.</p>\n<h3>Long-Lasting Battery Life</h3>\n<p>With its 4300mAh battery, the Note 10 Plus powers you through a full 12-hour day of heavy usage. Thanks to fast charging and wireless charging support, you’ll never have to worry about running out of power. The device is also optimized for power efficiency, ensuring longer life between charges.</p>\n<h3>Built for Durability</h3>\n<p>Despite its slim build, the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-note-series/\">Samsung Galaxy Note</a> 10 Plus 5G is designed to withstand everyday use. With its sturdy glass and metal frame, it handles minor falls and drops well. Pair it with a protective cover, and you’ve got a device that balances beauty with resilience.</p>\n<h3>Security &amp; Convenience</h3>\n<p>Unlock your phone in an instant with the in-display fingerprint sensor. Samsung’s Knox security ensures your data stays safe, making this device perfect for both personal and business use.</p>\n<h3>Buying the Samsung Note 10 Plus from iRepair Mobiles UK</h3>\n<p>At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we only sell premium devices – meaning the phone is fully tested, unlocked, and works perfectly, with only minimal signs of use. You get top quality at the best price without compromising on performance.</p>\n<p><strong>When you buy from us, you also get:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>12-Month Warranty for peace of mind.</li>\n<li>Fast UK Delivery so you can enjoy your device quickly.</li>\n<li>Affordable Prices that make premium devices accessible.</li>\n<li>Trusted UK Mobile Experts with years of experience.</li>\n<li>Samsung Note 10 Plus Price – Excellent Value for Money</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Looking for the best <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-note-series/\">Samsung Note</a> 10 Plus price in the UK? At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, you get flagship performance at a fraction of the original retail cost. This device delivers premium features, powerful performance, and long-term reliability, giving you maximum value for every penny spent.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Specifications:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Model</strong>: Samsung Galaxy Note 10 Plus 5G (Unlocked)</li>\n<li><strong>Display</strong>: 6.8” Dynamic AMOLED, Quad HD+ Resolution</li>\n<li><strong>Processor</strong>: Snapdragon/Exynos (region-dependent)</li>\n<li><strong>RAM</strong>: 12GB</li>\n<li><strong>Storage</strong>: 256GB &amp; 512GB internal memory</li>\n<li><strong>Cameras</strong>: Quad Rear Cameras + 10MP Front Camera</li>\n<li><strong>Battery</strong>: 4300mAh with fast &amp; wireless charging</li>\n<li><strong>OS</strong>: Android (Upgradable to latest version)</li>\n<li><strong>S-Pen</strong>: Yes, with Bluetooth &amp; Air Actions</li>\n<li><strong>Network</strong>: Fully Unlocked, works with all UK carriers</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>FAQs – Samsung Note 10 Plus 5G</h2>\n<p><strong>Q1: Is the Samsung Note 10 Plus unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, this device is fully unlocked and works with all UK and international carriers.</p>\n<p><strong>Q2: What does A Grade mean?</strong></p>\n<p>A Grade means the phone is in excellent condition, tested to work like new, with only minor cosmetic signs of previous use.</p>\n<p><strong>Q3: Does the Samsung Note 10 Plus come with a warranty?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, all devices purchased at <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a> come with a 12-month warranty for peace of mind.</p>\n<p><strong>Q4: How good is the Samsung Note 10 Plus battery life?</strong></p>\n<p>The phone’s 4300mAh battery easily lasts a full day of heavy use and supports fast &amp; wireless charging.</p>\n<p><strong>Q5: Does the phone include the S-Pen?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, every Note 10 Plus comes with the integrated S-Pen stylus.</p>\n<p><strong>Q6: Is the Samsung Note 10 Plus good for gaming?</strong></p>\n<p>Absolutely. With its 12GB RAM, powerful processor, and 6.8” AMOLED display, it’s ideal for gaming and high-performance tasks.</p>\n<p><strong>Q7: Does the Samsung Galaxy Note 10 Plus support 5G?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, this version is the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-note-series/\">Samsung Note</a> 10 Plus 5G, giving you blazing-fast connectivity.</p>\n<p><strong>Q8: Why should I buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</strong></p>\n<p>We are the #1 <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">Mobile Phone</a> &amp; Accessories Shop in the UK, offering top-quality devices, competitive prices, warranties, and reliable customer support.</p>\n<p>With its powerful performance, stylish design, and unbeatable price, the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/used-samsung-phones/\">Samsung</a> Note 10 Plus 5G Unlocked from <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a> is the smart choice for anyone who wants a premium smartphone without overspending.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
