    "longDescription": "<h2>Used Samsung S21 Plus - Unlocked - Used</h2>\n<p>Welcome to <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, your trusted destination for high-quality used <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-s-series/\">Samsung S21 Plus</a> smartphones. If you're looking for a premium Samsung Galaxy S21 Plus at an unbeatable price, our model delivers flagship performance without the hefty price tag.</p>\n<p>Why Choose a Used Samsung S21 Plus from iRepair Mobiles UK?</p>\n<h3>1. Different Conditions</h3>\n<p>Our used <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung </a>S21 Plus is meticulously inspected, professionally optimized, and graded with different options. This means:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fully functional with no performance issues</li>\n<li>Crisp 6.7-inch AMOLED Infinity-O Display with 120Hz refresh rate for ultra-smooth scrolling</li>\n<li>Triple-camera system (64MP + 12MP + 12MP) for stunning photos and 8K video recording</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>2. Fully Unlocked &amp; Ready to Use</h3>\n<p>This <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung </a>S21 Plus 5G is network-unlocked, meaning you can use it with any UK carrier (EE, O2, Vodafone, Three, and more). No restrictions—just plug in your SIM and enjoy blazing-fast 5G speeds.</p>\n<h3>3. Powerful Performance &amp; Long-Lasting Battery</h3>\n<p>Powered by the Exynos 2100 (or Snapdragon 888 in some regions), the Samsung S21 Plus delivers flagship-level speed. With a 4800mAh battery, it easily lasts all day, supporting:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Wireless &amp; Reverse Wireless Charging</li>\n<li>Fast USB-C Charging</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>4. 12-Month Warranty</h3>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, every <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung </a>S21 Plus undergoes rigorous testing by our in-house tech experts. We back your purchase with a 12-month warranty for peace of mind.</p>\n<h2>Samsung S21 Plus Specs at a Glance</h2>\n<p>Feature Details</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Display 6.7\" Dynamic AMOLED 2X, 120Hz</li>\n<li>Processor Exynos 2100 / Snapdragon 888</li>\n<li>RAM &amp; Storage 8GB RAM + 128GB/256GB (No SD Card Slot)</li>\n<li>Rear Cameras 12MP Wide + 64MP Telephoto + 12MP Ultra-Wide</li>\n<li>Front Camera 10MP Selfie</li>\n<li>Battery 4800mAh, 25W Fast Charging</li>\n<li>OS Upgradable to Android 14 (One UI 6)</li>\n<li>5G Support Yes</li>\n<li>Unlocked Works with all UK networks</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\n<p><strong>1. Is the Used Samsung S21 Plus in Good Condition?</strong><br />\nYes! Our A-Grade devices have minimal wear, fully functional hardware, and pristine screens. Each phone is professionally inspected before sale.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Does It Come with a Warranty?</strong><br />\nAbsolutely! We offer a 12-month warranty on all Samsung S21 Plus phones for your confidence.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Is the Samsung S21 Plus 5G Compatible in the UK?</strong><br />\nYes, this unlocked <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung </a>S21 Plus supports 5G networks across all major UK carriers.</p>\n<p><strong>4. What’s Included in the Box?</strong></p>\n<p>You’ll receive:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Samsung Galaxy S21 Plus</li>\n<li>Charging Cable (USB-C)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. How Does Used Compare to New?</strong><br />\nA Used Samsung S21 Plus from iRepair Mobiles UK looks and performs like new but costs significantly less. We replace batteries if needed and ensure full functionality.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">UK’s Trusted Mobile Phones Seller</a></li>\n<li>12-Month Warranty on All Devices</li>\n<li>Secure Payment &amp; Easy Returns</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Get Your Used Samsung S21 Plus Today!</strong></p>\n<p>Upgrade to a premium smartphone without breaking the bank. With a stunning display, professional-grade camera, and 5G speeds, the Samsung Galaxy S21 Plus is a fantastic choice.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/irepairmobiles.uk\"><strong>Follow us on Facebook!</strong></a></p>\n"
