    "shortDescription": "Display: 10.2-inch Retina with True Tone\nProcessor: A13 Bionic Chip with Neural Engine\nStorage: 64GB / 256GB\nCameras: 8MP Wide back, 12MP Ultra Wide front with Center Stage\nAudio: Stereo speakers\nBattery: Up to 10 hours\nConnectivity: 802.11ac Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 4.2",
    "longDescription": "<h2>Apple iPad 9th Gen 10.2\" - Unlocked | iRepair Mobiles UK</h2>\n<p>Experience the perfect balance of performance, portability, and innovation with the Apple <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/\">iPad</a> 9th Gen 10.2\" - Unlocked. Designed for students, professionals, and creative enthusiasts alike, this 9th gen iPad brings cutting-edge features at an unbeatable value. Whether you’re streaming, gaming, multitasking, or working from home, the Apple iPad 9th Gen ensures smooth, responsive, and reliable performance throughout your day.</p>\n<h2>Gorgeous 10.2-inch Retina Display with True Tone</h2>\n<p>The iPad 9th Gen comes equipped with a 10.2-inch Retina display, delivering stunning visuals with 2160-by-1620 resolution and 264 pixels per inch (ppi). Featuring LED-backlit Multi-Touch IPS technology and True Tone, this screen automatically adjusts brightness and color to suit your environment. With 500 nits of brightness and a fingerprint-resistant oleophobic coating, every photo, video, and app looks vibrant and sharp, making it perfect for work, study, or entertainment.</p>\n<h2>A13 Bionic Chip with Neural Engine</h2>\n<p>Powering the Apple iPad 9th Gen is the A13 Bionic chip with Neural Engine, built on a 64-bit architecture. This ensures lightning-fast processing and smooth multitasking, whether you’re editing photos, watching 4K videos, or running multiple apps simultaneously. The 9th gen iPad handles demanding tasks effortlessly, providing an unmatched combination of speed and efficiency.</p>\n<h2>Exceptional Camera System</h2>\n<p>Capture life in crisp detail with the 8MP Wide back camera and 12MP Ultra Wide front camera with Center Stage. The rear camera features ƒ/2.4 aperture, HDR, 5x digital zoom, panorama, and geotagging, making photography effortless. The front 12MP Ultra Wide camera with 122° field of view is ideal for FaceTime, video conferencing, and online classes. Center Stage keeps you perfectly framed during video calls, providing a professional, hands-free experience.</p>\n<h2>Up to 256GB Storage Options</h2>\n<p>Choose the storage size that fits your lifestyle. The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/tablets-and-ipads/apple-ipad/\">iPad</a> 9th Gen offers 64GB for everyday use or 256GB for those who need more space for apps, games, videos, and documents. With ample storage, you can organize your digital world efficiently without worrying about running out of space.</p>\n<h2>Crystal-Clear Audio and Stereo Speakers</h2>\n<p>Enjoy immersive sound with stereo speakers, delivering rich, clear audio for music, video calls, and entertainment. Whether you’re streaming movies, attending virtual meetings, or playing your favorite games, the Apple iPad 9th Gen ensures every sound is crisp and full.</p>\n<h2>Touch ID and Apple Pay</h2>\n<p>Keep your iPad 9th Gen secure with Touch ID, allowing you to unlock your device and authorize purchases using your fingerprint. Make secure payments with Apple Pay directly from your device, or access your personal apps and data without any hassle. Your privacy and security are always a priority.</p>\n<h2>Connectivity and Battery Life</h2>\n<p>Stay connected with 802.11ac Wi-Fi and Bluetooth 4.2, ensuring fast internet and smooth wireless connections. The built-in 32.4-watt-hour rechargeable lithium-polymer battery provides up to 10 hours of battery life, perfect for all-day productivity, streaming, or online learning. Charge conveniently with the Lightning connector and 20W USB-C power adapter.</p>\n<h2>Works with Apple Pencil and Smart Keyboard</h2>\n<p>Enhance your productivity and creativity with support for Apple Pencil (1st generation) and the Smart Keyboard. Take notes, sketch, draw, or type effortlessly, making the 9th gen iPad ideal for students, artists, and professionals.</p>\n<h2>Condition and Design</h2>\n<p>Available in Space Grey or Silver, the Apple iPad 9th Gen is sold in brand new, sealed condition, ensuring a pristine device free from imperfections. Lightweight and portable, it measures 250.6mm x 174.1mm x 7.5mm and weighs just 487 grams, making it easy to carry wherever you go.</p>\n<h2>In the Box</h2>\n<p>Your purchase includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Apple iPad 9th Generation (Wi-Fi or Wi-Fi + Cellular)</li>\n<li>Lightning to USB-C Cable</li>\n<li>20W Power Adapter</li>\n<li>Quick Start Guide and Documentation</li>\n<li>Technical Specifications</li>\n<li>Display: 10.2-inch Retina with True Tone</li>\n<li>Processor: A13 Bionic Chip with Neural Engine</li>\n<li>Storage: 64GB / 256GB</li>\n<li>Cameras: 8MP Wide back, 12MP Ultra Wide front with Center Stage</li>\n<li>Audio: Stereo speakers</li>\n<li>Battery: Up to 10 hours</li>\n<li>Connectivity: 802.11ac Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 4.2</li>\n<li>Sensors: Touch ID, three-axis gyro, accelerometer, barometer, ambient light sensor</li>\n<li>Operating System: iPadOS 15, upgradable to latest iPadOS versions</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Warranty and Delivery</h2>\n<p>Enjoy peace of mind with a 12-month Apple Warranty covering technical faults and manufacturing defects. We offer free UK delivery with options for standard, expedited, or next-day dispatch, ensuring your iPad 9th Gen 256GB arrives quickly and safely.</p>\n<h2>FAQs About iPad 9th Gen</h2>\n<p><strong>Q1: Is the iPad 9th Gen unlocked?</strong><br />\nYes, all models are unlocked, compatible with any carrier, giving you freedom and flexibility.</p>\n<p><strong>Q2: Can I use the Apple Pencil with iPad 9th Gen?</strong><br />\nAbsolutely. The 1st generation Apple Pencil works perfectly with the iPad 9th Gen, ideal for drawing, note-taking, and editing.</p>\n<p><strong>Q3: What is the battery life?</strong><br />\nThe iPad 9th Gen provides up to 10 hours of battery life, depending on usage.</p>\n<p><strong>Q4: Is there a warranty?</strong><br />\nYes, all iPads come with a 12-month Apple manufacturer warranty covering any defects or technical faults.</p>\n<p><strong>Q5: What are the storage options?</strong><br />\nYou can choose between 64GB and 256GB, depending on your storage needs.</p>\n<p><strong>Q6: Can I use it for online classes or work?</strong><br />\nYes, its fast A13 Bionic chip, 12MP Ultra Wide front camera, and Center Stage feature make it perfect for video calls, online learning, and multitasking.</p>\n<p><strong>Q7: What is the price of iPad 9th Gen in the UK?</strong><br />\nPrices vary depending on storage and configuration. At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, the iPad 9th Gen price starts competitively, with VAT included and special offers available.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p>As the best mobile phone and <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/\">accessories shop</a> in the UK, we ensure:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>100% Genuine Apple Products</li>\n<li>Competitive iPad 9th Gen prices</li>\n<li>Fast and tracked UK delivery</li>\n<li>12-Month Apple Warranty</li>\n<li>Trusted by thousands of customers across the UK</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Upgrade your tech experience today. The Apple iPad 9th Gen 10.2\" - Unlocked is perfect for work, play, creativity, and everything in between. Order now and enjoy reliable performance, stunning visuals, and Apple’s legendary build quality.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
