    "description": "6.5-inch Super Retina OLED (2688 x 1242 pixels, 458 ppi)\nHDR10 & Dolby Vision support\nTrue Tone & Wide Color (P3) for natural viewing\nScratch-resistant glass & stainless steel frame\nIP68 water-resistant (4 meters for 30 minutes)\nA12 Bionic chip (6-core CPU, 4-core GPU, 8-core Neural Engine)\n4GB RAM, 64GB, 128GB storage\niOS 12 (upgradable to latest iOS)",
