    "shortDescription": "Unlocked iPhone XS – Works with all UK networks\nStunning 5.8-inch OLED display\n64GB, 256GB, 512GB storage\nPowerful A12 Bionic chip\nDual 12MP rear cameras + 7MP front camera with HDR\nSupports 4K HDR video\nStrong battery life with up to 120 hours standby\nIncludes USB cable, SIM ejector tool and 12-month warranty",
    "longDescription": "<h2>Premium Performance, Pocket-Friendly Price</h2>\n<p>If you’re looking for a sleek, powerful, and dependable Apple device that doesn’t break the bank, the iPhone XS is one of the smartest choices you can make. At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we specialise in high-quality Apple devices, and this Unlocked iPhone XS gives you the perfect balance of flagship performance and unbeatable value. Whether you need a reliable upgrade, a compact daily driver, or a premium device at a budget-friendly rate, this model ticks every box, speed, security, stunning visuals, durability, and excellent battery performance.</p>\n<p>This <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">handset</a> is fully Unlocked, making it compatible with all major UK networks. You can insert any nano SIM or use eSIM for dual-SIM convenience. With premium Apple engineering, advanced camera capabilities, and a robust A12 Bionic processor, the iPhone XS remains a top choice for customers searching for a dependable Apple device without paying brand-new retail prices. If you're comparing iPhone XS price, features, and value, this is one of the best deals on iPhone XS available in the UK.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the iPhone XS from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<h3>Premium Quality Used – Looks Like New</h3>\n<p>Every Apple iPhone XS we offer goes through a strict process that includes full testing, functionality checks, and replacement of necessary components using original manufacturer-grade parts. With custom OLED displays delivering accurate colour, HDR support, and deep true blacks, the screen performance is exceptional. The device arrives looking and feeling extremely close to a brand-new phone but at a price that’s far more pocket-friendly.</p>\n<p>You also receive a 12-Month Supplier-Backed Warranty, giving you complete peace of mind with your purchase. Buying used device encourages a sustainable culture and helps reduce e-waste, making this not only a smart financial decision but a responsible one as well.</p>\n<h3>SIM-Free &amp; Fully Unlocked</h3>\n<p>The iPhone XS is SIM Free, meaning no network restrictions and total freedom to choose your preferred service provider. It supports:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>All major UK network providers</li>\n<li>Dual SIM functionality (nano SIM + eSIM)</li>\n<li>Smooth switching between numbers for business and personal use</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This flexibility makes the unlocked <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">iPhone</a> XS one of the best choices for budget-conscious buyers who want maximum usability.</p>\n<h3>Stunning 5.8-Inch OLED Display</h3>\n<p>Expect a brilliant, sharp, and true-to-life visual experience thanks to the:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>5.8-inch OLED display</li>\n<li>2436 x 1125 resolution</li>\n<li>458 pixels per inch</li>\n<li>True Tone and HDR support</li>\n<li>Toughened glass with excellent durability</li>\n</ul>\n<p>From video streaming to photo editing to social media browsing, the display offers crisp detail and vivid colours throughout the day.</p>\n<h3>Compact, Stylish &amp; Durable</h3>\n<p>With a premium stainless-steel frame and a glass back, the iPhone XS retains that iconic Apple look. Its compact size makes it easy to hold, slip into pockets, and use with one hand:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Height: 144 mm</li>\n<li>Width: 71 mm</li>\n<li>Depth: 8 mm</li>\n<li>Weight: 177 g</li>\n</ul>\n<p>It also carries a Water Resistance rating of IP68, able to survive up to 2 metres for 30 minutes.</p>\n<h3>Advanced Camera System – Capture Every Detail</h3>\n<p>The iPhone XS camera system remains one of the best compact setups Apple has produced:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dual 12MP rear cameras</li>\n<li>Second 12MP telephoto lens</li>\n<li>7MP Front camera</li>\n<li>Dual LED flash</li>\n<li>HDR Photography</li>\n<li>4K HDR video recording</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether capturing portraits, landscapes, videos or low-light shots, this device is designed to deliver sharp and vibrant images that outclass many mid-range smartphones today.</p>\n<h3>Powerful A12 Bionic Processor – Speed That Lasts</h3>\n<p>The Apple A12 Bionic chipset ensures seamless performance across everyday tasks, gaming, photography, apps, and multitasking. With:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hex-core 2.5GHz processor</li>\n<li>4GB RAM</li>\n<li>iOS compatibility</li>\n<li>Access to millions of apps on the App Store</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The iPhone XS delivers smooth, fast, and reliable results, perfect for work, content creation, social media, or entertainment.</p>\n<h3>Battery Life &amp; Energy Efficiency</h3>\n<p>Enjoy strong battery performance with:</p>\n<p>• Standby time: up to 120 hours<br />\n• Talk time: up to 1200 minutes<br />\n• Battery capacity: 2658mAh<br />\n• Energy efficiency class: A<br />\n• Wireless charging compatibility<br />\n• Fast charge support (up to 18W)</p>\n<p>Fast charging means you spend less time plugged in and more time using your phone.</p>\n<h3>Connectivity &amp; Features</h3>\n<p>Stay connected with the latest technology:</p>\n<p>• Wi-Fi<br />\n• Bluetooth<br />\n• NFC for Apple Pay<br />\n• GPS<br />\n• Contactless payments<br />\n• MP3/MP4 support<br />\n• Water &amp; dust resistance (IP68)</p>\n<p>These premium features make every daily task faster, easier, and more convenient.</p>\n<h3>Storage</h3>\n<p>You get 64GB, 256GB &amp; 512GB internal storage, ideal for apps, videos, photos, and daily use without slowing your device.</p>\n<h3>Box Contents</h3>\n<p>Everything you need is included in the package:</p>\n<p>• iPhone XS (Unlocked)<br />\n• USB-C to Lightning cable<br />\n• Premium USB charging cable<br />\n• SIM ejector tool<br />\n• Warranty information<br />\n• Optional charging adapter when selected</p>\n<h2>Buy with Confidence – iRepair Mobiles UK</h2>\n<p>We are the UK’s best mobile phone &amp; accessories shop, trusted for quality devices, transparent pricing, sustainable solutions, and exceptional customer service. When you choose the iPhone XS from iRepair Mobiles UK, you're getting a premium device backed by expert support and long-term reliability.</p>\n<h2>FAQs About iPhone XS (Unlocked)</h2>\n<p><strong>1. Is the iPhone XS unlocked to all networks?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the device is fully SIM free and unlocked, supporting all major UK networks. It also supports dual SIM with nano SIM and eSIM.</p>\n<p><strong>2. What condition is the used iPhone XS in?</strong></p>\n<p>Every used device is set to a high standard using original-grade parts. It looks close to new and is fully tested to ensure top performance.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Does the iPhone XS come with a warranty?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, you receive a 12-month supplier-backed guarantee, giving you complete peace of mind.</p>\n<p><strong>4. Does the phone include a charger?</strong></p>\n<p>A premium USB cable and SIM ejector tool are included. You can add a charging plug at checkout if required.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Is the battery health good?</strong></p>\n<p>All devices meet optimal battery performance standards with strong standby and talk-time capacity.</p>\n<p><strong>6. Can I use Apple Pay on this model?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the iPhone XS supports NFC and Apple Pay for secure contactless payments.</p>\n<p><strong>7. Is the iPhone XS water resistant?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, it carries an IP68 water resistance rating, protecting it up to 2 metres for 30 minutes.</p>\n<p><strong>8. Is this the best deal on iPhone XS?</strong></p>\n<p>We keep our iPhone XS price competitive and offer one of the best value deals in the UK, ensuring affordability without compromising on quality.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow us on Facebook!</strong></a></p>\n"
