    "longDescription": "<h2>iPhone 12 Pro Max – Unlocked</h2>\n<p>Upgrade your <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">smartphone</a> experience with the Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max – a device that blends luxury design with high-performance features. At iRepair Mobiles UK, the best mobile phone and accessories shop in the UK, we’re proud to bring you the iPhone 12 Pro Max Unlocked at the best price and value. Whether you’re searching for iPhone 12 Pro Max deals, exploring the iPhone 12 Pro Max price, or considering stylish colours like the iPhone 12 Pro Max Gold, this device delivers everything you need and more.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the iPhone 12 Pro Max?</h2>\n<p>The Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max isn’t just another phone – it’s a flagship device that still outperforms many newer <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">smartphones</a>. Packed with advanced technology, a stunning 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display, and 5G connectivity, it’s built for users who demand speed, clarity, and premium performance.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Unlocked &amp; Ready to Use</strong> – Compatible with all major UK networks including EE, Vodafone, O2, Three, and more. Simply insert your SIM and start using.</li>\n<li><strong>Storage</strong> – Perfect for storing apps, 4K videos, and thousands of photos.</li>\n<li><strong>Triple-Lens Pro Camera System with LiDAR</strong> – Professional photography and videography at your fingertips.</li>\n<li><strong>Apple A14 Bionic Processor</strong> – Smooth multitasking, lightning-fast gaming, and energy efficiency.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Design &amp; Display: Built to Impress</h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">iPhone</a> 12 Pro Max stands out with its stainless steel frame, sleek flat edges, and Ceramic Shield front cover that’s tougher than any other smartphone glass. At 6.7 inches, its Super Retina XDR display offers:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>HDR10 &amp; Dolby Vision support</li>\n<li>1200 nits peak brightness for vivid outdoor visibility</li>\n<li>Crisp resolution of 2778 × 1284 pixels</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether you’re scrolling through apps, watching Netflix, or editing photos, the viewing experience is unmatched.</p>\n<h2>Performance: Power Meets Efficiency</h2>\n<p>At its core, the Apple <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/iphone-12-series/\">iPhone</a> 12 Pro Max is powered by the A14 Bionic chip, the first 5-nanometer processor in a smartphone. This means:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>15% faster performance compared to its predecessor (A13).</li>\n<li>6GB RAM for effortless multitasking.</li>\n<li>Optimized battery management with a 3687mAh battery capacity.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>From gaming to AR experiences, the performance stays consistently smooth.</p>\n<h2>Professional-Grade Camera System</h2>\n<p>For those who love capturing moments, the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/used-iphones/\">iPhone</a> 12 Pro Max features a triple 12MP system: Ultra Wide, Wide, and Telephoto lenses. The LiDAR scanner boosts low-light photography and AR applications.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2.5x optical zoom and digital zoom up to 12x</li>\n<li>Night Mode and Deep Fusion technology for stunning detail</li>\n<li>Apple ProRAW format for advanced editing</li>\n<li>4K video recording at 60fps</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you’re passionate about mobile photography, the iPhone 12 Pro Max is your best companion.</p>\n<h2>5G &amp; Future-Ready Connectivity</h2>\n<p>Stay ahead with 5G support, ensuring lightning-fast downloads, seamless streaming, and low-latency gaming. Coupled with Wi-Fi 6 and MagSafe wireless charging support, the iPhone 12 Pro Max is designed to keep up with future technology trends.</p>\n<h3>Storage &amp; Colour Options</h3>\n<p>This listing is for the different storage options – the perfect balance between storage and price. You’ll have enough space for apps, music, and high-resolution content without overpaying. Popular finishes include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pacific Blue</li>\n<li>Gold (iPhone 12 Pro Max Gold)</li>\n<li>Graphite</li>\n<li>Silver</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we go beyond just selling phones – we provide trust, transparency, and quality.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Trusted Mobile Experts in the UK – Thousands of satisfied customers nationwide.</li>\n<li>12-Month Warranty Included – Buy with confidence.</li>\n<li>Competitive iPhone 12 Pro Max Deals – Our iPhone 12 Pro Max price beats the competition.</li>\n<li>Click &amp; Collect or Nationwide Delivery – Flexible options for every buyer.</li>\n<li>Accessories Available – From chargers to cases, everything you need in one place.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>iPhone 12 Pro Max Price &amp; Deals in the UK</h2>\n<p>Looking for the best iPhone 12 Pro Max deals? At iRepair Mobiles UK, we regularly update our prices to stay competitive. Our goal is to offer the lowest iPhone 12 Pro Max price in the UK while ensuring quality and warranty support.</p>\n<p>By purchasing an unlocked Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max from us, you save on restrictive contracts and get the freedom to choose your preferred network.</p>\n<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Model: Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max</li>\n<li>Storage: Different options</li>\n<li>Display: 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED, HDR10, Dolby Vision</li>\n<li>Processor: Apple A14 Bionic, 5nm, Hexa-core</li>\n<li>RAM: 6GB</li>\n<li>Camera: Triple 12MP system (Ultra Wide, Wide, Telephoto) + LiDAR</li>\n<li>Front Camera: 12MP with Face ID support</li>\n<li>Battery: 3687mAh, MagSafe wireless charging support</li>\n<li>Network: 5G, 4G, 3G, GSM/CDMA</li>\n<li>OS: Latest iOS updates supported</li>\n<li>Condition: Different options</li>\n<li>Unlocked: Yes, factory unlocked</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>FAQs – iPhone 12 Pro Max</h2>\n<p><strong>Q1: Is the iPhone 12 Pro Max unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, this device is factory unlocked. It works with all UK carriers including EE, Vodafone, O2, and Three.</p>\n<p><strong>Q2: What does “A Grade” mean?</strong></p>\n<p>It means the phone is in like-new condition with no visible scratches, dents, or marks. It’s tested, verified, and comes with a warranty.</p>\n<p><strong>Q3: Do you provide a warranty?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, we provide a 12-month warranty on this iPhone 12 Pro Max for peace of mind.</p>\n<p><strong>Q4: Does the iPhone 12 Pro Max support 5G?</strong></p>\n<p>Absolutely. The iPhone 12 Pro Max was Apple’s first device to introduce full 5G connectivity.</p>\n<p><strong>Q5: What colours are available?</strong></p>\n<p>The iPhone 12 Pro Max comes in Gold, Pacific Blue, Silver, and Graphite. Availability may vary depending on stock.</p>\n<p><strong>Q6: Can I trade in my old phone?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, we accept trade-ins at iRepair Mobiles UK. You can reduce the cost of your new purchase.</p>\n<p><strong>Q7: Do you include accessories?</strong></p>\n<p>As per Apple’s packaging policy, the iPhone does not include a charging brick or headphones. However, we stock official and compatible accessories separately.</p>\n<p><strong>Q8: Why should I buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</strong></p>\n<p>Because we’re UK’s trusted mobile experts, offering authentic Apple devices, warranty, and best-price deals with excellent customer service.</p>\n<h2>Final Words</h2>\n<p>The iPhone 12 Pro Max – Unlocked remains one of the best Apple devices for professionals, creators, and everyday users. With stunning design, superior camera technology, and blazing performance, it’s a future-ready investment.</p>\n<p>Buy today from iRepair Mobiles UK, and enjoy secure shopping, competitive iPhone 12 Pro Max deals, and nationwide delivery. Don’t miss out – upgrade to the Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max now.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
