    "description": "6.5&#8243; Infinity-O Display – Big screen with vibrant HD+ visuals\nQuad Camera Setup (48MP) – Capture wide, detailed & stunning photos\n13MP Front Camera – Bright, clear selfies every time\n5000mAh Battery + Fast Charging – Power that lasts all day\nDual SIM & Unlocked – Works with all UK & international networks\nExynos 850 Octa-Core + 3GB RAM – Smooth performance & multitasking\nRear Fingerprint & Face Unlock – Fast and secure access\n1-Year Warranty from iRepair Mobiles UK – Peace of mind guaranteed",
