    "longDescription": "<h2>Apple iPhone XR – Unlocked</h2>\n<p>Looking for a <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">smartphone</a> that delivers the premium Apple experience without breaking the bank? The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/iphone-x-series/\">iPhone XR</a> is one of the most popular models from Apple, known for its sleek design, powerful performance, and affordable pricing. At iRepair Mobiles UK, we bring you the Apple iPhone XR – Unlocked – at a highly competitive price starting from £299.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re upgrading your current device, switching from Android to iOS, or buying your first iPhone, the XR ticks all the boxes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Smooth performance with Apple’s A12 Bionic chip</li>\n<li>Stunning 6.1-inch Liquid Retina HD display</li>\n<li>Long-lasting battery life</li>\n<li>Latest iOS updates &amp; features</li>\n</ul>\n<p>And since it’s unlocked, you can use this XR iPhone with any UK or international network. No contracts, no restrictions — just pure Apple freedom.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the iPhone XR?</h2>\n<h3>1. Affordable Apple Experience</h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/iphone-x-series/\">iPhone</a> XR price makes it one of the best entry points into Apple’s ecosystem. Compared to the iPhone XS or newer models, the XR gives you nearly the same premium experience but at a fraction of the cost.</p>\n<h3>2. Reliable Performance</h3>\n<p>Powered by the A12 Bionic chip, the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">Apple</a> iPhone XR handles everything — from gaming and video editing to everyday browsing and social media.</p>\n<h3>3. Premium Design</h3>\n<p>Available in a wide range of colours, the XR iPhone stands out with a durable glass and aluminium body that feels solid in your hands. Pair it with one of our protective iPhone XR cases from brands like Spigen, OtterBox, or Tech21 for maximum durability.</p>\n<h3>4. Camera Quality You Can Trust</h3>\n<p>Take sharp, detailed photos with the 12MP rear camera and capture crystal-clear selfies with the 7MP TrueDepth front camera. Features like Portrait Mode and Smart HDR ensure professional-quality shots every time.</p>\n<h3>5. Long-Lasting Battery</h3>\n<p>Worried about running out of charge? The XR’s battery easily lasts a full day, and with fast charging support, you can get 50% charge in just 30 minutes (with compatible adapter).</p>\n<h2>iPhone XR Price &amp; Value in the UK</h2>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we pride ourselves on offering the best iPhone XR prices online and in-store.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Unlocked – use with O2, Vodafone, EE, Three, GiffGaff, Lebara, or any SIM worldwide</li>\n<li>Different Storage  Options – perfect for apps, photos, and videos</li>\n<li>Price from £190 – unbeatable value compared to buying direct from Apple</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you’re comparing the second hand iPhone XR market, our models offer peace of mind with warranty and guaranteed quality. Unlike used devices on marketplaces, you get a device tested and certified by professionals.</p>\n<h2>Shop With Confidence at iRepair Mobiles UK</h2>\n<p>We’re more than just another online phone shop. We’re the UK’s #1 Mobile Phone &amp; Accessories Store, trusted by thousands of customers nationwide. Here’s why:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Expertly tested &amp; graded phones</li>\n<li>Unlocked &amp; ready for all UK networks</li>\n<li>12-month warranty included for your peace of mind</li>\n<li>Huge selection of iPhone XR cases, screen protectors &amp; accessories</li>\n<li>Competitive prices compared to Amazon, eBay &amp; local shops</li>\n<li>Fast UK delivery &amp; collection in-store</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When you buy from us, you’re not just purchasing a phone — you’re investing in reliability, trust, and long-term support.</p>\n<h2>Technical Specifications – iPhone XR</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Model: Apple iPhone XR</li>\n<li>Unlocked: Yes, works with all SIMs</li>\n<li>Display: 6.1-inch Liquid Retina HD, True Tone</li>\n<li>Chip: A12 Bionic with next-gen Neural Engine</li>\n<li>Rear Camera: 12MP wide camera, Smart HDR, 4K video</li>\n<li>Front Camera: 7MP TrueDepth, Face ID, Portrait Mode</li>\n<li>Battery Life: Up to 25 hours talk time</li>\n<li>Operating System: iOS (latest update supported)</li>\n<li>Colour Options: Black, White, Red, Blue, Yellow, Coral</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Accessories You’ll Love</h2>\n<p>Pair your iPhone XR with premium accessories for protection and style:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>iPhone XR <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/mobile-phone-cases/\">Cases</a> – Rugged Armor, Clear, Leather, MagSafe-compatible</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/screen-protector/\">Screen Protectors</a> – Scratch-resistant tempered glass</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/accessories/chargers-and-cables/\">Charging Accessories</a> – Fast chargers, Lightning cables, and wireless charging pads</li>\n</ul>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, you’ll always find the best deals on Apple iPhone XR accessories.</p>\n<h2>FAQs – iPhone XR at iRepair Mobiles UK</h2>\n<p><strong>1. Is the iPhone XR still worth buying in 2025?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes! The Apple iPhone XR continues to receive iOS updates, making it a reliable choice for everyday users. With its great balance of performance, camera quality, and affordability, it’s one of the best iPhones under £300.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Is this iPhone XR unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Absolutely. Every XR iPhone we sell is fully unlocked, meaning it will work with any UK or international SIM card.</p>\n<p><strong>3. What’s included in the box?</strong></p>\n<p>You’ll receive the iPhone XR, a charging cable, and our 12-month warranty. Additional accessories like cases and screen protectors can be purchased separately.</p>\n<p><strong>5. How does this compare to buying second hand iPhone XR models?</strong></p>\n<p>Second hand iPhones may come with hidden issues or limited lifespan. With iRepair Mobiles UK, you get a certified iPhone XR with warranty, giving you peace of mind.</p>\n<p><strong>6. Do you offer repairs and support?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes! We’re the UK’s #1 phone repair shop, offering fast and affordable iPhone screen replacements, battery changes, and diagnostics.</p>\n<p><strong>7. What is the current iPhone XR price at iRepair Mobiles UK?</strong></p>\n<p>Prices for the Apple iPhone XR start at £299. Our prices are regularly compared with competitors to ensure you always get the best deal.</p>\n<h2>Final Thoughts – Why Buy the iPhone XR From Us?</h2>\n<p>The iPhone XR is a smart investment for anyone looking for a balance between affordability, performance, and design. With a good storage capacity, unlocked freedom, and a price starting from £299, it’s an unbeatable deal in 2025.</p>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we don’t just sell phones — we build trust. That’s why thousands of UK customers choose us for iPhones, accessories, and expert repairs. Order your iPhone XR today and enjoy fast delivery, a 12-month warranty, and unmatched service from the UK’s best mobile phone shop.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
