    "longDescription": "<h2>Samsung Galaxy S22 Ultra - Unlocked</h2>\n<p>Looking for a premium smartphone that delivers top-tier performance, next-gen photography, and an ultra-smooth design? The Samsung Galaxy S22 Ultra is the powerhouse <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">device</a> you need. Available in different condition, and fully unlocked, this smartphone combines cutting-edge technology with timeless style—making it one of the most sought-after mobiles in the UK market today.</p>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, we’re proud to offer the Samsung Galaxy S22 Ultra at a competitive price with FREE next-day UK delivery and a 12-month warranty, so you shop with complete confidence.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the Samsung Galaxy S22 Ultra?</h2>\n<h3>1. Performance That Redefines Speed</h3>\n<p>Powered by the advanced 4nm Exynos 2200 chipset with an integrated Xclipse GPU, the S22 Ultra offers lightning-fast CPU and GPU speeds. With 8GB RAM, multitasking feels buttery-smooth whether you’re running demanding apps, gaming, or switching between business tasks.</p>\n<p>Compared to its predecessor, the Samsung Galaxy S21 Ultra, this model brings enhanced efficiency, improved AI processing, and faster response times. You’ll feel the difference from the moment you power it on.</p>\n<h3>2. A Stunning Display Built for Every Condition</h3>\n<p>The 6.8-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display with 3088 x 1440 pixel resolution and 500ppi clarity ensures a vivid, razor-sharp viewing experience. With VisionBooster technology and a peak brightness of 1750 nits, the screen remains crystal clear—even under direct sunlight.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re watching movies, video calling on Google Duo, or scrolling through social media, the adaptive refresh rate (1Hz–120Hz) makes every swipe smooth and immersive.</p>\n<h3>3. Nightography Camera That Changes Everything</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Photography lovers will adore the quad-camera setup:</li>\n<li>108MP main wide camera for exceptional clarity</li>\n<li>12MP ultrawide camera for breathtaking landscapes</li>\n<li>Two 10MP telephoto lenses offering up to 100x Space Zoom</li>\n<li>40MP front camera for flawless selfies and video calls</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Samsung’s Nightography feature makes low-light shots brighter and sharper, while AI-driven processing ensures your images look natural without lens flare. With 8K video recording at 24FPS and 4K at 60FPS, your content will look cinematic every time.</p>\n<h3>4. Integrated S-Pen for Productivity</h3>\n<p>One of the standout features of the S22 Ultra is the built-in S-Pen—a first for the Galaxy S series. Perfect for note-taking, sketching, editing, and even using as a remote shutter for photos, the S-Pen turns your phone into a productivity hub.</p>\n<h3>5. Battery &amp; Charging That Keep You Going</h3>\n<p>Equipped with a 5,000mAh battery, the Galaxy S22 Ultra is built to last all day with heavy use. It supports fast charging, wireless charging, and reverse charging, so you’re always powered up.</p>\n<p>Even after demanding gaming or long video calls, the phone keeps up without major heating issues.</p>\n<h3>6. Premium Build &amp; Sleek Design</h3>\n<p>The Galaxy S22 Ultra is undeniably beautiful, with a satin glass finish and Samsung’s Contour Cut camera module that blends seamlessly into the design. Available in multiple colours (including Phantom Black), it looks and feels like a luxury device.</p>\n<p>The phone is also highly durable, with Gorilla Glass Victus+ protection and an IP68 water-resistance rating.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Trusted UK Retailer – Best <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/samsung-s-series/\">mobile phone</a> and accessories shop in the UK.</li>\n<li>FREE Next-Day Delivery – Get your phone faster.</li>\n<li>12-Month Warranty – Peace of mind guaranteed.</li>\n<li>Unlocked Device – Works with all UK and international networks.</li>\n<li>Condition – Different options.</li>\n<li>Competitive Pricing – Best value on the Samsung S22 Ultra price UK.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>At iRepair Mobiles UK, customer satisfaction comes first. Every device undergoes strict testing protocols, so you receive only the best quality.</p>\n<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Model: Samsung Galaxy S22 Ultra</li>\n<li>Condition: Different options</li>\n<li>Storage: Different options</li>\n<li>RAM: 8GB</li>\n<li>Processor: Exynos 2200, 4nm chipset</li>\n<li>Display: 6.8-inch QHD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X, 120Hz</li>\n<li>Cameras: 108MP + 12MP + 10MP + 10MP rear, 40MP front</li>\n<li>Video: 8K 24FPS, 4K 60FPS</li>\n<li>Battery: 5000mAh, fast charging + wireless</li>\n<li>S-Pen: Integrated, with remote functionality</li>\n<li>OS: Android 12 (upgradeable, 5 years software updates)</li>\n<li>Connectivity: 5G, LTE, NFC, Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.2</li>\n<li>Unlocked: Compatible with all UK and global networks</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\n<p><strong>Q1: Is the Samsung Galaxy S22 Ultra unlocked?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, this model is fully unlocked and compatible with all UK and international network providers.</p>\n<p><strong>Q2: What does “(A Grade)” mean?</strong></p>\n<p>“A Grade” means the phone is in pristine, unused condition—like brand new—with original quality testing passed.</p>\n<p><strong>Q3: Does the phone come with a warranty?</strong></p>\n<p>Absolutely. Every purchase includes a 12-month warranty from iRepair Mobiles UK.</p>\n<p><strong>Q4: How much storage does the Galaxy S22 Ultra have?</strong></p>\n<p>This model includes 128GB, 256GB, 512GB, and 1TB.</p>\n<p><strong>Q5: Does the Samsung Galaxy S22 Ultra support memory expansion?</strong></p>\n<p>No, this model does not include a microSD slot. However, you can use Microsoft OneDrive or Google Cloud for secure storage.</p>\n<p><strong>Q6: Is the S-Pen included?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, unlike previous Galaxy S models, the S22 Ultra includes a built-in S-Pen.</p>\n<p><strong>Q7: How does the battery perform?</strong></p>\n<p>The 5000mAh battery easily lasts a full day with normal to heavy usage. It supports both fast charging and wireless charging.</p>\n<p><strong>Q8: Does it support 5G?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the Samsung Galaxy S22 Ultra 5G offers lightning-fast speeds for browsing, streaming, and downloads.</p>\n<p><strong>Q9: What colours are available?</strong></p>\n<p>Popular options include Phantom Black, Phantom White, Burgundy, and Green (availability may vary).</p>\n<p><strong>Q10: What makes buying from iRepair Mobiles UK better than other shops?</strong></p>\n<p>We provide competitive UK prices, free next-day delivery, expert customer service, and strict quality checks, making us one of the best phone shops in the UK.</p>\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/samsung/\">Samsung</a> Galaxy S22 Ultra is more than just a phone—it’s the perfect blend of innovation, power, and elegance. Whether you’re a business professional, content creator, or casual user, it’s designed to deliver outstanding performance in every situation.</p>\n<p>By shopping at iRepair Mobiles UK, you’ll enjoy great value, trusted service, and unbeatable convenience. Don’t miss your chance to own one of the best smartphones of 2022 that still holds its crown today.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk/\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
