    "longDescription": "<h2>Unlock Premium Performance with a iPhone 11 – Affordable, Reliable &amp; Unlocked</h2>\n<p>Looking for a high-quality smartphone that delivers flagship features without the hefty price tag? The iPhone 11 is your perfect match! At iRepair Mobiles UK, we offer certified pre-owned iPhone 11 devices that are meticulously inspected, fully unlocked, and ready to empower your daily life. Whether you’re upgrading, switching networks, or seeking a budget-friendly Apple experience, this device combines cutting-edge technology with unbeatable value.</p>\n<h3>Why Choose a iPhone 11?</h3>\n<p>The iPhone 11 remains a standout choice in Apple’s lineup, even years after its release. Opting for a iPhone 11 means enjoying flagship-tier performance, stunning camera capabilities, and iOS smoothness at a fraction of the original cost. Here’s why it’s a crowd favorite:</p>\n<ol start=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Unbeatable Price-to-Performance Ratio</strong><br />\nWhen you compare the iPhone 11 used price to newer models, the savings are staggering. With prices starting as low as £190, this device offers exceptional value. For UK shoppers, the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">iPhone</a> 11 price UK is especially appealing, making premium tech accessible to all.</li>\n<li><strong>Future-Proof Performance</strong><br />\nPowered by Apple’s A13 Bionic chip, the iPhone 11 handles everything from multitasking to gaming with ease. This processor is still faster than many mid-range 2023 Android devices, ensuring smooth performance for years.</li>\n<li><strong>Stunning Dual-Camera System</strong><br />\nCapture life’s moments in vivid detail with the 12MP dual-camera setup. Features like Night Mode, 4K video, and Ultra-Wide shots let you unleash your creativity.</li>\n<li><strong>All-Day Battery Life</strong><br />\nWith its robust battery, the iPhone 11 easily lasts a full day, even with heavy use.</li>\n<li><strong>Eco-Friendly Choice</strong><br />\nChoosing a refurbished iPhone 11 reduces e-waste, making it a sustainable option for eco-conscious buyers.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n<h3>Key Features of the iPhone 11</h3>\n<p><strong>1. Brilliant Liquid Retina Display</strong><br />\nThe 6.1-inch Liquid Retina display offers sharp, vibrant visuals for streaming, browsing, and gaming. True Tone technology adjusts colors to your environment, reducing eye strain.</p>\n<p><strong>2. iOS 17 &amp; Beyond</strong><br />\nDespite being a pre-owned model, the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">iPhone 11</a> supports the latest iOS updates, ensuring access to new features and security patches.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Durable Design</strong><br />\nWith an IP68 rating for water and dust resistance, this device is built to withstand daily wear and tear.</p>\n<p><strong>4. Unlocked Flexibility</strong><br />\nOur <strong>iPhone 11</strong> devices are fully unlocked, meaning you can use them with any UK network provider—EE, O2, Vodafone, or Three.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Certified Quality at <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a></strong><br />\nEvery <strong>iPhone 11 Used</strong> sold by us undergoes a 30-point inspection:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Battery health above 80%</li>\n<li>Original Apple components</li>\n<li>No hidden defects or water damage</li>\n<li>Factory reset with genuine iOS reinstallation</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3>iPhone 11 Used Price: What to Expect in the UK</h3>\n<p>Wondering about the <strong>iPhone 11 price used</strong>? At iRepair Mobiles UK, our pricing is transparent and competitive. Depending on storage (64GB, 128GB, or 256GB) and condition (like-new, minor scratches), the <strong>iPhone 11 used price</strong> ranges from £190 to £310. Compared to the original £729 launch price, this is a steal!</p>\n<p><strong>Why Our iPhone 11 Price UK Used Stands Out</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Warranty Included</strong>: Enjoy 12 months of warranty for peace of mind.</li>\n<li><strong>Free Accessories</strong>: Choose from a charger, case, or screen protector.</li>\n<li><strong>Price Match Guarantee</strong>: Found it cheaper elsewhere? We’ll match it!</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h3>\n<p>As the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\"><strong>Best Mobile Phone &amp; Accessories Shop in the UK</strong></a>, we’re committed to quality and customer satisfaction. Here’s why thousands trust us:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Expert Refurbishment</strong>: Our technicians replace batteries, screens, and components with genuine parts.</li>\n<li><strong>Rigorous Testing</strong>: Every device passes performance, connectivity, and camera checks.</li>\n<li><strong>Ethical Practices</strong>: No hidden fees or misleading listings.</li>\n<li><strong>Same-Day Delivery</strong>: Available across the UK.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3>Caring for Your Used iPhone 11</h3>\n<p>Maximize your device’s lifespan with these tips:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use a screen protector and case.</li>\n<li>Avoid extreme temperatures.</li>\n<li>Update iOS regularly.</li>\n<li>Optimize battery health by avoiding full discharges.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3>Conclusion: Smart Savings, Uncompromised Quality</h3>\n<p>The <strong>iPhone 11 Used</strong> is a testament to Apple’s enduring quality. With its powerful specs, stunning camera, and affordable <strong>iPhone 11 price used</strong>, it’s ideal for students, professionals, and casual users alike. At iRepair Mobiles UK, we take pride in offering devices that look and perform like new, backed by warranties and exceptional service.</p>\n<p><strong>Ready to Upgrade?</strong><br />\nDon’t miss out on this incredible deal! Browse our inventory of <strong>used iPhone 11</strong> models today and experience premium tech at a fraction of the cost. Visit <strong>iRepair Mobiles UK</strong> now—your trusted partner for affordable, <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">reliable smartphones</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk\"><strong>Follow us on Instagram!</strong></a></p>\n"
