    "longDescription": "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Get premium Apple performance without paying the price of a brand-new iPhone. The iPhone 12 Refurbished combines a sharp 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display, A14 Bionic performance, 5G connectivity and a capable dual-camera system in a slim, premium design.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">At iRepair Mobiles UK, every refurbished <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">iPhone</a> is checked before sale, giving you a more reliable alternative to buying an untested second-hand handset. Each device is unlocked, so you can use it with your preferred UK network.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose a Refurbished iPhone 12?</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 12 still offers the features most people actually need from a modern smartphone. Its A14 Bionic chip handles everyday apps, multitasking, streaming and gaming with ease, while 5G provides faster connectivity where supported.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Buying refurbished also gives you access to Apple's premium hardware at a lower price than buying new.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Key benefits include:</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>6.1-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display</li>\n<li>A14 Bionic chip</li>\n<li>5G connectivity</li>\n<li>Dual 12MP Wide and Ultra Wide cameras</li>\n<li>Night mode and 4K Dolby Vision video</li>\n<li>Face ID</li>\n<li>MagSafe and Qi wireless charging</li>\n<li>Ceramic Shield front</li>\n<li>IP68 water and dust resistance</li>\n<li>Fully unlocked for UK networks</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Super Retina XDR OLED Display</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The 6.1-inch OLED display delivers rich colours, deep blacks and sharp detail at a 2532 x 1170 resolution. Whether you are watching videos, browsing, editing photos or gaming, the screen remains one of the iPhone 12's strongest features.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">If you are upgrading from an iPhone XR or another older LCD model, the difference is immediately noticeable.</p>\n<h2>A14 Bionic Performance + 5G</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The A14 Bionic chip gives the <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">iPhone</a> 12 enough power for demanding apps, multitasking and mobile gaming. Combined with 5G, it remains a fast and dependable everyday phone.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">You also get longer-term value from Apple's iOS ecosystem, including supported software and security updates.</p>\n<h2>Dual 12MP Cameras</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The rear camera system features a 12MP Wide camera and 12MP Ultra Wide camera. Night mode improves low-light photography, while 4K Dolby Vision video gives you more flexibility when recording high-quality footage.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">It is a particularly good option if you want a capable camera without paying for a newer Pro model.</p>\n<h2>Refurbished iPhone 12: Condition &amp; Battery</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Refurbished devices have previously been owned, so cosmetic condition can vary. iRepair Mobiles UK provides condition options so you can choose according to your budget and expectations.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Battery health can also vary between devices. Rather than assuming every refurbished iPhone has a new battery, check the specific product listing for the battery information provided.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">This is important when comparing a cheap iPhone 12 refurb with a professionally prepared device.</p>\n<h2>Storage &amp; Colours</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The refurbished iPhone 12 is available in selected configurations depending on stock:</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Storage:</strong> 64GB, 128GB and 256GB</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Colours:</strong> Black, White, Blue, Green, Purple and Product Red</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">For most users, 128GB offers the best balance between price and storage.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy From iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Buying an Apple iPhone 12 refurbished from a specialist retailer gives you more confidence than purchasing an untested private-sale handset.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Your purchase includes:</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Fully unlocked iPhone 12</li>\n<li>Professionally checked device</li>\n<li>Condition grading</li>\n<li>12-month warranty</li>\n<li>30-day returns</li>\n<li>UK delivery options</li>\n<li>Customer support from iRepair Mobiles UK</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Always check the individual product listing for the exact specification, condition, battery information and current availability.</p>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>Is the refurbished iPhone 12 unlocked?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. The iPhone 12 is unlocked, allowing you to use it with compatible UK networks.</p>\n<h3>Is the iPhone 12 still worth buying?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. Its OLED display, A14 Bionic chip, 5G, MagSafe and strong cameras make it a practical choice for buyers who want premium features without paying for the latest iPhone.</p>\n<h3>What battery health will I get?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Battery health varies by device. Check the specific listing for the battery information before purchasing.</p>\n<h3>Does it support 5G?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. The iPhone 12 supports 5G on compatible networks and in areas with 5G coverage.</p>\n<h3>Which storage should I choose?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">64GB suits lighter users. 128GB is the best all-round option for most buyers. 256GB is better if you store lots of photos, videos and apps.</p>\n<h3>Does it come with a warranty?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. iRepair Mobiles UK provides a 12-month warranty with the iPhone 12 refurbished range.</p>\n<h3>Can I return it?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. The current product offering includes a 30-day returns period, subject to the retailer's terms.</p>\n<h2>Buy Refurbished iPhone 12 UK</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">If you want a premium Apple phone at a more sensible price, the iPhone 12 Refurbished remains a strong option. You get OLED display technology, A14 Bionic performance, 5G, MagSafe and capable cameras without paying the cost of a new flagship.</p>\n<p>Choose your storage, colour and condition, then order your unlocked refurbished iPhone 12 from <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>.</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/irepair-mobiles\">Follow for More!</a></strong></p>\n"
