    "longDescription": "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Looking for a premium iPhone without paying flagship prices? The iPhone 11 Pro Refurbished offers an excellent combination of performance, camera quality, OLED display and premium design at a more affordable price.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">At iRepair Mobiles UK, every <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">refurbished phone</a> is checked and tested before sale, giving you a reliable and cost-effective alternative to buying brand new.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy an iPhone 11 Pro Refurbished?</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 11 Pro remains a strong choice for everyday use thanks to Apple's A13 Bionic chip, premium OLED display and versatile triple-camera system. It handles social media, streaming, browsing, multitasking and gaming smoothly.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Choosing a refurbished iPhone 11 Pro also lets you enjoy Apple's Pro features while spending less than you would on a newer model.</p>\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>5.8-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display</li>\n<li>A13 Bionic chip</li>\n<li>64GB, 256GB and 512GB storage</li>\n<li>Triple 12MP Wide, Ultra Wide and Telephoto cameras</li>\n<li>Night Mode and Portrait Mode</li>\n<li>4K video recording up to 60fps</li>\n<li>Face ID</li>\n<li>IP68 water and dust resistance</li>\n<li>Fast and wireless charging</li>\n<li>4G LTE, Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.0</li>\n<li>Premium stainless steel and textured glass design</li>\n<li>Unlocked for flexible network use</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Triple-Camera Photography</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 11 Pro features three 12MP rear cameras: Wide, Ultra Wide and Telephoto. This gives you greater flexibility for everyday photography, landscapes, portraits and zoomed-in shots.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Night Mode helps capture better low-light photos, while 4K video recording delivers high-quality footage for social media and everyday memories.</p>\n<h2>Super Retina XDR OLED Display</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The 5.8-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display delivers deep blacks, vibrant colours and excellent contrast. HDR support and True Tone make it a great choice for watching videos, browsing photos and everyday use.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Its compact size also makes the iPhone 11 Pro comfortable to handle.</p>\n<h2>Refurbished vs Used iPhone 11 Pro</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A used iPhone 11 Pro may simply be resold by its previous owner. A professionally refurbished device should be inspected and tested before resale.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">When buying a <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">second hand iPhone</a> 11 Pro, check the phone's battery condition, cosmetic grade, functionality, warranty and whether it is unlocked.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">At iRepair Mobiles UK, our refurbished phones are checked before being listed, helping you shop with greater confidence.</p>\n<h2>Storage and Colours</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 11 Pro is available in:</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Storage:</strong> 64GB, 256GB and 512GB</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Colours:</strong> Midnight Green, Space Gray, Silver and Gold</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Choose a larger storage capacity if you regularly take photos, record videos or keep many apps and files on your phone.</p>\n<h2>Battery and Charging</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 11 Pro supports fast charging and Qi wireless charging. Actual battery performance depends on usage, network conditions and the individual device's battery condition.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">When buying refurbished, always check the battery information provided for the specific handset.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy From iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">iRepair Mobiles UK provides refurbished phones for customers looking for quality devices at competitive UK prices.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">You can expect:</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Tested and inspected devices</li>\n<li>Unlocked phones</li>\n<li>Competitive pricing</li>\n<li>Clear product information</li>\n<li>Warranty protection</li>\n<li>UK-based mobile phone expertise</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>Is the iPhone 11 Pro still worth buying?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. Its A13 Bionic chip, OLED display and triple-camera system remain capable for everyday tasks. A refurbished model can offer particularly good value.</p>\n<h3>Is the iPhone 11 Pro unlocked?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. This model is sold unlocked, allowing you to use it with compatible networks.</p>\n<h3>Does the iPhone 11 Pro have an OLED display?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. It features a 5.8-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display.</p>\n<h3>Does it support 5G?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">No. The iPhone 11 Pro supports 4G LTE. If you need 5G, consider a newer iPhone.</p>\n<h3>Does it have Face ID?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. Face ID provides secure device unlocking and authentication.</p>\n<h3>How many cameras does it have?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">It has three rear 12MP cameras: Wide, Ultra Wide and Telephoto.</p>\n<h3>Is a refurbished iPhone 11 Pro better than a normal used phone?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A professionally refurbished phone is generally a safer purchase because it should undergo inspection and functional testing. However, always check the seller's specific refurbishment and warranty terms.</p>\n<h3>Where can I buy an iPhone 11 Pro for sale in the UK?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">You can browse the available iPhone 11 Pro for sale at iRepair Mobiles UK and compare storage, condition and pricing.</p>\n<h2>Buy Your Refurbished iPhone 11 Pro</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 11 Pro Refurbished remains a great option if you want premium Apple features without the cost of a new flagship. With its A13 Bionic chip, Super Retina XDR OLED display and triple-camera system, it delivers strong everyday performance and excellent value.</p>\n<p>Shop <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a> today and find the refurbished iPhone 11 Pro that suits your budget and needs.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/irepair-mobiles\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
