    "longDescription": "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Looking for a compact iPhone with premium performance at a lower price? Our iPhone 12 Mini Refurbished range gives you Apple's powerful A14 Bionic chip, 5G connectivity, Super Retina XDR OLED display and dual 12MP cameras without the cost of a brand-new device.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Every refurbished iPhone 12 Mini is professionally checked, tested and data-wiped before sale. Available in multiple storage capacities and cosmetic conditions, it is an excellent choice for customers who want a reliable, unlocked Apple smartphone at great value.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the iPhone 12 Mini?</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">iPhone</a> 12 Mini delivers flagship-level features in a compact 5.4-inch design. At just 135g, it is comfortable to hold, easy to carry and ideal for one-handed use.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Key features include:</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li><strong>5.4-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Apple A14 Bionic chip</strong></li>\n<li><strong>5G connectivity</strong></li>\n<li><strong>12MP Main + 12MP Ultra-Wide cameras</strong></li>\n<li><strong>12MP TrueDepth front camera with Face ID</strong></li>\n<li><strong>MagSafe and wireless charging</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Up to 15 hours of video playback</strong></li>\n<li><strong>IP68 water and dust resistance</strong></li>\n<li><strong>64GB, 128GB and 256GB storage options</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Whether you need a dependable everyday phone, a compact travel <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">device</a> or an affordable upgrade, the refurbished iPhone 12 Mini offers an excellent balance of performance, portability and price.</p>\n<h2>iPhone 12 Mini Specifications</h2>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Feature</th>\n<th>Specification</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Display</td>\n<td>5.4\" Super Retina XDR OLED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Resolution</td>\n<td>2340 × 1080 pixels</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Processor</td>\n<td>Apple A14 Bionic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAM</td>\n<td>4GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storage</td>\n<td>64GB / 128GB / 256GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rear Camera</td>\n<td>12MP Main + 12MP Ultra-Wide</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Front Camera</td>\n<td>12MP TrueDepth</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Video</td>\n<td>Up to 4K at 60fps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Connectivity</td>\n<td>5G, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Charging</td>\n<td>Lightning, MagSafe, Qi Wireless</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dimensions</td>\n<td>131.5 × 64.2 × 7.4mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weight</td>\n<td>135g</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Design &amp; Display</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 12 Mini features a sleek aluminium frame, glass back and Ceramic Shield front. Its 5.4-inch OLED display delivers sharp detail, rich contrast and vibrant colours with support for HDR, Dolby Vision and True Tone.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Its compact dimensions make it significantly easier to handle than larger iPhone models while retaining the premium design associated with Apple's iPhone 12 range.</p>\n<h2>Performance &amp; Camera</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Powered by the A14 Bionic chip, the iPhone 12 Mini handles everyday apps, multitasking, streaming and gaming smoothly.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Its dual-camera system combines a 12MP Wide camera with a 12MP Ultra-Wide camera, supporting Night Mode, optical image stabilisation and 4K video recording. The TrueDepth front camera provides high-quality selfies and Face ID security.</p>\n<h2>Available Colours &amp; Storage</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 12 Mini was originally available in:</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Black, White, Product Red, Green, Blue and Purple.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Storage options include 64GB, 128GB and 256GB. Available colours, storage capacities and grades depend on current stock.</p>\n<h2>Refurbished iPhone 12 Mini Conditions</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Our refurbished devices may be available in different cosmetic grades.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Grade A:</strong> Excellent cosmetic condition with minimal signs of previous use.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Grade B:</strong> Light visible signs of use, such as minor scratches or marks.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Grade C:</strong> More noticeable cosmetic wear, while remaining fully functional.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Cosmetic grading does not mean compromised performance. Each device should be checked against its individual product listing for its exact condition and inclusions.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy a Refurbished iPhone 12 Mini?</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A refurbished iPhone 12 Mini is an affordable alternative to buying new. You get access to Apple's premium hardware, 5G connectivity and OLED technology while spending less.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Buying refurbished can also help extend the useful life of existing technology and reduce unnecessary electronic waste.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">If you are searching for a cheapest 2nd hand iPhone, do not focus on price alone. A professionally tested refurbished device with clear warranty coverage offers considerably more reassurance than an untested private-sale phone.</p>\n<h2>iPhone 12 Mini Refurbished UK</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we make buying a refurbished Apple phone straightforward. Our devices are checked before sale, giving you greater confidence when choosing a second-hand iPhone.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Whether you are upgrading from an older model or simply want a smaller smartphone, the iPhone 12 Mini refurbished UK range offers excellent value for money.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Choose your preferred storage and condition from our available stock and order your unlocked iPhone today.</p>\n<h2>FAQs</h2>\n<h3>Is the refurbished iPhone 12 Mini worth buying?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. Its A14 Bionic chip, OLED display, 5G, capable cameras and compact design make it a strong choice for everyday use at a lower price than newer iPhones.</p>\n<h3>Is the iPhone 12 Mini unlocked?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. Our listed iPhone 12 Mini is sold unlocked, allowing you to use it with compatible UK networks.</p>\n<h3>Does the iPhone 12 Mini have a headphone jack?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">No. It does not include a 3.5mm headphone jack. You can use wireless headphones or compatible Lightning headphones and adapters.</p>\n<h3>What storage options are available?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 12 Mini is available in 64GB, 128GB and 256GB, subject to current stock.</p>\n<h3>What does refurbished mean?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A refurbished phone is a previously owned device that has been professionally inspected, tested, cleaned and prepared for resale. It provides an alternative to buying an untested second-hand phone.</p>\n<h3>What is the difference between Grade A, B and C?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The grades indicate cosmetic condition. Grade A has the least visible wear, Grade B may have minor signs of use, while Grade C can have more noticeable scratches or marks.</p>\n<h3>Does it come with a warranty?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Warranty coverage depends on the specific product listing. Please check the product page for the current warranty terms before ordering.</p>\n<h3>Where can I buy an iPhone 12 Mini Refurbished?</h3>\n<p>You can shop our iPhone 12 Mini Refurbished range at iRepair Mobiles UK. Choose your preferred storage and cosmetic condition from the available options and order online.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/irepair-mobiles\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
