    "longDescription": "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Looking for a reliable Apple phone without paying the price of a brand-new iPhone? The iPhone 11 Refurbished is an excellent choice for everyday use, combining strong performance, a capable camera system and Apple's familiar premium design at a more affordable price.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, our refurbished iPhone 11 handsets are checked before sale to ensure key functions work properly. Available as an unlocked device, the iPhone 11 refurbished UK is an ideal choice for customers looking for quality, value and flexibility.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the iPhone 11 Refurbished?</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 11 remains a popular choice because its A13 Bionic chip delivers smooth performance for everyday tasks, social media, streaming, photography, gaming and browsing.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">You also get a 6.1-inch Liquid Retina HD display, Face ID, wireless charging and a dual-camera system with Wide and Ultra Wide lenses. Apple currently lists the iPhone 11 as compatible with iOS 26, helping it remain a practical option for buyers seeking an affordable iPhone.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Buying an iphone 11 refurb can also save you considerably compared with purchasing a newer model, without giving up the core Apple experience.</p>\n<h2>iPhone 11 Key Features</h2>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>A13 Bionic chip for fast, efficient performance</li>\n<li>6.1-inch Liquid Retina HD display</li>\n<li>Dual 12MP Wide and Ultra Wide cameras</li>\n<li>Night Mode and Portrait Mode</li>\n<li>4K video recording</li>\n<li>Face ID and TrueDepth camera</li>\n<li>Wireless and fast charging</li>\n<li>IP68 water and dust resistance</li>\n<li>64GB, 128GB and 256GB storage options</li>\n<li>Unlocked and SIM-free</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Performance That Still Delivers</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The A13 Bionic chip was designed for flagship-level performance and remains capable of handling everyday apps, multitasking, gaming and media without making the phone feel outdated.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">For customers who do not need the newest processor or latest design, a reconditioned iPhone 11 offers an attractive balance between performance and price.</p>\n<h2>Dual Camera System</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 11 features a dual 12MP rear camera system with Wide and Ultra Wide lenses. Night Mode helps improve low-light photography, while Portrait Mode adds depth effects to compatible photos.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">You can also record 4K video, making the iPhone 11 a practical option for social media, family photography and everyday content creation.</p>\n<h2>Display, Design &amp; Face ID</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The 6.1-inch Liquid Retina HD LCD provides sharp and vibrant visuals for streaming, browsing and gaming. The glass and aluminium design gives the phone a premium feel while keeping it comfortable to use.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Face ID provides fast facial authentication for <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">unlocking your phone</a>, accessing supported apps and making secure payments.</p>\n<h2>Choose Your Storage</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The <strong>refurbished iPhone 11</strong> is available in three storage capacities, depending on stock:</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Storage</th>\n<th>Best For</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>64GB</strong></td>\n<td>Everyday users and cloud storage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>128GB</strong></td>\n<td>Most users and regular photography</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>256GB</strong></td>\n<td>Heavy photo, video and app users</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Choose the storage that matches how you use your phone. If you regularly record videos or keep a large photo library, 128GB or 256GB is the safer choice.</p>\n<h2>Refurbished vs Second-Hand iPhone 11</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A refurbished phone is not simply a random second-hand handset.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A professionally refurbished device is inspected and tested before being offered for sale. This gives you greater confidence in essential functions such as the display, cameras, charging, speakers, buttons and connectivity.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">With an unlocked refurbished iPhone, you can also choose the compatible UK network that suits you.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy from iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">At iRepair Mobiles UK, we specialise in mobile phones and repairs, giving us practical experience with the devices we sell.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">When purchasing your Apple refurbished phone, you can expect:</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Professionally checked devices</li>\n<li>Unlocked handsets</li>\n<li>Competitive UK prices</li>\n<li>Quality-focused refurbishment</li>\n<li>Warranty protection</li>\n<li>UK customer support</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Always check the individual product listing for the exact cosmetic condition, battery information, warranty and accessories included.</p>\n<h2>iPhone 11 Specifications</h2>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Specification</td>\n<td>Details</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Display</td>\n<td>6.1-inch Liquid Retina HD LCD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Processor</td>\n<td>Apple A13 Bionic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rear Cameras</td>\n<td>Dual 12MP Wide + Ultra Wide</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Front Camera</td>\n<td>TrueDepth 12MP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Video</td>\n<td>Up to 4K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Face ID</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Charging</td>\n<td>Fast &amp; Wireless Charging</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>IP68</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storage</td>\n<td>64GB / 128GB / 256GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Network</td>\n<td>Unlocked</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Connector</td>\n<td>Lightning</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>Is the refurbished iPhone 11 unlocked?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. This iPhone 11 is sold unlocked, allowing you to use a compatible SIM from your preferred UK network.</p>\n<h3>Is the iPhone 11 still worth buying?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. Its A13 Bionic chip, capable cameras, Face ID and continued iOS compatibility make it a strong budget-friendly iPhone.</p>\n<h3>Does the iPhone 11 have 5G?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">No. The iPhone 11 supports 4G LTE. For 5G connectivity, consider an iPhone 12 or newer.</p>\n<h3>Does the iPhone 11 have an OLED display?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">No. The standard iPhone 11 uses a 6.1-inch Liquid Retina HD LCD. The iPhone 11 Pro and Pro Max use OLED displays.</p>\n<h3>What storage options are available?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 11 comes in 64GB, 128GB and 256GB versions, subject to available refurbished stock.</p>\n<h3>Does it support Face ID?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. Face ID is included through the TrueDepth camera system.</p>\n<h3>Is the iPhone 11 water resistant?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">It has an IP68 rating under controlled laboratory conditions. However, water resistance can decrease with normal use and should not be considered permanent.</p>\n<h3>Is buying a refurbished iPhone 11 better than buying second-hand?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A professionally refurbished phone provides additional confidence because it has been inspected and tested before sale, unlike an unverified private second-hand purchase.</p>\n<h2>Buy Your iPhone 11 Refurbished Today</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">If you want an <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">affordable Apple smartphone</a> that still delivers reliable everyday performance, the iPhone 11 Refurbished is a smart choice.</p>\n<p>Choose your preferred storage and condition from iRepair Mobiles UK and get the Apple experience for less than buying a brand-new iPhone.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/irepair-mobiles\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
