    "longDescription": "<h2>iPhone XS Refurbished - Unlocked</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Looking for a premium Apple phone without paying the price of a newer model? The iPhone XS Refurbished - Unlocked is a smart choice for everyday use, combining a compact design, Super Retina OLED display, A12 Bionic performance and a capable dual-camera system.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">At iRepair Mobiles UK, our refurbished phones are carefully checked before sale, helping you buy with greater confidence while saving money compared with purchasing a new iPhone.</p>\n<h2>iPhone XS Refurbished Key Features</h2>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Specification</th>\n<th>Details</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Model</td>\n<td>Apple iPhone XS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Condition</td>\n<td>Refurbished</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Network</td>\n<td>Unlocked</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Display</td>\n<td>5.8-inch Super Retina OLED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Processor</td>\n<td>Apple A12 Bionic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rear Camera</td>\n<td>Dual 12MP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Front Camera</td>\n<td>7MP TrueDepth</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Security</td>\n<td>Face ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storage</td>\n<td>64GB, 256GB, 512GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Colours</td>\n<td>Gold, Silver, Space Grey</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Charging</td>\n<td>Lightning &amp; Qi Wireless Charging</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Network</td>\n<td>4G LTE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>IP68</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weight</td>\n<td>177g</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Premium 5.8-Inch OLED Display</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone XS Refurbished features a 5.8-inch Super Retina OLED display with HDR, True Tone and Wide Colour P3. It delivers sharp text, rich colours and strong contrast for browsing, streaming, photography and social media.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Its compact size also makes the iPhone XS comfortable to hold and easy to carry.</p>\n<h2>Powerful A12 Bionic Chip</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">Apple</a> A12 Bionic chip provides smooth performance for everyday tasks. Browse the web, use social media, stream content, manage emails, navigate with maps and run compatible apps without needing to spend more on a newer flagship.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The integrated Neural Engine also supports Apple's machine-learning features and computational photography.</p>\n<h2>Dual 12MP Camera System</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Capture detailed photos with the dual 12MP rear camera system. The wide and telephoto lenses support features such as:</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Portrait Mode</li>\n<li>Smart HDR</li>\n<li>2x optical zoom</li>\n<li>Optical image stabilisation</li>\n<li>Depth Control</li>\n<li>4K video recording</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The 7MP TrueDepth front camera is also suitable for selfies, Face ID and video calls.</p>\n<h2>Unlocked iPhone XS</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">This refurbished iPhone XS is unlocked, giving you flexibility when choosing a compatible SIM or mobile network.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Whether you are replacing an older phone or want an affordable Apple device without a contract, an unlocked handset gives you more freedom to choose your preferred network.</p>\n<h2>Refurbished iPhone XS: Better Value</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Buying <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">refurbished</a> can be a practical way to access premium Apple technology for less. Instead of paying the higher price of a newer iPhone, you can choose an earlier flagship that still delivers a strong combination of performance, camera quality and display technology.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A refurbished phone is pre-owned and may show cosmetic signs of previous use depending on its condition grade. Always check the individual product listing for the exact condition, battery information, storage and accessories supplied.</p>\n<h2>Storage Options</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone XS was available with 64GB, 256GB and 512GB storage.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Choose 64GB for lighter everyday use, while 256GB or 512GB is better if you regularly store large photo libraries, videos, apps and other files directly on your phone.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy From iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">iRepair Mobiles UK specialises in mobile phones, repairs and accessories. Our refurbished devices provide customers with a more affordable alternative to buying new.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Before ordering, check the product listing for the current condition, storage capacity, colour, warranty, returns information and included accessories.</p>\n<h2>iPhone XS Refurbished FAQs</h2>\n<h3>Is the refurbished iPhone XS unlocked?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. This iPhone XS is sold unlocked, allowing you to use it with a compatible UK network.</p>\n<h3>Is the iPhone XS still worth buying?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes, if you want an affordable Apple phone with an OLED display, Face ID, capable cameras and reliable everyday performance. It does not support 5G, so newer models are better if 5G is essential.</p>\n<h3>Does the iPhone XS have Face ID?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. Face ID provides secure unlocking and authentication using the TrueDepth camera system.</p>\n<h3>Does the iPhone XS support wireless charging?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. The iPhone XS supports Qi-compatible wireless charging as well as Lightning charging.</p>\n<h3>Is the iPhone XS waterproof?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The original iPhone XS has an IP68 rating for water and dust resistance. However, water resistance can reduce over time and after repairs or damage, so it should not be deliberately submerged.</p>\n<h3>What storage capacities are available?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone XS was released in 64GB, 256GB and 512GB versions. Availability depends on current refurbished stock.</p>\n<h3>What colours are available?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone XS was originally available in Gold, Silver and Space Grey. Available colours depend on stock.</p>\n<h3>What comes with a refurbished iPhone XS?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Included accessories can vary. Check the individual iRepair Mobiles UK product listing for the current box contents.</p>\n<h2>Buy iPhone XS Refurbished From iRepair Mobiles UK</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone XS Refurbished - Unlocked offers an attractive balance of Apple design, OLED display quality, A12 Bionic performance, Face ID and dual-camera photography at a more accessible price.</p>\n<p>If you want a compact Apple smartphone without paying for the latest generation, check the current iPhone XS refurbished stock at <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a> and choose the storage and condition that best suits your budget.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/irepair-mobiles\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
