    "longDescription": "<h2>Refurbished iPhone XR​ – Unlocked – Premium Quality at an Affordable Price</h2>\n<p>Looking for a high-quality refurbished iPhone XR that performs like new without the hefty price tag? At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we offer refurbished iPhone XR​ models that have been professionally inspected, tested, and restored to ensure flawless performance. Whether you need a <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">reliable smartphone</a> for work, gaming, or everyday use, this unlocked iPhone XR delivers exceptional value.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose Our Refurbished iPhone XR?</h2>\n<h3>1. Premium Refurbished Quality</h3>\n<p>Our refurbished iPhone XR​ undergoes a strict 20-point inspection process, ensuring:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Like-new condition</strong> – Minimal signs of wear</li>\n<li><strong>Full functionality</strong> – No hardware or software issues</li>\n<li><strong>Battery health check</strong> – Optimized for long-lasting performance</li>\n<li><strong>Original parts</strong> – Genuine <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">Apple </a>components used where needed</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>2. Unlocked for Maximum Flexibility</h3>\n<p>This iPhone XR refurbished UK model is fully unlocked, meaning you can use it with any network provider—EE, O2, Vodafone, Three, or any other carrier. No restrictions, no hassle!</p>\n<h3>3. Powerful Performance with different Storage options</h3>\n<p>With different Storage options, you’ll have plenty of space for apps, photos, videos, and more. The iPhone XR refurbished runs on <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">Apple’s </a>A12 Bionic chip, ensuring smooth multitasking, fast gaming, and excellent battery efficiency.</p>\n<h3>4. Stunning Display &amp; Camera</h3>\n<p>Enjoy a 6.1-inch Liquid Retina HD display with True Tone technology for vibrant colors. The 12MP rear camera captures sharp, detailed photos, while the 7MP front camera is perfect for selfies and FaceTime calls.</p>\n<h3>5. Affordable Price with Warranty</h3>\n<p>Why pay full price for a new iPhone when you can get a refurbished iPhone XR that looks and works like new? Plus, we back our devices with a 12-month warranty for peace of mind.</p>\n<h2>FAQs – Your Questions Answered</h2>\n<p><strong>1. Is a refurbished iPhone XR worth buying?</strong><br />\nAbsolutely! A refurbished iPhone XR offers the same premium experience as a new one but at a fraction of the cost. Our devices are thoroughly tested, ensuring top performance.</p>\n<p><strong>2. What does \"A-Grade refurbished\" mean?</strong><br />\n\"A-Grade\" means the device is in excellent condition with very minor cosmetic wear (if any). It has been professionally restored to meet high-quality standards.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Does the refurbished iPhone XR come with a warranty?</strong><br />\nYes! We provide a 12-month warranty on all our refurbished iPhones XR, covering any hardware issues.</p>\n<p><strong>4. Is the battery replaced in a refurbished iPhone XR?</strong><br />\nEach device is tested for battery health. If the battery falls below 85% capacity, we replace it with a high-quality one to ensure long-lasting performance.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Can I use this iPhone XR with any UK network?</strong><br />\nYes! This is an unlocked iPhone XR, compatible with all major UK networks, including EE, O2, Vodafone, and Three.</p>\n<p><strong>6. What’s included in the box?</strong><br />\nYou’ll receive:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Refurbished iPhone XR</li>\n<li>Charging cable</li>\n<li>Power adapter (if selected)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>7. How is this different from a used iPhone XR?</strong><br />\nA used iPhone XR is sold as-is, with no checks or repairs. A refurbished iPhone XR is professionally restored, tested, and comes with a warranty.</p>\n<p><strong>8. How long does delivery take?</strong><br />\nWe offer fast UK shipping, with most orders arriving within 2-3 working days.</p>\n<h2>Why Trust iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p>At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we’re committed to providing top-quality refurbished iPhones with:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Transparent grading system</li>\n<li>Rigorous testing &amp; certification</li>\n<li>12-month warranty for buyer confidence</li>\n<li>Excellent customer support</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Get Your Refurbished iPhone XR Today!</h2>\n<p>Upgrade to a premium iPhone XR refurbished UK model without breaking the bank. With its powerful performance, stunning display, and reliable battery life, this is the perfect budget-friendly iPhone.</p>\n<p>Order now and enjoy:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fast UK delivery</li>\n<li>12-month warranty</li>\n<li>Trusted refurbished quality</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Shop the best refurbished iPhone XR deal at <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a> today!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://instagram.com/irepair.mobiles.uk\"><strong>Follow us on Instagram!</strong></a></p>\n"
