    "longDescription": "<h2>Refurbished iPhone 8 - Unlocked</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Looking for an affordable <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/iphones/\">Apple smartphone</a> that still handles everyday tasks with ease? The Refurbished iPhone 8 from <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a> is a smart choice for anyone who wants reliable performance, a compact design and genuine Apple features without paying the price of a newer iPhone.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Each device is professionally checked and tested before sale, so you can shop with confidence. The iPhone 8 is available unlocked and comes with a 12-month warranty, making it a practical option for calls, messages, social media, streaming, photography and everyday apps.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose the iPhone 8?</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 8 combines a compact 4.7-inch Retina HD display with Apple's A11 Bionic chip, Touch ID and a 12MP camera. Its glass back also supports Qi wireless charging.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A refurbished iPhone 8 is particularly suitable if you want:</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>A budget-friendly Apple smartphone</li>\n<li>A compact and easy-to-handle device</li>\n<li>Reliable everyday performance</li>\n<li>Touch ID and a physical Home button</li>\n<li>Wireless charging</li>\n<li>An unlocked phone for compatible UK networks</li>\n<li>A more affordable alternative to newer iPhones</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Buying refurbished can also help reduce electronic waste by giving an existing device a longer useful life.</p>\n<h2>iPhone 8 Specifications</h2>\n<h3>Design &amp; Display</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 8 measures 138.4 x 67.3 x 7.3 mm and weighs approximately 148g. It features an aluminium frame, glass front and glass back with a 4.7-inch Retina HD LCD display offering 1334 x 750 resolution, True Tone and wide colour support.</p>\n<h3>Performance</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Powered by the Apple A11 Bionic chip, the iPhone 8 offers smooth performance for browsing, messaging, social media, streaming and everyday apps. Storage options include 64GB, 128GB and 256GB, depending on availability.</p>\n<h3>Camera</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The 12MP rear camera features an f/1.8 aperture and optical image stabilisation. It supports 4K video recording. The 7MP front camera is suitable for selfies, video calls and social media.</p>\n<h3>Battery &amp; Charging</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Battery performance varies depending on battery health and usage. The iPhone 8 supports fast charging and Qi wireless charging.</p>\n<h3>Connectivity</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The device supports 4G LTE, Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac and Bluetooth 5.0.</p>\n<h2>Available Colours</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The iPhone 8 was released in:</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Space Grey</li>\n<li>Silver</li>\n<li>Gold</li>\n<li>Product RED</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Colour availability depends on current stock.</p>\n<h2>Refurbished iPhone 8 Condition</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Our refurbished iPhones are graded according to their cosmetic condition. Depending on availability, you may find:</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Pristine:</strong> Minimal signs of use and a very clean appearance.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Excellent:</strong> Minor cosmetic marks from previous use with no impact on performance.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Good:</strong> More noticeable scratches or small dents, while remaining fully functional.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Regardless of cosmetic grade, devices are tested before sale to ensure essential functions work correctly.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy From iRepair Mobiles UK?</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Buying a used iPhone 8 from an unknown seller can be risky. At <a href=\"https://irepair-mobiles.co.uk/product-category/mobile-phones/\">iRepair Mobiles UK</a>, we focus on giving customers a safer refurbished buying experience.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">You receive:</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Professionally tested device</li>\n<li>Unlocked iPhone 8</li>\n<li>12-month warranty</li>\n<li>Condition grading</li>\n<li>Quality checks</li>\n<li>Customer support</li>\n<li>Competitive refurbished prices</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">If you're comparing the iPhone 8 with newer refurbished iPhones such as the iPhone 11, iPhone 12 or iPhone 13, consider what you actually need. For basic smartphone use, the iPhone 8 can offer excellent value at a lower price.</p>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>Is the Refurbished iPhone 8 unlocked?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. Our listed iPhone 8 refurbished models are unlocked for use with compatible UK networks.</p>\n<h3>Is the iPhone 8 still worth buying?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes, if you need an affordable, compact phone for everyday tasks. However, customers wanting the latest features and longer-term support should consider newer iPhone models.</p>\n<h3>Does the iPhone 8 support wireless charging?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Yes. It supports Qi wireless charging.</p>\n<h3>Does it have a headphone jack?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">No. The iPhone 8 uses the Lightning connector rather than a traditional 3.5mm headphone jack.</p>\n<h3>What warranty do I get?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The Refurbished iPhone 8 comes with a 12-month warranty from iRepair Mobiles UK.</p>\n<h3>Is a refurbished iPhone better than a used iPhone?</h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A refurbished phone has typically been inspected and tested before resale, providing more reassurance than an untested secondhand device.</p>\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The Refurbished iPhone 8 is a strong option for anyone wanting an affordable Apple smartphone with a compact design, capable performance and useful features.</p>\n<p>If you're searching for the best deal for an iPhone 8, buying refurbished from iRepair Mobiles UK lets you save money while getting a tested, unlocked device backed by a 12-month warranty.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/irepair-mobiles\"><strong>Follow for More!</strong></a></p>\n"
